<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Kuman New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Matyu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matyu</para>
  <para style="mt">Matyu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Jisas kowanemo kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ka magigl paugwa i, Jisas Krais, God Kere Yugwa Yagle, kowane awamo meglkwa i, kagno epigl paugwa. Jisas, ye Devit gawamo ta moglkwa. Te, Devit we, ye Abraham gawamo ta moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abraham okna ibo yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Aisak we dugwa. Te, Aisak ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Jekop we dugwa. Te, Jekop ere mogl, yagl Juda ya ye agiglema mudu kuglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Ana Juda ebie Tamar bogl yagl gak suo kiurka, kagno Peres ya Sera we dibrika. Te, Peres ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Hesron we dugwa. Te, Hesron ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Ram we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Te, Ram ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Aminadap we dugwa. Te, Aminidap ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Nason we dugwa. Te, Nason ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Salmon we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Te, Salmon ere mogl, ebie Rahap bogl yagl gak ta kiurka, kagie Boas we dibrika. Te, Boas ere mogl, ebie Rut bogl yagl gak ta kiurka, kagie Obet we dibrika. Te, Obet ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Jesi we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Te, Jesi wam i, king Devit moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Ana king Devit ere mogl, ebie Batseba bogl yagl gak ta kiurka, kagie Solomon we dibrika. Batseba ye okna yagl ta Uria we digwa i ebie moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Te, Solomon ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Rehoboam we dugwa. Te, Rehoboam ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Abiya we dugwa. Te, Abiya ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Asa we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Te, Asa ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Jehosafat we dugwa. Te, Jehosafat ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Jehoram we dugwa. Te, Jehoram ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Usia we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Te, Usia ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Jotam we dugwa. Te, Jotam ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Ahas we dugwa. Te, Ahas ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Hesekia we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Te, Hesekia ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Manase we dugwa. Te, Manase ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Emon we dugwa. Te, Emon ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Josaia we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Te, Josaia ere mogl, Jehoiakin ya ye agiglema mudu kuglkwa. Ana igne i Babilon yoba ere mogl, Juda yoba mudu kuda bogl tedre, si kane si i pi dumo Babilon edigo, meglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Babilon yoba ye Juda yoba si kane si i pi dumo Babilon edigo, meglko, okuo Jehoiakin ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Sealtiel we dugwa. Te, Sealtiel ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Serubabel we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Te, Serubabel ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Abiut we dugwa. Te, Abiut ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Eliakim we dugwa. Te, Eliakim ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Asor we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Te, Asor ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Sadok we dugwa. Te, Sadok ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Akim we dugwa. Te, Akim ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Eliut we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Te, Eliut ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Eleasar we dugwa. Te, Eleasar ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Matan we dugwa. Te, Matan ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Jekop we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Te, Jekop ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Josep we dugwa. Josep kade moglkwa igne, ye abu Maria yugwa. Te, Maria we, ye Jisas kuglkwa. Jisas moglkwa i, nono ama God Kere Yugwa Yagl, Krais we dumga.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Yegl mere Abraham moglkwa ede u Devit mina ugwa igne, yugobuno 14-pela meglkwa. Te, Devit moglmara ede u Babilon yoba ye Juda yoba si kane si i pi dumo Babilon edigwa igne i yugobuno 14-pela ama meglkwa. Te, Babilon yoba ye Juda yoba si kane si i pi dumo Babilon edigwa igne i, ede u Krais mina ugwa igne, yugobuno 14-pela ama meglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maria Jisas kuglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Jisas Krais mam siragl mere ye kuglkwa i pre paugwa. Jisas mam Maria ya Josep bogl inabredi di padigl kodigwa. Di padigl kodigwa ba ye i swara edekrikwa igne, Mudu Murubuglo Maria yene dane panabedi eruko, dane paugo, yoba kanigwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Josep ebie Maria dane pamedi kandre, ye mabuno wakai boglsre, yagl du moglkwa pre ye sedinagledi prukwa. Yegl prukwa ba ta prukwa i, Na yoba gumuglno wagle sedinaglka i, Maria agai gogl, kagie kide i dinabedi ugl mage ere, sedinagledi, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" /><figure style="fig" alt="Gabriel comes to Joseph" file="FM 126 Gabriel Comes to Joseph_6inches_BW.tif" size="col" loc="1.20-25" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="1.20">Angelo ta Josep di tedre, Maria ene ebin morabedi yo dugwa</figure>Ye yegl eragledi kina gudu pre moglsre, ugl pai, ugl kubu ta kanugwa. Ye ugl kubu kanumara Yagl Kade angelomo ye moglmara udre, ye yegl di togwa, Josep yo, ene Devit gawamo ta motnga i, Maria ene ebin morabuka i, kudugl goglkro! Gak erme ye dane wagle moglkwa i, Mudu Murubuglo ye dane panabedi eruko, dane paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Ye gak ta kurabuka i, yagl gak ta kurabuka. Ye kuran, ene ye kagie Jisas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Grik wagle, kagie Jisas mabuno ta paugwa, God no ere yugwa.</char></note> we dinatniwa. I siragl pre ye yobama tadaglmeno kubun ere tedre, ye ere inabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ana taragl mudu yegl mere plau digwa i, okna ibo ka kep yagl ta Yagl Kade dra idre, dugwa i, mogo korabedi plau digwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />Ye kamo yegl paugwa, Ene prio! Abai ta ege swara ta kumugl yagl bogl paikraiglkwa i, dane panan, yagl gak ta kurabuka. Ye kuran, yoba yagl gak i kagie Emanuel we dinaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asaia 7.14</char></note> di, yegl dugwa. Ana kagie Emanuel i, mabuno ta paugwa, God nono munara moglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ana Josep we, ye ugl pai, aduglkwa igne, ye Yagl Kade angelomo ye di tomere ere, Maria ye ebie morabedi yugwa. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Yugwa ba igne i ede pi Maria yagl gak ikra kuglkwa igne i, ye bogl swara paikribrika. Bogl swara paikribriko, Maria yagl gak kuglko, Josep ye kagie Jisas yei togwa.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Yagl kade tau Jisas kanamnedi wigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Ana yagl ta kagie Herot we digwa i king moglkwa igne, Maria ere mogl, distrik Judia suna, dumo kebra Betlehem we dimara i, Jisas kuglkwa. Igne i, Yagl tau ade umara nem bitno podo paugo, kugl kuri kandre, nomane igwa yoba meglkwa i, ede Jerusalem udre, ye yoba tau yegl di prikwa, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Gak ta mam erme gak kuglkwa Juda yoba kingno moglkwa i aglo moglme? digwa. No ade umara kra munga igne, kugl kuri kor ta plau dugwa kandre, ye moglmedi diu pamedi pre, ye kagie kade tenamnedi umniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Yagl kade wagle i kira yegl pogl pre wan meglko, yoba tau ye ka digwa i prisre, king Herot di teigwa. Di teigo, Herot prisre, nomane podo sugwa. Ye nomane sugo, yoba mudu Jerusalem kipai meglkwa i ama nomane sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Ana Herot nomane sidre, ye tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba di makai sidre, kira yegl poglkwa, God Kere Yugwa Yagle Krais unabe digwa i, mam ye dumo aglo kurabe dime? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede te, yegl digwa, Ye mam dumo kebra Betlehem, distrik Judia suna i kurabe digwa. I siragl pre ka kep yoba ta yegl boglkwa,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />Dumo Betlehem we digwa, distrik Judia suna yogwa i, kagie paugwa. Dumo tau Judia suna ama kagno paigwa ba dumo Betlehem kagie kade paugwa. I siragl pre dumo i mina Yagl Kade ta udre, yoba sipsip sugl meglmere mere na yobanama Israel yoba sugl morabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maika 5.2-4</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 2:6">di, ka kep yoba yegl dumiwe di, di ikne ede teigwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Di ikne ede Herot di teigo, Herot yagl ade umara kra mogl wigwa ikra yene pere ekrike mogl, ka di pramnedi agle dugo, wigwa. Wigo, Herot ye kugl kuri pre digwa i aunake plau dumedi kira pogl prukwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Kira pogl prisre, yagl wagle i ede dumo Betlehem enaiglmedi dedidre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene ede pi gak kebra i, wakai ere doko kanio! Ene doko kandre, na moglmara u, ye aglo moglkwa i di naraiglkwa. Ene ede ikne u, di naribi, na ama pi, ye kagie kade tenaglka pre diwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9-10" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Wisemen offering gifts to Jisas" file="CN01632b.tif" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="2.9-10" />Ana yagl kade wagle i king kamo prisre, ede eigwa. Ye pi moglsre, kugl kuri ta ye okna ade umara kra moglsre, kanigwa ikra aglke kor kandre, gun podo kide kaima yeigwa. Gun podo kide kaima yeigo, kugl kuri i ede okna pidre, gak kebra pai moglmara mitna ibo pi pai moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Pai moglko, yagl wagle i ede yugugl pi, yagl gak mam Maria bogl miurko, kanigwa. Kandre, ye yage goglkono bodugl, bitno i pi makan mina yedre, yagl gak Jisas kagie kade teigwa. Kagie kade tedre, ye taragl mige podo boglkwa tau gre yuigwa i, i meda edidre, ye teigwa. Ye taragl tau teigwa i, gol ya ede suo nuglo demene wakai erukwa teigwa. Ede nuglo ta, kagie frankinsens we digwa. Te, ta, kagie myr we digwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ana ye taragl i Jisas tedre, ye ede ikne Herot moglmara pikre, konbo pere ta mina ede ikne yugunomugl eigwa. God okna ugl kubu mina ye di te, Ede ikne Herot moglmara pikrio! dugwa pre yegl erikwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep ebie Maria ya Jisas bogl ede kantri Isip eigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ana yagl wagle ikra ede eigo, Josep ugl pai, ugl kubu ta kanugwa. Ye ugl kubu kanumara, Yagl Kade angelomo ta ye moglmara udre, Josep di te, Ene adiglo! dugwa. Adiglsre, gak kebra i mam bogl idre, teke ede pi kantri Isip pio! dugwa. Ene dumo Isip pi pai meglbi, na okuo ene di tebo, aglke ede ikne unaiglkwa. I siragl pre, king Herot yagl gak Jisas si goragledi dokinabiwe di, angelo yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Angelo yegl dugwa pre Josep eduer suna adiglsre, gak kebra Jisas mam bogl ede dumo Isip enamnedi agre i ede ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Agre ede ogo, dumo Isip mogl pai meglko, Herot okuo goglkwa. Josep ya Maria ye Jisas bogl ede dumo Isip pi meglkwa i, ka kep yagl ta okna Yagl Kade dra idre, dugwa i, igne i pai yugwa. Yagl Kade yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:15">Na wana agle digo, ye dumo Isip kide kodidre, umiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosea 11.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 2:15">dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herot yobama dedugo, ye yagl gak mere si geglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ana yagl wagle kugl kuri kandre, nomane igwa yoba ikra ye ede ikne Herot moglmara pikrikwa pre Herot pre kan erukwa i, yoba i na bakagl narimedi prisre, ye dem podo kubro, yobamo dedugo, ye dumo Betlehem suna ya bina kipaimara i, pidre, yagl gak bugla yugu suo ne ede atne wigwa i mudu si geglkwa. I siragl pre ye okna kugl kuri aunake plau dume digwa egemo i pre moglsre, Jisas bugla yugu suo mere nomedi pre pogl sugwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ye yegl erimara i, ka kep yoba okna moglkwa, kagie Jeremaia we digwa i, ye okna God kamo kep ere boglkwa i pai yugwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />Ye yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Dumo Rama we dimara i, abu kai podo ersre, kai giglage sigo, yoba primiwa. Abu wagle i, Resel gawama meglmiwa. Ye gagroma mitno goglsre, kai eriko, yoba ka tau ye deno muduno aragan erabedi digwa ba gagroma moglkrikwa pre prikrimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 31.15</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 2:18">di, Jeremaia okna yegl dugo, ye yagl gak si geglmara i plau dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep ebie Maria ya Jisas bogl ede ikne dumo Israel eigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Ana okuo king Herot goglko, Josep dumo Isip mogl, ugl kubu ta kanumara i, Yagl Kade angelomo ugl kubu mina plau didre, Josep yegl di togwa, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Ene adiglsre, yagl gak ye mam bogl idre, aglke ede ikne dumo Israel enaiglmiwe dugwa. Yoba okna yagl gak Jisas doko, si goramnedi erikwa i mudu geglkwa pre die, dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Yegl dugwa pre Josep adiglsre, yagl gak ye mam bogl auro i ede ikne pi dumo Israel ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ogwa ba Herot wam Arkelaus ye nem agaimo idre, distrik Judia sugl moglmiwe digo, Josep prukwa. Prisre, ye ede ikne distrik Judia enabuka i, kudugl goglkwa. Kudugl goglko, God aglke kor ye ugl kubu ta kanumara u distrik Judia pikrabedi ka giglede di togo, ye ede distrik Galili pidre, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" /><figure style="fig" alt="Carpenter shop" file="lb00131b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="2.23" />dumo kebra Nasaret we dimara kipai meglkwa. Ka kep yoba ka okna di padiglkwa i, Ye we, dumo Nasaret nem ta moglme dinaiglmiwe digwa i, ka i pai inabedi God nomane togwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Jon yoba ka mabuno di togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:2-8">Mak 1.2-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jon 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Ana okuo Jon, yoba nigl bugl togwa yagle moglkwa i, ede distrik Judia udre, dumo wau yomara ugo, yoba ye moglmara eigwa i ye di te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka egemo i, ede magigl ugwa. Yegl pre ene nomano yake teo! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ana okna ka kep yoba ta kagie Aisaia we digwa i, ka swara ta Jon pre di paduglkwa. Ye yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 3:3">Yagl ta dumo wau yomara mogl, ka podo di, yoba yegl di tenabiwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Yagl Kade unabuka pre ene ye konbomo ake kun ersre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">ye unabara ake du di edenaiglkwa pamiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 40.3</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 3:3">di, Asaia Jon pre yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Ana Jon we, yoba bugla kamel gagno yugo idre, kugugl gagl bekigwa i ye edidre, kau nagie kumagl dogwa. Te, ye kaya mokna nogwa i, mogodo ya brume are nuglo ne wan moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Ye dumo wau yomara moglko, yoba mere Jerusalem meglkwa ya, distrik Judia meglkwa ya te, nigl Jordan omara koglo koglo bage bage kipai meglkwa i, mudu ede ye moglmara eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Ye moglmara pidre, tadaglmeno di pogl teigo, Jon nigl Jordan moglsre, ye ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Ana lotu bitno yoba Farisi we digwa i ya, Sadyusi we digwa i, tau mere Jon ye no nigl bugl norabedi wigwa. Wigwa ba Jon ye ka yegl di togwa, Ene we, ene toki kide nagiglema meglmiwe dugwa. God dem kubrisre, ka tage norabuka igne i ene teke panaiglmedi ira dume? Ene teke paibi, kuno ta erekrabuka <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />pre ene mabuno beglbi, ene nomano yake teigwa i nogugl panan, no kanamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Te, ene ere mogl, Abraham gawama munga pre God no ta sikrabe digwa i, kide kodio! Kobuglo magigl paigwa i, God ere i Abraham gawama koglo edidre, ye swara ere wakai ere tenagledi pran, ye eran, kuno erabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Ene prio! Ede tau mogo koraiglkwa paugwa ba mogo wakai ta koglkribi, yoba di maima idre, wei atne ede, gudu i pi, pia si doga mina edimere mere yegl, God ene yegl ere tenarumiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Ana Jon ka yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na we, na yoba nomano yake teigwa i ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl teiga ba yagl ta na moknamugl unabuka i, ye yobuglomo podo padre, na egre atne edumiwa. Te, na ama ye nigl kogonmo yoba mere yegl moglsre, ye kagle towo kan i na poko edenaglka kuno erekriwa. Te, yagl i udre, na nigl bugl teimere mere, ene tau God Murubuglomo si kau si tedre, te tau si doga mina edidre, erabiwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Yoba wit mogo si yu makai sidre, ugla pogl, mogo yugugl makai sidre, nagie gagl tege erimere mere yegl, yagl i udre, kuno yegl erabuka. Te, ye garabara i, doga gogokre, aimadi de pai morabiwe dugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Farmer" file="hk00097b.tif" size="span" copy="British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="3.12">Yoba wit mogo ya wit nagie i pere pere edimere</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon Jisas ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mak 1.9-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Ana igne i Jisas distrik Galili kide kodidre, ede nigl Jordan u Jon nigl bugl narabedi ye moglmara ugwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Yegl pre ugwa ba Jon mane didre, Ene na nigl bugl natn, kuno erabiwe dugwa. Ba siragl eruko, na ene nigl bugl narabedi une? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede te, God nono erme yegl erabredi prukwa pre mane dikro. Nono yegl erabuglka i, wakai paugwa. Yegl ersre, nono God nomanemo sika sinabugliwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jon mane dikre, ye ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="John baptizing Jesus" file="FM 139 John Baptizes Jesus_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" loc="3.13-16" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="3.16" />Ana Jon ye Jisas ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl te kodugo, Jisas ede egli ugo, tabre kaima kamun mitna ibo ede u koglo koglo ogo, God Murubuglomo u kua yumugl mere yegl pidre, pru di ede atne u Jisas moglmara akugo, Jisas kanugwa. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Kanugo, God heven ibo ka ta di atne edidre, yegl dugwa, I na Wana moglmiwa. Na ye wakai kaima kan, dena mudna mina gun yeiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Satan Jisas kina sugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mak 1.12-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Being tempted" file="FM 141 Tempation in the Wilderness_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="4.1" />Ana God Murubuglomo ere mogl, Jisas auro i pi dumo wau yomara suna edidre, Satan ye bakaran kanagledi edugwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Edugo, Jisas ege 40-pela de etne ya eduer kaya mokna mawagl ersre, kidan podo kaima goglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Kidan podo kaima goglko, yoba kina sugwa yagle ikra udre, Jisas yegl di togwa, Ene God Wam kaima motn, ene kobuglo magigl paigwa i di tedre, U bret koglo pio do! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yegl dugwa ba Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, God kamo mina yoba ta yegl boglkwa, Yoba bret keme i nedre, kor moglkraiglmiwa. Ye God kamo mudu swara swarade idre, kor kaima moraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 8.3</char></note> di, yegl boglme dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Satan ye auro i pi Jerusalem suna pidre, tawa teigwa yugu yomara tebe bolamugl ibo edidre, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />ye yegl di togwa, Ene God Wam kaima motn, ene puglo di, yage atne suo. I siragl pre God kamo bage ta yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">God angeloma dedenan, ene sugln moraiglmiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Te, ene kagln kobuglo bogl dinatga pre ye angeloma ene ake i mitna edinaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 91.11-12</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 4:6">dumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, God kamo bage ta ama yegl dugwa, God, ene Yaglnen Kade moglkwa i, ene ye eran, kanagledi erekro!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 6.16</char></note> dumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Satan ye agre i pi muglo mitna kaima ibo ta edidre, king dumo uglo koglo koglo sugl meglkwa i, wakai kaima yomere Jisas obuno di tedre, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />ye Jisas yegl di togwa, Ene goglkon bodugl narsre, guman dran i pi makan mina edidre, na kagna kade natn, taragl kanga i, mudu ene tenaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede te, Satan, ene ede eglke po! God kamo bage ta yegl paugwa, God, ene Yaglnen Kade moglkwa i, ye swara goglkono bodugl tedre, kagie kade te, kogonmo ere teo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 6.13</char></note> di, yegl boglme dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Yegl dugo, Satan ye moglmara kide kodidre, ede ogo, angelo tau Jisas moglmara u, ake ple digwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas distrik Galili suna kogon mabuno bogl erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mak 1.14-15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:1-15">Luk 4.1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Ana Jisas yoba Jon si kane sime digo, prisre, ye moglmara kide kodo, ede distrik Galili suna ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Pidre, ede Nasaret pidre, dumo i ama kide kodidre, ede pi dumo Kapernaum pai moglkwa. Ana dumo Kapernaum i, nigl nubun Galili moglmara bina yedre, Sebulun yoba ya Naptali yoba okna makan imara suna i yogwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Jisas ede dumo Kapernaum ogwa i, ka kep yagl Aisaia ka ta okna boglkwa pai inabedi Jisas ede dumo Kapernaum i, pi pai moglkwa. Aisaia yegl boglkwa,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />Sebulun yoba ya Naptali yoba makano i, suna yogo, nigl Jordan koglo wogo, mudi nigl koglo moglmiwa. Dumo suna i, Galili we digwa. Dumo Galili i, yoba yugobuno pere, Juda yoba ta moglkrikwa i, tau mere suna kipaimiwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Yoba i mim erumara atne meglkwa ba abuglage podo sugo, kanimiwa. Yoba i, geglkwa dumo mere yegl ta yomara atne moglsre, goraiglkwa magigl erukwa ba abuglage si, ye meglmara edumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 9.1-2</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 4:16">di, Aisaia yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye yagl 4-pela na duglo boraiglmedi agle dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mak 1.16-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Ana igne i Jisas mabuno bogl yoba ka mabuno di tedre, yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka egemo i, ede magigl u kodugwa. Yegl pre ene nomano yake teo! dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Ana Jisas nigl nubun Galili winabo di udre, kanugwa, agigle agigle suo ta degigl gagl nigle ede, buglo bagle ere si, i pi mige borabugledi ere miurko, kanugwa. Ye kagno Saimon ya Andru we digwa. Te, Saimon kagie ta Pita we digwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Jisas ye agle didre, Na duglo boglsro! Na duglo biur, na ene buglo bagle ere si, i suna edibrere kuno yegl yoba ama yegl auro i suna edenabredi obuno di tenagliwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Yegl dugo, yagl suo i degigl gaglno tabre kide kodidre, Jisas omara sika si ede ebrika.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ana Jisas kunabe ta ede ido pidre, agigle agigle ta ama miurko, kanugwa. Ye yagl ta Sebedi we digwa i wam suo miurko, kagno Jems ya Jon we digwa. Yagl suo i, ye neno bogl baglkugl bolamugl moglsre, degigl gaglno i si bogl, ake kun ere meglko, kanugwa. Ye kandre, yagl suo i agle dugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="fishing boat" file="hk00208b.tif" size="col" copy="British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="4.21" /> <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Agle dugo, ye neno baglkugl bogl tabre kide kodo, Jisas duglo bogl ede ebrika.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba ka mabuno di tedre, kideno ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Ana Jisas distrik Galili suna wan ede bage bage pidre, Juda yoba ka mabuno yuguno ede yugugl pi, God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka ka wakai i, yoba beke togwa. Beke tedre, ama yoba kide kane kane ta sugwa ya ogono nagino ta kide erumara i, ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Yegl eruko, yoba ye kamo di wai digo, yoba mudu provins Siria suna meglkwa i, prikwa. Prisre, yoba kide kane kane sigwa ya, giugl kane kane prikwa ya, murubuglo kide ye meglmara suna meglkwa i, auro yu Jisas moglmara edigwa. Yoba kide sigwa i, tau kide kane kane mina u kide eigo, tau ogono kaglno mawa sugo, tau kua sugwa. Yoba kide kane kane yegl sigwa i, yuigo, Jisas ye ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Ana yoba mere kide Jisas sika si ede eigwa. Distrik Galili yoba ya, dumo Jerusalem yoba ya, distrik Judia yoba ya, distrik ta 10-pela Taun we digwa i ya, nigl Jordan koglo ibo kipai meglkwa i, mere kide u Jisas sika si wan meglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Jisas muglo meglbi moglsre, yoba ka beke togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6.20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ana ege swara ta yoba mere kide ede Jisas moglmara wigo, ye kandre, muglo meglbi ta pamara ede muglo ibo pidre, ame dugwa. Ye ame dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yoba ede magigl u meglko,<figure style="fig" alt="Sermon on the Mount" file="hk00297b.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="5.1">Jisas muglo meglbi ta ame di mogl, God kamo mere beke togwa</figure> <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba i, ka beke tedre, yegl dugwa,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />Yoba ta God gumuglo mina goduglme munedi prikwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 5:3">I siragl pre God yoba kingno morabara dumo i, ye inaiglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Yoba ta erme kai ere meglkwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 5:4">I siragl pre God ye deno muduno wida di padigl tenabuka.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Yoba ta mogl atne edigwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 5:5">I siragl pre ye dumo makan mudu inaiglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Yoba ta mabuno du eramnedi pre kidan gogl, nigl mere yegl geglkwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 5:6">I siragl pre okuo mabuno du ye meglmara kau sinan, ye aragan eraiglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Yoba ta yoba pere mitno geglkwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 5:7">I siragl pre God ye ama mitno gorabuka.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Yoba ye deno muduno ta pe sugwa meglkwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 5:8">I siragl pre ye God kanaiglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Yoba ta yoba pere deno muduno swara yenaiglmedi erikwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 5:9">I siragl pre yoba i, ye God gagiglma meglmiwe dinaiglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Yoba tau ye mabuno du erimara yoba ye ere kide ere teigwa i, gun yenaiglkwa paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 5:10">I siragl pre God yoba kingno morabara dumo i, ye pre yenabuka.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Ana ene na duglo boraiglkwa pre yoba ka tenaiglkwa mo, ere kide ere tenaiglkwa mo, ka kibi kogl ka kide kane kane ta ene di beglbi, ene gun yenaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Okna ibo God kamo kep yoba kuno yegl ere teigwa pre ene heven ibo topo podo inamnedi gun yedre, grigle dio di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba i, mudi ya abuglage mere yegl meglme dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mak 9.50</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene erme makandigle meglkwa i, ene mudi mere yegl meglkwa. Ba mudi kuglomo ta dudinan, ene siragl mere kuglomo ere ikne edinaiglme? Mudi yegl mere kogonmo okuo ta paikrabuka ba yoba pia si makan mina edidre, egre kwagl paraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Ene erme makandigle meglkwa i, ene abuglage mere yegl meglkwa. Taun ta muglo meglbi mina ibo ta yenan, taun i teke yeikran, yoba taun i kanaiglkwa keme paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Te, yoba lam ere gaglsre, degigl gagl mina atne edekrikwa ba lam beyemo mina padigl, nogugl yeigo, yoba mudu yugugl meglkwa i, abuglagemo kanigwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Kuno yegl mere ene mabuno wakai bogl, abuglage mere yegl meglbi, yoba pere kandre, ene Neno heven ibo moglkwa i, kagie kade tenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas God lomo pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na God lomo ya God kamo kep yoba beglkwa i, ere kide era umedi prikrio! Ta manugwa. Na God lomo ya ka kep yoba beglkwa i, ere kide eragledi ukrika ba dumere ere kodinagledi wiga. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Na ene kaima di teiga, God lomo bage kebra swara ta wau boglkre, kogonmo mudu ere kodinabuka. Ere kodinan, okuo kamun mitna ibo ya dumo makan u taya enabuka.<verse eid="MAT 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Yegl pre God lomo swara ta kebra yenabuka i, yoba ta kide kodidre, yoba pere ama lo i duglo boglkraiglmedi beke tenan, God yoba kingno morabuka igne, ye kagie atne kaima yenabuka. Ba yoba ta God lomo duglo boglsre, yoba pere duglo boraiglmedi beke tenan, God yoba kingno morabuka igne, ye kagie kade panabuka. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />I kaima yegl mere paugwa pre na ene di teiga, Farisi yoba ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba du kaima meglkwa. Ba ye du meglmere ene ta egre atne edidre, du kaima moglkribi, God yoba kingno morabara ede suna pikraiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba deno kubrikwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk 12.57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, God okna nono kowano awano di te, Ene yoba ta si goglkrio didre, Ene yoba ta si geglbi, ka inaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.13, 21.12</char></note> dugwa i, ene prikwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Ka i ene pre kodigwa ba erme na ka kor ta dibo, praiglkwa. Yoba ta ye agigle si goglkrabuka ba ye dem ta kubro tenan, ye ama ka tage inabuka kuno erukwa. Ye agigle di te, Ene tom motne dinan, ede kot kade enabuka kuno erukwa. Te, yoba ta ye agigle di te, Bitn ta paikrume dinan, ye ede doga kade de pamara enabuka ama kuno erabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Yegl pre ene taragl ta yu tawa bogl mina God tenagledi etn, agitn ta na kide pre narumedi pitn, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />Ene taragl ta yunga i, tawa bogl yomara yei padiglsre, ede pi agitn i bogl deno muduno swara yenabugledi ero. Ene deno muduno swara yebr, ene ede ikne u, taragl ta yunga i, gaglsre, God tenatniwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Ana yoba ta ene kot ere tenagledi eran, jas moglmara pikre, tabre ere wakai erabrika. Kowai ye ene gudu i pi jas moglmara edenan, jas ene kibr nem ogo mina yenan, ye ene i pi kane yugu ede dinabuka pre diga. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Taragl yegl plau dinan, na ene kaima di teiga, ene kane yugu kodokratnga. Mige mogo swara keme ta tenatnga pai moran, ene ede meda ukratniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba yagl abu ta bogl kunogl neigwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />Ana Jisas ka yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, God okna yoba di te, Ene yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekrio!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.14</char></note> dugwa i, ene prikwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ka i ene pre kodigwa ba erme na ene ka kor ta di tebo, praiglkwa. Yagl ta abu kunogl nekrabuka ba ye ere mogl, abu ta kandre, nomane suo inan, ye nomanemo wagle abu i kunogl ne kodumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ene gumugln koglo, ogon wo kra paugwa i, ene tadaglme eratnedi eran, ene gumugln i, pogl ede, kide kodo! I siragl pre ene ogon nagn bage swara ta u kide enan, tadaglme ta erekitn, i wakai panabuka ba ene ogon nagn mudu ede doga kade enan, kide panabuka. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Te ene ogon wo i, yage sinatnedi eran, ene ogon i si keglu sidre, kide kodo! I siragl pre ogon nagn bage swara ta u kide enan, tadaglme ta erekitn, i wakai panabuka ba ogon nagn mudu ede doga kade enan, kide panabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye yagl abu si biglke digwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matyu 19.9</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mak 10.11-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba okna digwa i, Yagl ta ye ebie sedinagledi pran, ye pepa ta bogl tedre, sedinabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 24.1-4</char></note> digwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ba na ene di teiga i, yagl ta ye ebie sedinan, ye ebie i, yagl ta bogl kunogl nenabredi erukwa. Te, abu sedugwa i, yagl pere ta inan, ye abu i kunogl nogwa. Mem swara i keme pre yagl ta ye ebie sedinan, kuno erabuka i, ye ebie yagl ta bogl mabuno kide eribr, ye sedinabuka i, kuno erabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba ka gigledi ta di padiglkraiglkwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Moses lomo ta dugo, prikwa, Ene ka gigledi di padraiglkwa i, si biglki dikraiglkwa ba ka gigledi ta Yagl Kade di tenaiglkwa i, mudu dinaiglmere ere tenaiglkwa pame dugo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.7</char></note> ene prikwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ene ka i prikwa ba na erme ene di teiga i, ene ka gigledi swara ta di padiglkrio. Ene kano si gigle dinagledi heven ibo kagie daglkraiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre heven ibo i, God siamo king yomara yogwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Te, ene dumo makandigle i, kagie daglkraiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre dumo makandigle i, God ye kagle tebe yomara yogwa. Te, ene kano si gigle dinagledi dumo Jerusalem ama kagie daglkraiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre dumo i, King ta podo moglkwa i, taunmo yogwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Te, enene bitno mina ama ka gigledi ta dikraiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre ene bitno yugo i, ikan unabedi eraiglkwa mo kama panabedi eraiglkwa i, ene kuno ta erekrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ene owo dinaiglkwa panan, ene owo keme dio. Mo, ene mane dinaiglkwa panan, mane keme dio. Ba ene kano si gigle dinagledi taragl tau kagno daiglbi, yagl kide ene nomane togwa mere yegl pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dugwa i, Yoba ta ene ere kide ere tenan, ere ikne ede tekrio dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6.29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ka ta okna digwa i, yegl digwa, Yoba ta yoba pere gumuglo ere kide eran, ene ye ama gumuglo ere kide ere tenaiglkwa paugwa. Mo, ye yoba pere sigie ta si buko dinan, ene ye ama sigie ta si buko dinaiglkwa pamiwe digo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 21.24</char></note> ene prikwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ka i digo, ene prikwa ba na ene di teiga i, yoba ta ene ere kide ere tenaiglkwa i, ene si kegl dinamnedi erekrio. Yoba ta ene sibi, paunano koglo beglbi, ene kan ake tedre, koglo ama teo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Mo, yoba ta ene kot ere tedre, gaglno suna inamnedi eribi, ene ir gaglno ama teo. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Yoba ene ka gigledi di tedre, ene ye bonaganano 1 kilomita mere kakenaiglmiwe ka gigledi dibi, ene 2 kilomita mere kake teo. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Yoba ene taraglno pre yana dibi, ene ye dinaiglmere teo. Mo, ye dina ta eramne dibi, ene mane dikrio di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba di te, Ene kudano ikne deno muduno teo dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6.27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">6.32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ka ta okna digwa i, yegl digwa, Yoba ta magigl akie kipanaiglkwa i, ene wakai kandre, kudano ikne kide kanaiglmiwe digo, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoba magigl akie kipanaiglkwa i, deno muduno tenaiglme dugwa i, Tawa Teigwa Yoba 19.18 dugwa ba yoba ye kudano ikne kide kanaiglme digwa i, yene primere digwa paugwa.</char></note> ene prikwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ka i digo, prikwa ba na ene di teiga i, ene kudano ikne ta moraiglkwa i, deno muduno tedre, yoba ene ere kide ere tenaiglkwa i pre kamage ere teo. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Ene yegl eribi, ene Neno heven ibo moglkwa i, mabunomo erikwa mere yegl paugwa pre yoba ene God gagiglma meglmedi kanaiglkwa. I siragl pre God moglkwa i, ye ade si, yoba kide wakai akie meglmara edenabedi ersre, yoba du meglkwa ya du moglkrikwa i ama pra, kamun si ye meglmara edenabedi ere togwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Aglau eran, yoba ta ene wakai kanigwa i keme wakai kanibi, siragl topo inaiglme? Ta ikraiglkwa. Taks igwa yoba ama ye wakai kanigwa yoba i keme wakai kan meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Mo, ene agroma abaroma moraiglkwa i keme wakai we di tebi, i taragl podo erimo? Ta manugwa. Juda yoba moglkrikwa God pre kan erekrikwa i, ye ama agroma abaroma wakai we di teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Yegl pre ene Neno heven ibo du moglmere mere yegl, ene ama du kaima moraiglkwa pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Jisas dugwa i, Yoba ta yoba pere ake ple di tenagledi pran, ye kagie kade pre erekrabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Jisas ama yegl dugwa, Ene mabuno du eraiglmara i, yoba ta ene debino si dinaiglmedi kan kun erio! Kowai ene yegl eribi, Neno heven ibo moglkwa i, okuo topo swara ta tekrabuka.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Ene mige moni i pi goduglme yoba tenaiglkwa igne, ene yoba ta dede, aglage kaglkane ere, debino sinaiglmedi dedekrio. Yoba mabuno kibi erikwa i, yoba debino sinaiglmedi ka mabuno yugu ya yoba meglmara biugel sio digwa i, ye ka kaima topono i kodigwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Man blowing horn" file="lb00187b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="6.2" /> <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Ba ene goduglme yoba ake ple dinamnedi pribi, ene nogugl erekre, teke atne mere yegl erio. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Teke atne mere yegl eribi, ene Neno heven ibo moglkwa i, ye ene topo wakai te ikne edenabuka. I siragl pre yoba taragl teke atne erikwa i, ye kanumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl kamage eraiglmere beke togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Ene kamage eraiglkwa igne, yoba mabuno kibi erikwa erimere yegl erekrio. Ye ka mabuno yugu yugugl ya, konbauna nogagle adigl mogl, yoba no kanaiglmedi kamage erikwa i, wakai prikwa. Ba na ene kaima di teiga, yoba i ye topono i kodigwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Ba ene kamage eraiglkwa igne, ene yugugl nene moglsre, dua yogugl kegl didre, ene Neno ta kankrikwa moglkwa i, kamage ere teo. Ene yegl eribi, ye taragl mudu teke paugwa kanugwa pre ene teke mogl, kamage eribi, ye kanabuka. Ye kandre, ene topo wakai te ikne edenabuka.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Te, ene kamage eraiglmara ene God prabedi ka di kodigwa i, aglke kor kor dikrio. Yugobuno tau God pre kan erekrikwa i, yegl ere, ka mere kaima dumun, no godno i, kamageno praiglmedi prikwa <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />pre ene ye erimere yegl ta erekrio. I siragl pre ene Neno moglkwa i, ye ene siragl taragl ta inaiglkwa paugwa i, komono kana pre kan ere kodugo, ene okuo ye agle di primiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Ene kamage eraiglkwa i, kamage yegl erio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">Neno Kade, ene heven ibo motnga i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">Ene kagn pere kaima padre, mina kaima panabedi prumga.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Te, ene king moratnga igne i tabre plau dinabedi prumniwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">Ene pitnere keme heven ibo, plau dumere yegl,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">No makandigle munara i, ama yegl keme panabedi prumga.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />No kaya mokna ege swara swarade ta nenamnere mere noro.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Te, yoba aglau ere noriko, ye aglauno kide kodo tomnere mere yegl, no aglauno kide kodo noro.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Te, ege mere yagl kide kigln koglmara magigl pi dinaiglmedi ersre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">Yagl kide no si dinabedi no ere yo</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 6:13">di, ene kamage yegl eraiglme dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Yoba ene aglau ere tenaiglkwa i, ene kide kodo tebi, ene Neno heven ibo moglkwa i, ene tadaglmeno ama kide kodo tenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Ba ene yoba ta aglauno kide kodo tekribi, ene Neno ama ene tadaglmeno kide kodo tekrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba kaya mokna mawagl eraiglkwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Ene kaya mokna mawagl eraiglkwa igne, yoba mabuno kibi erikwa erimere yegl ta erekrio. Ye kaya mokna mawagl erikwa igne, yoba ye kaya mokna mawagl erimedi kanaiglmedi pre ye gumano kide erikwa. Ba na ene kaima di teiga, ye topono i kodigwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ba ene kaya mokna mawagl eraiglmara i, ene oliv nuglo bitno yugo mina edidre, gumano drano nigl koglsre, erio. <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />Ene yegl eribi, ene kaya mokna mawagl erikwa i, yoba ta kankraiglkwa ba ene Neno ta kankraiglkwa moglkwa i, ye taragl mudu teke erikwa kanugwa pre ene teke eribi, kanabuka. Kandre, ene topo wakai te ikne edenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba taragl wakai wakai heven ibo bona sinaiglkwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19-20" />Ene taragl wakai wakai makandigle bona sikre, heven ibo bona sinaiglkwa. Ene taragl wakai wakai makandigle bona sibi, gunage taragl tau nebi, taragl tau ama ouno edenan, te, kunogl gogl yoba ede yugugl udre, kunogl nenaiglkwa. Ba ene taragl wakai wakai heven ibo bona sibi, kunogl gogl yoba ta u i pikribi, gunage ama nekribi, ouno edekrabuka. <verse eid="MAT 6:19-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Ene dumo aglo mere ta bona sinaiglkwa i, dumo i keme ene nomano mina kau sinabuka pre heven ibo keme bona sinamnedi erio di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Ene gumuglno paugwa i, ken lam mere yegl padre, ene ogono nagino mudu abuglage si tenabuka pre paugwa. Yegl pre ene gumuglno wakai panan, ene ogono nagino mina abuglage mudu kau sinabuka. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Ba ene gumuglno kide eran, ene ogono nagino mudu mim erabuka. Yegl pre ene abuglage sumedi pitnga ba kaima mim eran, mim i podo kide erabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16.13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Yoba swara ta yoba suo kogono ere tenabuka, kuno ta erekrabuka. I siragl pre ye yaglmo kade ta wakai kandre, ta wakai kankrabuka. Te, ye yagl swara ta bogl si dakagl miur, ta moko tenabuka. Kuno yegl mere ene God kogonmo ersre, mige moni ama pre i mitna edinamnedi eribi, kuno ta erekrabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makadigle taragl pre nomane sikramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12.22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Ana na ene ka ebrie di teiga i, ene pre epigl ersre, erme makandigle siragl mere mogl pai eraiglkwa i, pre yubun dekrio. Ene nigl, kaya mokna siragl mere nenaiglmere mo kuguglno gaglno siragl mere edinaiglmere kaima nomane sikrio.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 6:25">Neno Kade kor moramga norukwa pre kaya mokna ya kugugl gak edinamga i, taragl kebra pamedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Kua pru di wan meglkwa i, ene prio. Yene kaya mokna ere yagl, si nenaiglkwa i pre nomane sikrikwa. Ba ene Neno kamin mitna moglkwa i, kua wakai moraiglmedi suglno moglkwa. Kua suglno wakai moglsre, te, no yoba munga i, siragl podo pamedi prisre, no wakai kaima suglno morabedi praiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ene siragl mere wakai mogl pai eraiglkwa pre ege ege nomane sibi, ene bugla yuguno ere i olto edinaiglmo? Ta manabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Ene kugugl gagl siragl mere edenaiglkwa i, siragl pre nomane sime? Kugl siragl mere pare pi kwie sumere yegl prio. Ye nomane sidre, kogon podo eriko, kwieno u wakai pikrukwa ba God yene ekino wakai kaima togwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Te, King Solomon king kuguglmo gaglmo edugwa i win paugwa ba kugl kwie ekino wakai kaima padre, Solomon ekinmo togwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Kugl ege sugunagle paigo, yoba kugl kuba sidre, ere gaiglkwa ba yoba taragl kade paugwa. Yegl pre God kugl ekino togwa panan, ene siragl pre God kugugl gagl norokrabedi prime? Ene God pre mediglkwa i, gigle dikrume dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Te, ene nigl, kaya mokna siragl mere nenaiglkwa mo kugugl gagl siragl mere edenaiglkwa i, pre yubun dedre, dokokraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ye makandigle taragl yegl mere inamnedi nomano mina kau sugwa ba ene Neno kamin mitna moglkwa i, ene siragl taragl inaiglkwa pamere i kwande pre kodugwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ba ene God ye yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka ya mabunomo du ake gumano kagle edibi, God makandigle taragl ta inaiglkwa panabere mere ama tenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Yegl paugwa pre siragl mere tagna plau dinabuka i pre ene nomane sikrio. Tagna i, ye yene pre nomane sinabedi kanige erio. Yubun ta erme plau dinabuka i keme ene poglo di pribi, kuno erabuka pre ene tagna pre nomane sikrio di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ene yoba pere kan yubu sikrio dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6.37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">6.41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene jas mere yegl moglsre, yoba kan yubu sikrio. Ene yoba pere kan yubu sibi, kowai God ene ama kan yubu si dinabiwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />I siragl pre ene siragl mere yoba ta kan yubu sinaiglkwa i, God ene ama kan yubu sinabuka. Te, ene siragl mere yoba wakai ere tenaiglmere mere yegl God kuno ere, ere ikne edenabuka.<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Ana siragl eruko, ene agitn gumuglo mina ede dekne kebra ta paugwa ibo kandre, ede mudu ta enene gumugln mina paugwa i kankre, dine? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Ede podo ta ene gumugln mina pai moglko, ene kanige ere, agitn moglmara pi di te, Agra, na ede dekne kebra ta gumugln mina paugwa i, i meda edinaluwe dinga i, kuno ta erekrume dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Ene mabuno kibi etnga. Ede podo ta gumugln mina paugwa i komono kana i meda edin, ene kan pogl sidre, ede dekne kebra ta agitn gumuglo mina paugwa i, i meda edinatnga kuno erabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Taragl tau God pre yenabuka i, ene agl tekrio. Te, bis nuguno wakai kaima ta yenabuka i, ene puk si bugla moraiglmara edekrio. Ene yegl eribi, ye bis nuguno i, egre atne edidre, kan ake te, ene sinaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba kamage eribi, God ye kamageno prabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Yegl pre na ene di teiga, Ene taragl tau pre God agle di pribi, ene tenabuka. Ene taragl ta dokibi, ene kanaiglkwa. Te, ene dua mina sibi, God dua yauro tenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />I siragl pre yoba mudu God agle di prikwa i, ye dimere igwa. Te, yoba taragl ta doko meglkwa i, ye taragl i kanigwa. Te, yoba dua mina sigwa i, God ye dua yauro tomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Ene gak nenoma meglkwa i, ene wano ta ere mogl, bret ta nenagledi prie dinan, ene ye kobuglo ta tenatno? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Mo, ye buglo bagle pre dinan, ene ye toki ta tenatno? Ta tekratnga. <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ene yoba kide meglkwa ba ene gagroma taragl wakai te kanimiwa. Yegl pre ene Neno Kade heven ibo moglkwa i, yoba ta ye di prabuka i, ye dumere ersre, tau ama i tebe ede tenabe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Yegl pre yoba ene mabuno siragl mere ta ere naraiglmedi pratnere i, ene mabuno mudu i, yoba ta ere to. I siragl pre God lomo ya ka kep yoba ka beglkwa i, mudu mem swara i pre dumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Togl dra kebra ya kade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Ene togl dra kebra yenabara ede suna enaiglkwa. I siragl pre konbauna ta ede pi yoba u kide enaiglmara ogwa i, konbauna kade yogo, togl dra ama kade yogo, yoba mere konbo i mina ede eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Ba konbauna ta ede pi kor moraiglmara ogwa i, togl dra kebra yogo, konbauna ama kebra yogo, eruko, yoba suom keme togl dra i kandre, eimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye ka kep yoba kibi ene bakagl te dinaiglmiwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6.43-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Ene ka kep yoba kibi moraiglkwa i pre kan kun erio. Ka kep yoba kibi ene meglmara unaiglkwa i, yoba ye meda kanaiglkwa i, sipsip mere yegl meglmedi kanaiglkwa ba ye deno muduno suna i, agl are, ene si nenamnedi prikwa mere yegl moraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Ka kep yoba kibi i, ene ye mogo siragl mere koraiglkwa i kandre, kan pogl sinaiglkwa. Yoba fik mogomo mo wain mogomo ta uramnedi praiglkwa i, ye pi ede kide ede kewan pamara ta pidre, mogomo ta urokraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Mabuno swara i mina ede wakai paigwa i, mogo wakai keme koraiglkwa. Te, ede kide paigwa i, mudu mogo kide koraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Ede wakai ta mogo kide korabuka i, kuno erekrabuka. Te, ede kide ta mogo wakai korabuka i, ama kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Te, ene prikwa, ede mudu ta mogo koraiglkwa paugwa ba mogo wakai ta koglkrikwa i, yoba wei atne edidre, pia si doga mina edigwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Yegl pre ka kep yoba kibi moraiglkwa i, ye mogo siragl mere koraiglkwa i, ene kandre, ye kan pogl sinaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />Yoba mere na di narsre, Yaglno Kade motniwe dinaiglkwa ba ye mudu ta God yoba kingno morabara suna pikraiglkwa. Yoba ta na Nina, kamin mitna moglkwa i, ye eraiglmedi prumere ta eraiglkwa i keme ede suna enaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Okuo, ege kade ta plau dinabuka igne, yoba mere na di nare, yegl dinaiglkwa, Yagl Kade yo, no ene kagn mina ka kep ere didre, murubuglo kide di meda edidre, kimagl tau mere erumniwe dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Yegl dibi, na di ikne edidre, Na ene kaima ta pre kan erekrika. Ene mabuno kide erikwa yoba meglkwa i, na moglmara kide kodo, ede pio! dinaluwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye yoba yugu keigwa pre ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6.47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Yoba ta na ka diga i prisre, duglo boglkwa i, na ye siragl mere moglkwa i di boglsre, ka ebrie ta dinariwa. Yoba ta nomane wakai paugo, yugu wakai ta keigwa mere yegl moglkwa. Yoba i, makan wake ede atne pidre, kobuglo pamara yugu guglo boglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Okuo, kamun podo sugo, nigl podo ugwa. Te, ir podo udre, yugu i sugwa ba yugu i yage sikrukwa. I siragl pre yugu kegwa yaglmo i, kobuglo bolamugl kegwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Ba yoba ta na kana prisre, sedinan, ye yoba ta nomane kide paugo, yugu kide ta keigwa mere yegl morabuka. Yoba i, yugu guglo wesan bolamugl yoko edidre, yugu keigwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Yegl pre okuo, nigl kamun podo ta sidre, ir podo mage udre, yugu i ta sugo, yugu i tabre kaima yage sidre, u kide pi kodumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugwa igne, yoba mere kide ye ka beke togwa pre meglkwa i, nagino keglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />I siragl ye ka beke togwa i, God lomo beke teigwa yoba dimere yegl ta dikrukwa. Ta manugwa. Ye yene kagie kade paugwa mere yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl ta leprosi erukwa ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-44">Mak 1.40-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:12-14">Luk 5.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Ana Jisas muglo meglbi kide kodo, ede atne ugo, yoba mere kide ye omara sika si ede eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Ede eimara i, yagl ta kide leprosi paugwa ta Jisas moglmara gumamugl yage kobragai padre, kamage yei, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene na ere wakai ere naragledi pitn, ene eratnga kuno erumedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye ogo i pi yagl i akidre, yegl dugwa, Kaima na ene ere wakai ere tenagledi prika. Ene kidenen aragan erabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i ogo nagie tabre kaima u wakai ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Yegl eruko, Jisas ye ka gigledi yegl di togwa, Na erika i, ene yoba swara ta di tekro! Ene yoba ta di tekre, Moses okna dumere mere tawa teigwa yoba kogon erimara ogon nagn obuno didre, tawa ta tenatnga. Ten, ye ene kidenen aragan erukwa pamedi kanaiglme dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rom ami bitno yagl ta niglmo kogonmo yoba kide sugo, Jisas ye ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Ana ege swara ta Jisas ede dumo Kaperneam ogo, yagl ta Rom soldia 100 mere bitno moglkwa i, ye moglmara udre, kamage yei,<figure style="fig" alt="Roman soldier" file="hk00193b.tif" size="col" loc="8.5" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="8.5" /> <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na niglna kogona yagl ta kide podo sugo, bogl mina pai moglmiwa. Ye ogo kagle mawa sugo, giugl podo pre moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na pidre, ye ere wakai ere tenaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, soldia bitno yagl i, di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ede yugugl unatnga i, ere enaba! Na yagl wakai ta moglbo, ene na kipaimara ede yugugl unatnga i, kuno ta erekrumiwa. Yegl pre ene yugugl ukre, ka keme din, na niglna kogona yagl i, aragan erabedi priwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />I siragl pre na moglka i, yoba ta na bitna moglko, te, na soldia tau mere ama bitno moliwa. Na soldia ta di tedre, Ede po! digo, ye ede ogo, te ta Ede wo! digo, ye ama ede umiwa. Te, na niglna kogona yoba ta Kogon yegl ero! diga i, ye erukwa. Yegl pre ene ka keme din, niglna kogona aragan erabedi prie dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Ana yagl i yegl dugo, Jisas nagie koglsre, yoba ye duglo bogl wigwa i, yegl di togwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, yagl i pre meduglmere yegl Israel yoba swarano yegl ta pre mediglkrime dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Na ene di teiga, Yoba tau mere ade umara ya ade beimara mogl udre, Abraham ya Aisak ya Jekop bogl akie God yoba kingno morabara kaya mokna nenamnedi ame dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Ame dinaiglkwa ba ene tau Juda yoba God agai dumomo inaiglkwa kuno erukwa meglkwa i, igne i suna ta moglkraiglkwa. Moglkribi, God ene si meda ede, mim erumara edenabuka. Edinan, dumo i, kai podo ere, signo gikr eraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, soldia bitno yagl i yegl di togwa, Ene ede po. Ene pre medigl dinere mere plau dinabiwe dugwa. Ka yegl dugo, ege swara i mina niglmo kogonmo yagl i, aragan erukwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita abu imakie kide sugo, Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-31">Mak 1.29-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:38-39">Luk 4.38-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Ana ege ta, Jisas ye Saimon kipamara ede yugugl ogwa. Ogo, Saimon ebie mam nagie niga podo dugo, bogl mina pai moglko, kanugwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Jisas kandre, ye ogo akugo, ye kidemo bu yogwa. Ye kidemo bu yogo, abumo i tabre adiglsre, Jisas kaya mokna nenabedi ere wakai ere gaglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba mere kaima kideno ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:32-34">Mak 1.32-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:40-41">Luk 4.40-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Ana min paugo, yoba mere kide murubuglo kide ye meglmara suna meglkwa yu Jisas moglmara edigwa. Edigo, Jisas ka dumara i, murubuglo kide mudu di meda edidre, yoba kide sigwa i, ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Jisas erukwa i, ka kep yagl Aisaia ka ta okna boglkwa i, pai inabedi erukwa. Aisaia yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">Nono kideno kane kane paugwa i, ya guigl kane kane sugwa i, ye idre, ere wakai ere norume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 53.4</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 8:17">di, yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba siragl mere ersre, Jisas duglo boraiglkwa i pre Jisas dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-60">Luk 9.57-60</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Ana yoba mere kide Jisas moglmara u mogl winabo digo, Jisas kandre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba di te, Nono ede nigl koglo ibo enamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Yegl dugo, ye enamnedi eriko, God lomo beke togwa yagl ta u Jisas yegl di togwa, Ene aglo mere ta enatnara i, na ene duglo boraluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Agl are meglkwa i, ye makan mur mina atne paigo, te, kua ama yene yuguno bagl paigwa ba na Yoba Wam moglka i, na dumo ta panaglka i ta yekrumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Te, Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta ye yegl di togwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene pra we din, na ede ikne yugunamugl enagledi priwe dugwa. Na ede ikne ebo, nina goran, na ye maugl sidre, u ene duglo boragledi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Yegl dugwa ba Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba geglkwa yugobunomo mina atne meglkwa i, ta geglbi, yene maugl sibi, kuno erabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ka dugo, ir waga kudu ta ugwa i, bu yogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:36-41">Mak 4.36-41</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Ana Jisas okna kana ede baglkugl mina kuglo pi moglko, ye duglo beglkwa yoba okuo ede tebe eigo, ede nigl suna eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Ye ede suna eigo, ir waga kudu podo ta udre, nigl si pepigl di, baglkugl mina suna edidre, baglkugl si kau sinagledi erukwa. Yegl erukwa ba Jisas ugl pai moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba Jisas ugl pamara uglo yokidre, ye yegl di teigwa, Yagl Kade yo, no ere yo! No goramga pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yegl digo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Ene siragl pre kudugl geglme? Ene na pre mediglkwa i, kebra paugwa pamiwe dugwa. Ye yegl didre, adigl, ir waga kudu ya nigl pepigl dugwa i, ka togo, ir ugwa i dudugo, nigl ama kiede kaima moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Yegl eruko, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i nagino koglsre, yegl digwa, Yagl i ira moglme? Ye ir ya nigl akie ka togo, kamo pribriwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murubuglo kide tau yagl suo miurara suna meglko, Jisas di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-17">Mak 5.1-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:26-37">Luk 8.26-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl nigl koglo ibo Gadara yoba meglmara eigwa. Eigo, yagl suo ta gigl pene yomara pai mogl, u Jisas tegigl yeigwa. Te, yagl suo i murubuglo kide ye miurara suna meglkwa. Yagl suo i, ye yoba ege ege ere sibrika pre yoba ta pai miurara magigl i ta pikrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ana yagl suo i udre, ka podo yegl dibrika, Ene God Wam motnga i, ene siragl ere noragledi une? No giugl prabuglka egemo ta yeikrukwa ba ene magigl unga i, no tabre giugl noragledi uno? dibrika.<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Ana ye tegigl yeimara prak iro bugla mere kide yumun ne wan meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ne meglko, murubuglo kide kamage yei, Jisas yegl di prikwa, Ene no di meda edenagledi pitn, no bugla meglmara suna iro no dedo, di yegl digwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yegl digo, Jisas Ede pio dugo, murubuglo kide i, ye yagl suo miurara kide kodo, ede pi bugla mere kide meglmara suna eigo, bugla mudu i, guglo ta yomara muku di ede atne pi, nigl nubun suna pidre, nigl ne geglkwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Sea of Galilee" file="hk00341b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="8.32" /><verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Ana yoba bugla sugl meglkwa i, muku di ede pi taun suna pidre, yagl suo murubuglo kide miurara meglkwa ikra ye mina siragl taragl plau dugwa ya te siragl mudu kanigwa i, boglo kugl teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Yegl di teigo, yoba taun suna meglkwa i, mudu ede pi Jisas kanamnedi eigwa. Ye Jisas kandre, Jisas dumono kide kodo, ede bage ta enabedi kamage yeigwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Jisas yagl ta ogo kagle mawa sugwa ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mak 2.1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Ana Jisas baglkugl mina ede kuglo pidre, ye ede nigl koglo ibo yene yugomugl ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Ogo, yoba tau yagl ta ogo kagle goglkwa ye gagle ersre, boglo ere yu Jisas moglmara wigwa. Yagl wagle pre mediglkwa i, Jisas kandre, yagl kagle goglkwa i di te, Wana yo, gun yeo. Ene tadaglmenen gugl ede teiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba meglkwa i, ye nomano mina yegl di prikwa, Yagl i God agaimo inagledi ka kide dumedi prikwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yegl priko, ye deno muduno mina prikwa i, Jisas kwande kandre, yegl dugwa, Ene siragl pre nomano mina kide yegl prime? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Na siragl ka dibo yuwaglke panabedi prime? Yagl i di tedre, tadaglmenen gugl ede teie dibo, yuwaglke panabo mo yagl i di tedre, adigl, konbauna ede po dibo, yuwaglke panabedi prime? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" /><figure style="fig" alt="Lame man healed" file="FM 153 Healed Man Walks Away_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="9.6" />Na ene tadaglmeno gugl ede tekrabedi prikwa ba na Yoba Wam moglka i, yoba tadaglmeno gugl ede tenaglka kagna paugwa pre erme taragl ta eribo, kan pogl sinaiglmiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl didre, yagl kagle goglkwa ikra yegl di togwa, Ene adigl, kuguglnen akidre, ede kipanara po! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Yegl dugo, yagl i adiglsre, konbauna ede kipamara ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ede meda ogo, yoba kan meglkwa i, gagno kogl, God kagie kade tedre, God yoba kimagl eraiglmedi yobuglo togwa pamiwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Matyu agle didre, Na duglo boglo dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mak 2.13-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Calling of Matthew" file="CN01691B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="9.9">Jisas, Matyu agle dugwa</figure>Ana okuo Jisas konbauna wan pidre, taks yugwa yagl ta taks imara ame di moglko, kanugwa. Yagl i, kagie Matyu we digwa. Ana Jisas yagl i kandre, ye di te, Na duglo boglo dugo, Matyu adiglsre, Jisas omara duglo bogl ede ogwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Ana okuo Jisas ede Matyu kipamara pidre, kaya mokna nenagledi ame di moglko, taks igwa yoba yeigo, tadaglme erikwa yoba ama yeigo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl akie kaya mokna neigwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Ne meglko, Farisi yoba u kandre, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di prikwa, Siragl pre ene tisano ye taks igwa yoba ya tadaglme yoba bogl kaya mokna akie neime? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yegl digo, Jisas prisre, di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba kide sikrukwa i, ye dokta moglmara enaiglkwa kuno erekrumiwa. Ba yoba kide sigwa i keme dokta moglmara enaiglkwa kuno erukwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Ene pi God kamo bage ta bekenaiglkwa paugwa i, yegl dugwa, Na ene tawa naraiglmedi prikrika. Ene yoba pere mitno goraiglmedi priwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosea 6.6</char></note> dumara i, pi bekenaiglkwa paugwa. Te, ene ama praiglkwa i, yoba du meglkwa i, na agle dinagledi ukrika ba na tadaglme yoba agle dinagledi wie dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba kaya mokna mawagl erikwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mak 2.18-22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Ana okuo, Jon duglo beglkwa yagl tau Jisas moglmara udre, yegl digwa, No Farisi yoba bogl ege tau mere kaya mokna mawagl erumga ba siragl eruko, ene duglo beglkwa yoba kaya mokna mawagl erekrime? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yagl abu ta bogl ibr, yagl i kunama bogl akie meglkwa i, kide praiglmo mo gun yenaiglme? Ye gun keme yenaiglkwa. Ba yagl i auro i ede enaiglkwa igne i, ye kabaglemo kaya mokna mawagl eraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ka ebrie ama yegl dugwa, Yoba kuguglmo gaglmo goglo ta argla dinan, ye lap kor ta bogl i pi si boglkrabuka. I siragl pre lap kor i gugl sidre, argla di ede podo kaima enabuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Te, yoba nigl wain kor ta morabuka i, ta i pi toide nigl mige goglo mina atne edekrabuka. Toide atne edenan, nigl wain kor i, poia didre, nigl mige goglo i si bla dinabuka. Yegl eran, nigl wain toide ede meda enan, nigl mige i ama ere kide erabuka. Yegl pre nigl wain kor ta morabuka i, yoba i pi toide nigl mige kor mina atne edibi, nigl wain ya nigl migi i, akie wakai yoko yomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abai gak ta goglko, Jisas ye ere i kor edidre, te, abu ta Jisas gaglmo akugo, kidemo aragan erukwa<figure style="fig" alt="Woman touching Jesus" file="lb00310b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="9.17" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:22-43">Mak 5.22-43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:41-56">Luk 8.41-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ana Jisas ye Jon duglo beglkwa yagl i bogl ka di meglko, Juda yoba ka mabuno yuguno ta sugl moglkwa yagl ta Jisas moglmara udre, yage kobragai pai, yegl dugwa, Na abra tagamadi goglkwa ba ene udre, ye akin, ye u kor enabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yegl dugo, Jisas adigl, yagl i bogl ede ebriko, ye duglo beglkwa yoba ama sika si ede eigwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ana konbauna eimara suna i, abu ta ye mokomugl ogwa. Abu i, kide sugwa i, abu ba kanimere yegl bugla yugu 12-pela bu yeikruko, aimadi kan pai moglkwa. Ana abu i, Jisas mokomugl u, ye kuguglmo gaglmo puduo yomara akugwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Akidre, ye prukwa i, Na ye kuguglmo gaglmo keme akibo, kidena bu yenabiwe di prukwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Ana abu i Jisas kuguglmo gaglmo akugo, Jisas kan ake te, ye kandre, yegl dugwa, Abra yo, ene gun yeo. Ene na pre mediglnga pre kidenen bu yomiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl dugo, ege i, abu i kidemo bu yogwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Ana Jisas abu i ere wakai ere tedre, ede yagl kade ikra kipamara pi kanugwa i, yoba yugugl i, pu mige si, kai podo ere meglko, kanugwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Kandre, yegl dugwa, Ene ede eglke eglke pio. Abai i goglkrukwa. Ugl keme pamiwe dugwa. Dugo, ye gauglmo podo erikwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Yegl erikwa ba ye yoba di meda edigo, ye ede yugugl pi, abai i ogo akugo, abai i aduglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugwa i, yoba di wai digo, yoba dumo magigl ta meglkwa i, mudu prikwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba gumuglno kin yogwa ya ka dikrikwa i, Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Ana Jisas dumo i kide kodo, konbauna ede ogo, yagl suo ye gumuglno kin yogwa ye omara duglo bogl pidre, ka podo di, Devit Gawamo yo, no mitno goglo! dibrika. <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yegl dibriko, Jisas ede yugugl ta yomara ogo, yagl suo okuo ebrika. Ebriko, Jisas ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Na ene ere wakai ere tenaglka kuno erumedi pre mediuro? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye yegl dibrika, Yagl Kade yo, kaima no yegl pre meduluwe dibrika. <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Yegl dibriko, Jisas ye gumuglno mina akidre, yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediurka pre ene dibrere plau dinabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Yegl dugo, ye gumuglno pine dugo, kor kanibrika. Jisas ere wakai ere tedre, ka gigledi di te, yegl dugwa, Taragl ta ene miurara plau dugwa i, ene yoba swara ta di tekriro! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Yegl dugwa ba yagl suo i ede meda pi, Jisas siragl mere erukwa i, di te ede ebriko, yoba dumo magigl ta meglkwa i, mudu prikwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ana yagl suo i ede meda ebriko, yagl ta murubuglo kide ye moglmara suna moglkwa ta auro yuigwa. Murubuglo kide i, yagl i ka dikrabedi eruko, ka dikrukwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Ana Jisas murubuglo kide di meda edugo, yagl i, kor ka dugo, yoba mere magigl meglkwa i prisre, nagino keglkwa. Ye nagino koglsre, yegl digwa, Dumo Israel suna i, taragl yegl mere okna ta plau dugo, kankuniwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Yegl digwa ba Farisi yoba digwa i, Murubuglo kide bitno ta moglkwa ikra, yagl i yobuglo togo, ye murubuglo kide di meda edumiwe di, kenaglmo sigwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba di tedre, God kogonmo yoba dedenabedi kamage erio dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Jisas ye wan ede pi Juda yoba tauno ya dumono mudu pidre, ye ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara yugugl pi, yoba God kamo beke tedre, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka ka wakai i, yoba di togwa. Di tedre, yoba kide kane kane ya giugl kane kane prikwa i ama ere wakai ere tedre, erukwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ana yoba mere kide meglko, Jisas kandre, mitno kaima goglkwa. Ye kanugwa i, ye nomane sidre, yobuglno paikruko, wau beglmedi kanugwa. Kandre, sipsip suglno yoba ta moglkrimedi kan, <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />ka ebrie ta duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Kaya mokna mere kide de kodugwa ba yoba ta si suna edenaiglkwa i, kunabe meglmiwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Kogon yoba kunabe meglkwa pre ene kaya mokna ere yaglkwa Yobamo kogon yoba mere dedenan, kaya mokna si yunaiglmedi kamage ere teo dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela yobuglo togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mak 3.13-19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Disciples" file="CN01672B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="10.1" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela agle dugo, wigo, ye yobuglo ya namba togwa. Togwa i, ye murubuglo kide di meda edidre, te, giugl, yubun ya kide kane kane yoba sinaiglkwa i, ere wakai ere tenaiglmedi yobuglo togwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Jisas dedugwa yagl 12-pela meglmara i, kagno yegl paugwa, komono kana Saimon moglkwa. Ye kagie ta Pita we digwa. Te, Andru, ye agigle moglkwa. Te, Jems ya Jon, ye agigle agigle moglsre, ye Sebedi wam suo miurka. <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Te, tau meglkwa i, Filip ya Bartolomyu ya Tomas ya Matyu, ye taks yugwa yagl moglkwa. Te, Jems ta, ye Alfius wam moglkwa ya Tadius <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />ya Saimon, ye Selot yoba ta moglkwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Selot yoba i, ye pati mere yegl ta meglkwa ba ye Rom yoba kuda bogl tedre, Israel yoba mogl pere edinamnedi prikwa yoba meglkwa. Saimon ye okna yugobuno i mina suna moglsre, erme Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta moglkwa.</char></note> te, Judas Iskariot, ye okuo Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yenabuka.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela di bage bage edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mak 6.7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:1-5">Luk 9.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Ana Jisas ye yagl 12-pela i dedidre, ka tau yegl di togwa, Ene ede enaiglkwa i, Jentail yoba meglmara pikrio. Te, Samaria yoba dumono ta suna pikraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ba Israel yoba tau sipsip wau beglkwa mere yegl meglkwa i keme meglmara pio. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Ene pidre, ye yegl di tenaiglkwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, ede magigl u kodumiwe di teo. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Ene yoba ta kide leprosi panabuka ya kide kane kane sinaiglkwa i, ere wakai ere tedre, yoba ta goraiglkwa i, ere i kor edidre, murubuglo kide yoba meglmara suna moraiglkwa i, di meda ede teo. Ene yoko yobuglo bogl teiga pre ene yoba yoko ake ple di teo dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Ene konbauna wan enaiglmara i, ene taragl ta idre, pikraiglkwa. Ene mige gol mo, silva mo, mige gogl ta girsre, pikraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Te, ene ama hanbek ki ikre, gagl suna suo ikre, muglbo ikre, kaglno towo tau ama akidre, pikrio. I siragl pre ene kogon eraiglmara i, yoba ene topo tedre, kaya mokna tenaiglkwa i, kuno erumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Ana ene siti swara mo dumo swara ta ede suna enaiglmara i, ene dumo suna i, yugu nem yagl du ta morabuka i dokidre, ye kipamara swara i pai mogl, okuo dumo i kide kodo ede bage kor ta enaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Te, ene ede yugu ta panaiglmara yugugl ebi, ene komono kana yoba wakai di teo. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Ye ene di ibi, ye ama deno muduno wida dinabedi di teo. Ba ene di ikribi, ye deno muduno wida dinabedi di tekrio.<verse eid="MAT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Ana ene dumo swara ta ebi, yoba ene kano prikre, ta di ikribi, ene yuguno mo dumono i kide kodio. Te, ede enaiglkwa igne, kaglno kugane tama bagl ede, ede meda pio. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Na ene kaima di teiga, Yoba i ene kano sedigwa pre God yoba ka tage tenabuka igne, Sodom ya Gomora yoba ka tage tenabuka i, kebra dagl tenabuka ba yoba i, ka podo tage tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yubun tau okuo plau dinabuka pre dugwa<figure style="fig" alt="Sheep and wolves" file="LB00011b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="10.15" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mak 13.9-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene prio. Na ene dediga i, sipsip mere yegl moglsre, ede agl are meglmara suna enaiglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Yegl pre toki kan kun ere wan meglmere yegl, ene kan kun ere wan moglsre, te ama kua yumugl taragl swara ta ere sikrimere yegl, ene yoba ere sikre, ere kide ere tekraiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Te, ene yoba pre kan kun erio. Ye ene si kane sidre, kot ere tedre, ka mabuno yuguno yenabara ene duglnai sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18-19" />Yegl ersre, ene na duglo beglmedi ene gudu i pi king ya gavana moraiglmara edenaiglkwa. Edibi, na kana yoba kade wagle ya yugobuno pere pere ta moraiglkwa i, ama di tenaiglkwa. Ene di tenaiglkwa i, ene ka siragl mere didre, mem siragl mere dinaiglkwa i, pre yubun dekrio. I siragl pre ege i ene ka siragl mere dinaiglkwa i, beke tenaglka. <verse eid="MAT 10:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Beke tebo, dinaiglkwa igne, ene digwa mere yegl ta paikrabuka ba Neno Kade Murubuglomo ene drano mina ka dugwa mere yegl panabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Ana yegl panan, yoba yene agroma i pi kot wagle edibi, ye si goraiglkwa. Te, yoba gagroma ere mogl, yene neno mano kano sedidre, i pi kot wagle edibi, yoba ye si goraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Te, ene na duglo beglmedi yoba mudu ene kide kanaiglkwa. Ba yoba ta ibun idre, adigl gigledi moraiglkwa i, ege kide i dudunabuka igne, God ye ere inabuka.<verse eid="MAT 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Yoba dumo swara ta ene ere sinamnedi eraiglmara i, ene dumo i kide kodo, teke ede dumo ta pio. Yegl pre na ene kaima di teiga, ene Israel yoba dumono mudu ta pi kana beke te kodokribi, dumo tau yoko yenan, na Yoba Wam moglka i, ikne unaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Skul gak ye tisamo egre atne edekraiglkwa. Te, yoba boi paigwa i, ye yaglno kade ta egre atne edekraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ba ye suo akie tisano ya yaglno kade ibun inaiglmere i, no ama beke inamga kuno erumedi praiglkwa. Yegl pre na yubun imere yegl, ene ama inaiglkwa paugwa. Na yugu nem mere yegl moglka i, yoba na Belsebul motne digwa pre ene na yobanama meglkwa i, ka kide kaima ene di tenaiglkwa pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl di te, God swara kuduglmo golo dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Ba ene yegl mere ere kide ere tenaiglkwa i, ye kuduglno goglkrio. I siragl pre ege ta unan, taragl kane kane ta atne teke yogwa i, mudu u nogugl enan, yoba pre pogl sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Na erme ka tau mim erumara ene di teiga i, okuo ermine yoba di tenaiglkwa. Te, na ka nunu di teiga i, ene yugu idaugle moglsre, yoba di nogugl ede teo.<verse eid="MAT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Yoba ene ogono nagino keme si goraiglkwa i pre kuduglno goglkraiglkwa. Ye ogono nagino mina si goraiglkwa ba kiano ta ere kide erekraiglkwa. Yoba kuduglno goglkre, God swara kuduglmo goraiglkwa. Ye yoba ogono nagino si goglsre, kiano akie pia si doga kade mina edenabuka yagl moglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Birds" file="hk00070b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British and Foreign Society" ref="10.29" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba kua idada suo maket ere, mige gogl swara we digwa ba kua kebra yegl mere yage makandigle sigwa i, God pre kan eruko, keme yage sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30-31" />God kua kebra yegl mere sugl wakai moglkwa pre ene meglkwa i, taragl kade mungo, God no bitno yugo swara swarade wakai ere, kere kan kodumedi prisre, yoba swara ta kuduglmo goglkraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba Jisas agaimo goglkre, ye swara wakai kaima kanaiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luk 12.8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta ere mogl, yoba gumuglno mina Na Jisas duglo boluwe dinabuka i, na Nina heven ibo moglkwa i, moglmara di nogugl edidre, Yoba i na duglo boglkwa yoba ta moglmiwe dinaglka. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Ba yoba ta yoba gumuglnomugl Na Jisas duglo boglkrie dinabuka i, na Nina heven ibo moglkwa i, moglmara ama di nogugl edidre, Yoba i na duglo boglkwa yoba ta moglkrume dinaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na yoba si buno dinagledi wiga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12.51-53</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Na makadigle wiga i, ene kuda bu yenabedi pre umedi prikrio. Na kuda bu yenabedi ukrika ba bainet ta yuiga mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />I siragl pre na wiga i, yoba si buno di, ere pere pere edibo, wano ye nenoma kudano ikne meglbi, te, abro ye manoma kudano ikne meglbi, te, abu ye ebianoma kudano ikne moraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Te, yoba bormai swara meglkwa i ye kudano ikne ikne kaima moraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maika 7.6</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Yoba ta ye nem mam dem muduo podo tedre, na dem muduo kuri keme naran, ye na duglo boglkwa yoba ta moglkrabuka. Mo, yoba ta ye wam mo abuglo dem muduo podo tedre, na dem muduo kuri keme naran, ye na duglo boglkwa yoba morabuka i, ama kuno ta erekrabuka. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Te, yoba ta na pre gorakiure, ye ede prak ta tebi, kakekragledi mane di pran, ye ama na duglo boglkwa yoba ta moglkrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Yoba ta na pre gorabuka i pra we dinan, ye kor kaima morabuka. Ba yoba erme keme kor mogl, wakai moragledi pran, ye u kide enabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ta Jisas kogonmo yoba ake ple dinaiglkwa i, topo wakai inaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mak 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta ene di inan, ye na di idre, Nina na dedugwa i, ama di yugwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Ka kep yoba ta ene meglmara udre, ka kep ere dinabuka pre ene di idre, ake ple di ten, ka kep yoba i, topo inabere mere ene ama inatnga. Te, yoba du ta ene meglmara udre, mabuno du erabara i ene di idre, ake ple di ten, ye topomo inabere mere ene ama kuno ere topo inatnga. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Te, na duglo boglkwa yoba yoko kaima ta morabuka ba na duglo boglkwa pre ene nigl kor kap swara ta kogl tebi, na ene kaima di teiga, ene topono ta wau boglkrabuka. Topo inaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Jon Baptais duglo beglkwa yagl Jisas moglmara dedugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela nomane yegl te kodidre, dedugo, ye ede eigwa. Ede eigo, Jisas ere mogl, God kamo beke tenagledi dumo i kide kodo, Juda yoba dumono pere pere yomara wan ede ogwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Ana Jon kane yugu pai moglsre, Jisas kogon kane kane erukwa i, digo, Jon prisre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl Jisas moglmara pi di praiglmedi dede, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Jisas yegl di prio dugwa, Yagl ta unabuka ikra, ene uno mo no yoba ta pre sugl moramne? di prio dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye pi Jisas yegl di priko, <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ede ikne pi, ene siragl taragl kandre, prisre, erikwa i, Jon di teo dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Yoba gumuglno kin yogwa i, aglke kor kanigo, kaglno kide erukwa i konbauna ede eigo, yoba leprosi erikwa i, ogono nagino u wakai omiwe di teo. Te, yoba gogl kodigwa i, u kor eigo, te, goduglme yoba ye God kamo wakai i, priko, no kamne di, Jon yegl di teo. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Te, ka ta ama yegl di tenaiglkwa. Yoba na erabedi primere ta erekrika ba na pre medigl mogl yage sikrikwa i, gun yenaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Reeds" file="hk00113b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="11.7">Ir sugo, egre piga dugwa</figure>Ana yagl wagle i ede eigo, Jisas ere mogl, yoba mere makai si meglkwa i Jon pre ka tau yegl di togwa, Ene okna yagl Jon kanamnedi dumo wau yomara eigwa i, ye siragl mere moglkwa kanamnedi ede eime? Jon yobuglo paikruko, ir u sugo, egre ya kugl kan piga dumere yegl mere moglko, kanamnedi eimo? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Ta manugwa. Mo, Jon kugugl gagl wakai kaima ta edugwa i kanamnedi eimo? Ta manugwa. Yoba ta kugugl gagl wakai kan neigwa i, ye king yuguno toglno suna i keme meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Mo, ene God kamo kep yoba ta kanamnedi ede eime? Kaima, Jon kaima God kamo kep yagl ta moglkwa ba ye ka kep yagl yoko ta moglkrukwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />God kamo okna yagl ta unabe dugwa i, Jon moglme dugwa. God kamo yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">Ene pro! Na yagl ta kana kep ero dibo, ye ene enatnara ede okna enabiwa. Ye ene enatnara ede okna pi, yoba konbauna ake kun erimere yegl erabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malakai 3.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 11:10">dugwa i, Jon yoba i moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Na ene kaima di teiga, Jon yoba nigl bugl togwa moglkwa i, yagl kade mogl, yoba mudu erme makandigle meglkwa i egre togwa. Ba okuo kaima God yoba kingno morabuka igne i yoba yoko kaima ta morabuka i, Jon erme makadigle moglmere mere yegl moglkrabuka ba mogl mitna kaima edenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Ana Jon nigl bugl togwa yagle kogon mabuno bogl erukwa igne ede u ege erme ugwa i, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka ka i, yobuglo ere, ede eglke eglke pi pai moglko, yoba yobuglo ere, God kingno morabara ede suna u pai meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Yoba God lomo digwa ya ye kamo kep ere digwa i, di ede wimara i, Jon okuo kaima ugwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Te, na ka diga i, ene kaima pramnedi pribi, na ene yegl di tenaglka, God kamo kep yoba ye Elaija okuo unabe digwa i, ye Jon unabuka pre digwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Ene na kana pramnedi pribi, wakai ere kinano gudu prio dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene yoba erme paigwa i, na Jon bogl akie no kenaglno sigwa i, na ka ebrie siragl we di boragle? Yoba maket ere meglmara gak tau daragl erimere mere yegl gak kade tau ere mogl, gak tau di te, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />Ene daragl yegl erio! dimere yegl ene yegl meglkwa. Moglsre, ene ama ka yegl digwa, No pu migi sidre, ene kaglno egrio dumga i, kaglno egrekrikwa. Te, no kai giglage sidre, kai erio dumga i, ene kai erekrimiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Ka ebrie i mina kuno yegl mere, ene Jon nigl bugl togwa yagle kaya mokna nekre, wain nekre, erukwa i kide kandre, ye Murubuglo kide suna ta moglme digwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Te, na Yoba Wam moglka i, ede nogugl wiga igne, na bret ya nigl wain akie neiga. Yegl neigo, na ama kenaglna sidre, Yagl i kaya mokna podo nedre, spak erukwa yagle moglsre, tadaglme ya taks igwa yoba bogl begane yei wan moglmiwe digwa. Ba yoba ta God nomanemo wakai pre igwa meglkwa i, ye kogono i mina i nogugl edinaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba nomano yake tekrikwa i, ka tage inaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10.13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Ana yoba dumo yegl meglkwa i, nomano yake tekrikwa pre ka togwa. Dumo yegl i, Jisas kimagl mere kide suna erukwa ba yoba mere nomano yake tekrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />Yegl pre Jisas yegl dugwa, Ene Korasin ya Betsaida yoba meglkwa i, yubun podo inaiglkwa. Na ene gumuglnomugl kimagl mere erika ba nomane yake tekrikwa pre diga. Na taun suo Tair ya Saidon kimagl yegl ta pi eria, taun suo i, kamun kuade nomano yake tedre, lap gagle yaglkwa pre, yugum pere edimara bolamugl ame digo. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ba na ene di teiga, God yoba ka tage tenabuka igne, Tair yoba ya Saidon yoba yubun tau kebra dagl inaiglkwa ba ene yubun podo kaima inaiglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Te, ene Kapernaum yoba ene mogl mitna edidre, heven ibo enaiglmo? Ta pikraiglkwa. Ene ede atne kaima pidre, yoba geglkwa pai meglmara enaiglkwa. I siragl pre na okna dumo Sodom pidre, kimagl tau ene meglmara erimere yegl eria, dumo Sodom erme pai moglko we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ba na ene di teiga, God yoba ka tage tenabuka igne, Sodom yoba yubun tau kebra dagl inaiglkwa ba ene yubun podo kaima inaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dugwa i, Yoba na moglmara wibi, deno muduno wida di inaiglmiwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Ana igne i Jisas kamage ere, yegl dugwa, Nina, ene kamun mitna ya makan gaba Nem Yagl motnga i, na ene kagn kade teiwa. Ene yoba tau mogl mitna edidre, bitno podo pamedi prikwa i kinano si gi di tedre, pre pogl si dinaiglmedi ersre, yoba gak kebra nomano pamere mere igwa i, pre pogl sinaiglmedi etniwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Nina, ka kaima ene yegl etnga i, siragl pre enene wakai pitnere etnga.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Na Nina taragl mudu na ogona mina edugwa. Te, na God Wam kaima siragl mere moglka i, yoba ta pre kan erekrikwa ba na Nina yene pre kan erukwa. Te, na Nina siragl mere kaima moglkwa i, yoba ta pre kan erekrikwa ba na ye Wam moglka i, nana pre kan erika. Te, na yoba ta i nogugl ede tenagledi prika i keme Nina pre kan eraiglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Ene yoba ta kogon podo ere moglsre, yubun kake meglkwa i, na moglmara wio. Ene na moglmara wibi, na ene ir si praiglmedi ere tenaglka. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Na mogl mitna edekre, yoba ere wakai ere teiga yoba moglka pre ene na mabunona bekio. I siragl pre ene na mabunona beke moglsre, duglo beglbi, ene kaima ir si prisre, deno muduno wida di inaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />I siragl pre na ene na duglo boraiglmara i, na ene yubun podo kake tenaiglmedi tekraglka. Taragl tau u dinabuka i keme ene kakenaiglmedi tenaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Wakan kade ege i, Jisas sugl mole dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mak 2.23-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ana wakan kade ege ta Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl wan ede pi yoba kugl mogo ere yaiglmara suna eigwa. Ye ede suna eigo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl kidan gogl, kugl mogo tau ursre, nedre, nedre, ede eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Ne ede eigo, Farisi yoba tau kandre, ye di te, yegl digwa, Ene duglo beglkwa yagl erima, kano! Ye Wakan Kade ege mawagl pamara kugl mogo si yuime digwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Okna ibo Devit ya yoba tau ye bogl akie meglkwa i, kidan geglko, Devit siragl mere erukwa i, ene kerimo mo kerekrime? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Ye God yugumo yomara ede yugugl pidre, bret tau God gumuglo mina yeigwa i tau i nedre, yoba ye bogl akie meglkwa i ama tau togo, neigwa. Lo dugwa i, tawa teigwa yoba keme bret i nenaiglme dugwa ba Devit kidan goglkwa pre yegl erume dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Te, ene God lomo kere kankrikwa paugwa. God lomo dumere mere wakan kade ege tawa teigwa yoba God yugumo mina kogono ere pai meglkwa ba ye kogon erimara i, wakan kade lomo ta si biglki dikrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Te, na wiga i, na tawa teigwa yugu kogonmo paugwa i, egre atne ediga. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />God kamo bage ta dugwa i, Na ene tawa naraiglmedi prikrika. Ene yoba pere mitno goraiglmedi priwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosea 6.6</char></note> dugwa. Bage i pre pogl sima, na duglo beglkwa yobama kenaglno ta sikriko, dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />I siragl pre na Yoba Wam moglka i, wakan kade ege i, na Nem Yagl moliwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakan kade ege Jisas yagl ogo mawa sugwa ta ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mak 3.1-6</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Ana Jisas dumo i kide kodidre, ede yoba i ka mabuno yuguno yugugl ta ogo, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />yagl ta ogo koglo mawa sugwa ama yugugl moglkwa. Ana Farisi yoba ye Jisas aglau ere dinan, kot ere tenamnedi prisre, ye yegl di prikwa, Wakan kade ege, yoba ta kide sinan, ere wakai ere tenamga i, mawagl panabo mo paikrabe? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, ka ebrie ta yegl dugwa, Ene wakan kade yogwa pre sipsip ta kiglbi, yage maugl atne sinan, kanige eriaglmo mo erekraiglme? Kodio, ene gudu i meda edenaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Ene sipsip pre yegl eraiglkwa ba yoba taragl kade paugwa pre wakan kade ege nono yoba ere wakai ere tenamga i, mawagl ta paikrumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Jisas yegl didre, yagl ta ogo mawa sugwa ikra yegl di togwa, Ene ogon ake duglo suo! dugwa. Yegl dugo, sugo, ogo koglo pamere yegl u wakai ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Yegl erukwa ba Farisi yoba kandre, ede meda pi, yene makai si mogl, Jisas siragl mere ere kide ere tenaiglmere i pre ka di keglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye God kogonmo yoba kaima moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Ana Farisi yoba nomano pamere i, Jisas pre kan erukwa pre dumo i kide kodo, ede ogwa. Te, ye omara i, yoba mere kide ye duglo bogl ede eigo, yoba tau kide sigwa i, Jisas mudu ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Ere wakai ere tedre, ye di te, Na ira moglka i, yoba ta di tekrio di, mane dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Ka kep yagl Aisaia okna God dra idre, dugwa i, plau dinabuka pre Jisas yegl erukwa. Aisaia ka kep ere yegl dugwa,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />Na yagl ta kere igo, ye na niglna kogona yoba moglma kanio. Na dena muduna ye tedre, ye we di prika igne, na gun yeiga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:18">Na Murubuglona ye tebo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:18">ye mabuno du Jentail yoba di pogl tenabiwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Ye yoba bogl nonga ta dikre, ka podo ama ta dikrabuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:19">Te, ye konbauna adigl mogl, ka podo ta dikrabuka.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Yoba ta yobuglno paikrabuka mo ye yene ake ple dibi, kuno erekrabuka i, ye si atne edekre, ere wakai ere tenabuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:20">Ye kogon yegl ere pai morabara i, mabuno du win sinabuka.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Te, Jentail yoba moraiglkwa i, yagl swara i no ere wakai ere norabukra we di pre gi dinaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 42.1-4</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 12:21">dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Farisi yoba Jisas Satan yobuglo togo, kogon erume digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mak 3.20-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Ana ege ta murubuglo kide yagl ta moglmara suna moglko, yagl i ka prikre, dikre, eruko, gumuglo ama kin yogwa. Yoba yagl i auro yu, Jisas moglmara edigo, Jisas ye ere wakai ere togo, yagl i ka prisre, didre, kandre, erabuka mudu kuno erukwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Jisas yegl ere togo, yoba mere kide kandre, nagino koglsre, grigle di, yegl digwa, Yagl i, Devit Gawamo ta unabe digwa ikra um kana? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ba ka yegl digo, Farisi yoba ka i prisre, ye kide kaima pre yegl digwa, Yoba i, Belsebul murubuglo kide bitno moglkwa ikra we, yobuglo togo, murubuglo kide di meda edumiwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Ana Farisi yoba nomano pamere i, Jisas pre kan kodidre, ye di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba ta dumo swara ta moraiglkwa i, yene si buno di ede suo pidre, kuda beglbi, dumono u kide pi kodinabuka. Mo, yoba bormai swara meglkwa i, yene ikne ikne kuda beglbi, ye ama u kide enaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Kuno yegl mere Satan ye yene si meda edenan, ye yene mina kuda boglkwa pre ye siragl mere yobuglo ere dumomo sugl mogl pai morabe? Dumo wau yenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Te, ene kogono yoba ama murubuglo kide di meda edime digwa i, ye Belsebul yobuglo togo, di meda edime ta dikrikwa. Yegl dibi, ene ka tage tenaiglkwa. Ene na pre Belsebul yobuglo naruko, murubuglo kide di meda edume digwa i, ta kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ba ene prio! Na murubuglo kide di meda ediga i, God yobuglomo mina erika pre God ene kingno mogl, suglno morabuka igne i ene meglmara u kodumedi prio! di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Yagl Kide yobuglomo podo paugwa i, yugumo sugl moran, yoba ta ye taraglmo inagledi eran, ta kuno erekrabuka. Ba yoba ta ye taraglmo inagledi pran, ye komono kana ogo kagle kan si padiglsre, okuo ye taraglmo mudu ta yugugl yenabuka i, inabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta na bogl akie moglkrumga i, ye na kudana ikne ta moglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Te, na yoba ere i suna edenagledi ere moglmara yoba na ake ple di narekrabuka i, ye ama yoba si pere pere edumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Yegl pre na ene yegl di teiga, Yoba tadaglme siragl mere ta eraiglkwa ya God ka kide di tenaiglkwa i, God ye gugl ede tenabuka ba yoba ta God Murubuglomo di kide yei tenan, God ye tadaglmemo i, gugl ede tekrabuka. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Yoba ta na Yoba Wam moglka i ka kide di naran, God ye tadaglmemo i gugl edenabuka. Ba yoba ta Mudu Murubuglo di kide yei tenabuka i, God ye ege erme mo okuo ta unabuka i, aimadi ta gugl ede tekrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ka ebrie ta didre, ede kide mogo kide korabe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ede wakai ta mogo kide ta koglkrabuka. Te, ede kide ta mogo wakai ta koglkrabuka. Yegl pre yoba ede swara swarade mogo siragl mere keglkwa i kandre, ede wakai paimo mo kide paimo mo i, kan pogl sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Ba ene toki kide mere yegl meglkwa. Ene yoba kide meglkwa pre ene ka wakai ta dinaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. I siragl pre siragl taragl yoba ta dem muduo mina kau sugwa i, ye ka dugwa igne ede meda ugwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Yoba wakai ta morabuka i, ye nomane ya dem muduo wakai paugwa pre ebrie mabunomo ama wakai panabuka. Ba yoba kide ta morabuka i, ye nomanemo ya dem muduo kide paugwa pre ye ebrie mabunomo ama kide panabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Ba na ene di teiga, Ene ka gua gua siragl mere ta dimere i, okuo God yoba kotno prabuka igne, God gumuglo mina ene di peglbi, ka tage tenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Yegl pre ene ka dimara i mina God ene tau ka tage tenabuka. Tedre, tau du meglmiwe dinabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba tau Jisas kimagl eran, kanamnedi prikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mak 8.11-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Ana okuo God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba akie ede Jisas moglmara udre, yegl di prikwa, Tisa yo, ene kimagl ta etn, no kandre, pre medramniwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, ye yegl di togwa, Ene yugobuno erme meglkwa i, ene u kide pi kodigwa. Abu ta wie kide kodo yagl ta bogl kunogl nebrere mere yegl ene God kide kodigwa. Na kimagl ya diu ta etn, kanamnedi prikwa ba na ta erekraglka. Na kimagl swara ta eribo, kanaiglkwa i, Jona okna erumere yegl eribo, kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Jona buglo bagle kade dane wagle ege suota etne ya eduer moglmere mere yegl, na Yoba Wam moglka i, ege suota etne ya eduer makan atne pai moraglka pre diwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Na ka tau Jona pre dinaglka i, ama yegl dinagle dugwa. God yoba ka tage tenabuka igne, Ninive yoba adigl, ene yoba erme meglkwa i, mabunono kide yomedi i nogugl edenaiglkwa. I siragl pre Jona ye Ninive yoba meglmara pi God kamo di togwa igne, ye mudu nomano yake teigwa ba na erme yagl kade mogl, Jona egre teiga magigl moglka i, ene nomano yake tenakrimiwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Te, igne i abu dumo Seba kwin moglkwa ikra ama adiglsre, ene yoba yugobuno erme meglkwa i, mabunono kide pamedi i nogugl edenabuka. I siragl pre king Solomon nomanemo wakai pame digwa pre abu kwin i, ye dumo eglke kaima moglsre, u Solomon ka dinan, pragledi ugwa. Ba na kade mogl, king Solomon nomanemo egre teiga moglka i, magigl akie munga ba na kana prakrimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye murubuglo kide ta yoba moglmara kide kodidre, okuo ede ikne ugwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Murubuglo kide ta yoba ta moglmara kide kodidre, ede meda enan, ye dumo ta kugla di yomara suna wan mogl, dumo wakai ta ye wakan morabuka i, dokinabuka ba ye ta kankrabuka. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Kankre, yegl dinabuka, Na yugu ta okna kipaiga kide kodimara ikra, ede ikne enaluwe dinabuka. Yegl didre, ede ikne enan, ye kanabuka i, yugu nem yugu i brum didre, ere wakai ere kodugo, yugu yoko yogwa mere yegl pamedi kanabuka. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Ye yegl kandre, pi murubuglo kide 7-pela mabuno kide mina ede okna eigwa i, ama doko inan, ye akie ede ikne unaiglkwa. Ye ede ikne u yoba i moglmara suna moraiglkwa. Yegl eribi, ye okna kide moglmere moglkre, u kide kaima enabuka. Kuno yegl mere yoba erme kide meglkwa i, ye meglmara taragl yegl ama plau dinabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba ira mam agiglema meglkwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mak 3.31-35</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Ana Jisas yoba mere meglmara ka yegl di te moglko, ye mam ya agiglema u meda adigl mogl, Jisas unan, ka di tenamnedi pre sugl kan meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Meglkwa pre yagl ta ede yugugl u Jisas di tedre, Ene man ya agiglnma meda mogl, ene ka di tenamnedi sugl kan meglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yegl dugwa ba Jisas di ikne ede, yegl di togwa, Na mana ya agrama ira meglmedi pitne? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Didre, ye ogo buglo si, ye duglo beglkwa yoba meglmara edidre, yegl dugwa, Kanio. Yoba i na mana ya agrama meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Yegl paugwa pre yoba ira ta na Nina heven ibo moglkwa i, kamo prisre, duglo boraiglkwa i keme na agrama moglsre, abarama moglsre, manama moglsre, erimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Yagl ta kugl mogo suduglkwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mak 4.1-9</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Briars" file="hk00122b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="13.1" />Ana ege i, Jisas yugu i kide kodidre, ede pi nigl nubun bina ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Ame di moglko, yoba mere kide ye moglmara eigwa pre ye aglke kor ede baglkugl mina ede egli pi ame dugo, yoba mere kide nigle bina adigl meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Adigl meglko, Jisas ka ebrie mere kaima beke togwa. Ta dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Ene prio. Yagl ta kugl mogo i pi sudragledi ede ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Kugl mogo i pi sudugl ake pia sugo, kugl mogo tau yage konbauna sigwa. Kugl mogo i, kua pru di u neimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Te, tau, yage makan gaba kuri ta kobuglo bolamugl moglmara yage sigwa. Kugl mogo i, makan gaba mere yeikrumara yage sigwa pre tabre parikwa <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />ba ade ede mitna ugwa igne, duglane ede atne pikrukwa pre kugl i tabre ade de, yaminugwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Te, tau yage kan kagigle yaglkwa bogl moglmara sigwa. Kugl mogo i pare wi sigo, kan kagigle yaglkwa i ama akie pare ede mitna pi, kugl i atne edugwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage makan wakai yomara sigwa. Kugl mogo i, pare ede mitna pi, mogo wakai koglkwa. Tau 100 keglko, tau 60 keglko, tau 30 keglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba na kana ta pramnedi praiglkwa i, na ka diga i wakai ere kinano gudu prio! dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabuno ta paugwa pre Jisas ege ege ka ebrie keme dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mak 4.10-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Ana okuo Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba ye moglmara udre, ye kira pogl yegl di prikwa, Ene ka ebrie mina keme yoba ka beke tenga i, siragl pre etne? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno morabuka kamo mem teke paugwa i, ye ene pre pogl sinaiglmedi pra we dugwa. Ba yoba tau meglkwa i, ye pre pogl si dinaiglmedi mane dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Yegl paugwa pre yoba ta na ka diga pre igwa meglkwa i, God nomane tau i tebe ede tenan, pre kawa tenaiglkwa. Ba yoba ta na ka diga prakirikwa meglkwa i, ye kunabe ta primere i, God i eglke ede tenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Yegl pre na ka ebrie mere diga. I siragl pre ye gumuglno wakai paugo, kaima kan meglkwa ba siragl mere kanigwa i, kan pogl sikrikwa. Te, ye kinano wakai paugo, wakai ere prikwa ba ka prakiure, nomane ikrikwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />I mina, ka kep yagl Aisaia ka ta okna boglkwa i, pai yugwa. Ye boglkwa i, God dra idre, yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Ene ege ege prisre, ka i ta pre pogl sikraiglkwa. Te, ene ege ege kanigwa ba kaima ta kan pogl sikraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />I siragl pre Israel yoba meglkwa i, ye nomano gigle dugo, kinano kegl dugo, gumuglno ama kuglkwa. Ye ta prisre, ede ikne na moglmara unaiglkwa ta kuno eran, na ye kideno aragan ere, bu yenabedi ere tenaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 6.9-10</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 13:15">di, Aisaia yegl boglme di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Na ene meglmara kogon mere eriko, ene gumuglno mina kandre, kinano mina pre pogl sidre, erikwa pre ene gun yeio. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />I siragl pre na ene ka kaima di teiga. Ene taragl tau kanigwa ya ka mere prikwa i, ka kep yoba ya yoba du okna meglkwa i, kanamnedi sugl meglkwa ba kankrikwa. Te, ka i pramnedi sugl meglkwa ba prikrimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas kugl mogo suduglkwa pre ka ebrie dugwa ikra, mem di poglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mak 4.13-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Jisas ama yegl dugwa, Na ka ebrie ta yagl kugl mogo suduglkwa pre diga i, mem di poglbo, praiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka kamo i, yoba ta prisre, pre pogl sikrikwa meglkwa i, yagl kide udre, kugl mogo ta ye nomano mina yage sugwa i, i eglke edugwa. Na kugl mogo tau yage konbauna bina sime diga i, yoba i pre diga. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage kobuglo moglmara sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo prikwa igne, ye tabre pre idre, gun yeigwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ba duglane ede atne pikrumere mere yegl meglkwa pre ye ege sugunagle keme ka prikwa pre ka primara pre yubun ta teigwa mo ye ere sibi, ye tabre yage sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Te, kugl mogo tau yage kan kagigle yaglkwa boglmara sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo prikwa ba ye erme mogl pai eraiglkwa i ya mige moni inaiglkwa i we di prisre, erme gun yenaiglkwa i pre i mitna edigwa pre kan kagigle yaglkwa i, kugl i atne edumere mere yegl, taragl i ye nomano mina kau sugo, ye mogo wakai ta koglkrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ba kugl mogo tau yage makan wakai yomara sime diga i, yoba tau God kamo primara i, ye pre pogl kaima sigwa pre diga. Ye God kamo pre pogl sidre, mogo wakai keglkwa. Tau ki 100 keglko, tau ki 60 keglko, tau ki 30 yegl keglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye kugl kide tau kugl wit bogl akie parikwa pre ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Ana Jisas ye yoba makai si meglkwa i, ka ebrie ta ama di tedre, yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i pre ka ebrie yegl dinaglka. Yagl ta kugl wit mogo i pi ye makanmo mina suduglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Sudiglsre, ugl paugo, ye niglmo kogonmo yoba ama ugl paigwa. Ugl paigo, eduer i, kudamo ikne meglkwa i, kugl kide mogomo akie sudiglsre, ede eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ana okuo kugl wit pare ede mitna pidre, mogo keglko, kanigwa i, kugl kide i ama akie paimedi kanigwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Makan nem yagl i niglmo kogonmo yoba kandre, u yegl di teigwa, Yagl kade yo, no prumga i, ene kugl mogo wakai i pi suduglnedi prumga. Ba siragl eruko, kugl kide tau mere suna parume? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Yegl digo, ye di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na kudana ikne ta moglkwa i, kugl kide mogo tau suduglkwa pamiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye aglke kor yegl di prikwa, Yegl panan, no kugl kide i pru edinamno? di priko, <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />ye mane didre, Kanige erio dugwa. Kugl kide i pru edinamnedi eribi, kowai wit akie pru ede dinaiglmiwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Kanige eribi, wit denabuka igne, si yunaiglkwa yoba dedibo, enaiglkwa i, kugl kide komono kana si koglo sidre, doga mina garaiglkwa pre i pere edidre, wit mogo i pi yugugl makai simara edinaiglmiwe di, makan nem yagl i yegl dumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ede mastet mogomo ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mak 4.30-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Ana Jisas ye ka ebrie swara ta ama yegl di togwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, ede mastet mogomo mere yegl ta pame dinaglka. Yagl ta mastet mogo ta i pi kaya mokna ere yaglmara suna yaglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Ana mastet mogo i, kebra kaima yedre, kaya mokna mogo tau togwa ba mastet pare ede mitna ogwa igne, ede mere yegl pai, kaya mokna mudu egre i atne edugwa. Ede mere yegl paugo, yogagle mina kua tau mere u yugo bagl paimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yis ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Jisas yegl didre, ye ka ebrie ta ama yegl di togwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, yis mere yegl pame dinaglka. Abu ta flaua mere yomara i, yis kunabe kaima ta i atne edugo, flaua mudu ake poia di, ede u podo ome dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mak 4.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Ana Jisas ye yoba mere kide makai si meglko, ka di togwa i, mudu ka ebrie keme di togwa. Ye ka yoko swara ta dikrukwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Dumara i mina, God kamo kep yagl ta ka ta boglkwa i, pai inabuka pre dugwa. Ye ka boglkwa i, yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Na drana mina ka ebrie di nogugl edenaglka i, God okna dumo makan ere yogwa igne ede u erme ugwa i, taragl tau teke paugwa i, di nogugl edinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 78.2</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 13:35">di, yegl boglkwa i pai yugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugl kide ka ebrie i, mem siragl mere paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Ana Jisas yoba mere kide makai si meglmara kide kodidre, ede yugugl ta ogo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ye omara i pidre, ye yegl di prikwa, Ene kugl wit ya kugl kide pre ka ebrie dinga i, mabunomo di pogl notn, pramniwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i yegl digo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta kugl mogo wakai i pi suduglme diga i, na Yoba Wam moglka i pre diga. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Te, kugl mogo i pi makan mina suduglme diga i, makan i dumo makan mudu pre diga. Te, kugl mogo wakai we diga i, God yoba kingno morabara yoba ta suna moraiglkwa i pre diga. Te, kugl kide parime diga i, yagl kide gagiglma meglkwa i pre diga. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Ana kuda ikne ta kugl mogo kide suduglme diga i, Satan pre diga. Te, kugl mogo denabuka ege we diga i, taragl mudu dudunabuka ege i pre diga. Te, kogon yoba pre diga i, na angelo pre diga. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Ana kogon yoba kugl kide koglo si, i pi doga mina gaiglme diga i, ege erme dudunabuka igne, taragl yegl mere plau dinabuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Na Yoba Wam moglka i, angelona dedibo, na king moraglmara i, taragl kide ta suna yei dinabedi ake i suna ede, i meda ede, eraiglkwa. Taragl kane kane ta yoba yage sinaiglmedi eraiglkwa mo yoba ta mabuno kide eraiglkwa i, ye i meda edidre, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />puk si doga podo ta denabara edenaiglkwa. Doga domara i, yoba kai ersre, signo gikr eraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Ege i, yoba du moraiglkwa i, ye Neno Kade king morabara suna i, ade abuglage sumere yegl abuglageno podo sinabuka. Na ka diga i, ene pramnedi pribi, ene wakai ere kinano gudu prio! di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ta mige moni podo teke yeigo, ta u kanugwa pre ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i yegl mere paugwa, yoba ta boks mige ya bonagana podo borabuka ta makan mitna atne yogo, yagl ta wake kandre, gun podo yedre, tabre makan si kegl didre, ye pi taraglmo ya yugumo toglmo mudu topo bogl idre, ye tabre pi makan ta box i yogo, kanumara ikra topo si yumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas bis nuguno ta mige podo boglkwa pre ka ebrie dugwa<figure style="fig" alt="Pearls" file="lb00171b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="13.44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i pre ka ebrie ta ama yegl dinaglka. Bisnis man ta bis nugo kruo wakai wakai yenabuka i, idre, aglke kor topo bogl inagledi doko wan moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Doko wan mogl, ege swara ta pi mige podo kaima borabuka ta kanugwa. Kandre, pi taraglmo mudu ta kan nogwa i, topo bogl idre, bis nugo ikra topo sumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye buglo bagle ere sigwa degigl gagl pre ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, yegl mere paugwa. Yoba tau buglo bagle ere sinamnedi degigl gaglno nigl nubun mina pia si atne edigo, buglo bagle kane kane ede atne eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Degigl gagl kau sugo, ye gudu i meda edidre, nigle bina ame di mogl, buglo bagle wakai ya kide aglade i pere pere edigwa. Ye fis wakai gagl girsre, fis kide kide kodigwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Kuno yegl mere ege erme dudunabuka igne, angelo wagle ede bage bage pidre, yoba du moraiglmara suna i, yoba kide ama suna mogl dinaiglmedi ye ake i swara edidre, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />pia si doga podo domara edenaiglkwa. Doga domara i, yoba kai ersre, signo gikr eraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Ana Jisas ka ebrie yegl didre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl di pre, yegl dugwa, Na ka tau diga i, ene pre pogl simo? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye Owo digwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Owo digo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, I siragl pre yoba ta God lomo pre pogl sidre, God yoba kingno morabuka ka i ama pre pogl sinan, ye yugu nem mere mogltre, taragl wakai wakai kan nogwa mere yegl morabuka. Ye taragl wakai wakai kan nomara i, taragl okna yogwa ya tau erme yogwa i, akie i nogugl edenan, kuno erabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasaret yoba Jisas mokono teigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mak 6.1-6</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ana Jisas ka ebrie yegl di kodidre, dumo i kide kodo, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />ye ede yugomugl Nazaret pidre, ye ka mabuno yugu yomara yugugl pi, yoba ka beke togwa. Ye ka beke te moglko, yoba prisre, nagino kogl, yegl digwa, Aiya, nomane podo yegl ya kimagl tau erukwa i, ira beke togo, erume? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Ye yegl didre, kiam si, ama yegl digwa, Ye kapenta ikra, wam moglko, mam Maria kanumga moglkwa. Te, ye agiglema Jems ya Josep ya Saimon ya Judas meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Ye abaugloma magigl akie munga. Magigl i mogl yakugwa pre yobuglo aglo mere idre, erume? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ye yegl di, kiam sidre, Jisas kubro teigwa. Ba Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, God kamo kep yoba ta morabuka i, yoba dumo pere pere moraiglkwa i, ye kamo praiglkwa ba yene yugomugl yoba ya bormai swara meglkwa i, ye eran, kaima ta prikraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Jisas yegl didre, dumo i kimagl mere ta erekrukwa. I siragl pre yoba i ye pre mediglkrikwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Herot Jisas ye Jon moglmedi prukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mak 6.14-29</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk 3.19-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ana igne i Jisas kimagl ya kogon erukwa i, yoba di ede eigo, Gavana Herot prisre, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />ye niglmo kogonmo yoba yegl di togwa, Yagl Jisas i, ye Jon, nigl bugl togwa yagle goglkwa ikra, ye adigl u kor ogwa pre yobuglo paugo, kimagl yegl erumiwe di, Herot yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3-4" />Ana Herot ye okna Jon si goglkwa i, kamo yegl paugwa, Herot okna ye agigle Filip ebie na ebina morabedi yugwa. Ye agigle ebie i, kagie Herodias. Ye abu Herodias yugo, Jon ye ege mere di te, yegl dugwa, Ene agitn ebie inga i, aglau etniwe dugwa. Jon yegl dugwa pre Herot ye si kane si i pi kane yugu edugwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Edidre, ye si goragledi prukwa ba ye yoba kuduglno goglsre, tabre si goglkrukwa. I siragl pre yoba prikwa i, Jon ye God kamo kep yoba ta moglmedi prikwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ana aglke ta Herot mam ye kuglkwa egemo yogo, yoba kade wagle tau u makai si meglkwa. Makai si meglko, Herodias abuglo ede suna u, kagle egrukwa. Egruko, King Herot wakai kandre, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />abai i ka gigledi di padigl, yegl di togwa, Ene siragl ta kwian borabuka i, na di natn, ene tenaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Yegl dugo, abai mam ye kina sidre, ka beke togo, ye Herot yegl di togwa, Ene yagl Jon, yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa yagle ikra, nugu tabre gare ede, ye bre plet mina yu naratnedi priwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Ana abai i yegl dugo, king kide prukwa ba ye ka giglede okna di paduglkwa ikra pre ya yoba di gaglkwa kan meglkwa gumuglno mina agai gogl dinagledi ye pra, abai i dumere yegl, erio di, ye soldiamo dedugwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Ye soldiamo Jon kane yugu pamara pidre, ye nugu gare, <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />plet mina ede yu abai i teigo, abai i ere mogl, Jon bre i pi mam togwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Ana Herot ye Jon si goglko, Jon duglo beglkwa yoba u ye ogo nagie idre, pi maugl sigwa. Ye maugl si kodidre, u siragl taragl plau dugwa i, Jisas di teigwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas bret ake buko didre, yagl 5,000 mere yegl meglkwa i, togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:31-44">Mak 6.31-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Jon 6.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ana Herot ye Jon si goglkwa i, Jon duglo beglkwa yoba pi Jisas di teigo, prisre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba bogl yene moramnedi bakugl mina ede nigl Galili koglo ibo dumo wau yomara ta eigwa. Ba Jisas ede aglo mere ogwa i, digo, prisre, yoba mere kide yuguno toglno kide kodo, nigl nubun i winabo di, Jisas tegigl yenamnedi eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ana nigl koglo ibo plau digo, Jisas ede makandigle pidre, ye yoba mere kide wigwa i, kandre, mitno goglkwa. Ye mitno goglsre, ye tau kide sigwa i, ere wakai ere togwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Ana Jisas yegl ere moglko, min panagledi erukwa. Eruko, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ede magigl pidre, yegl digwa, Dumo magigl i, yugu togl ta yeikruko, min pai kodugwa pre yoba i dedin, ede enaiglmedi prumniwa. Ye ede taun ya yugu togl yomara kaya mokna topo si nenaiglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba ede bage ta enaiglkwa i ta paikrukwa. Ene kaya mokna ta nenaiglmere teo dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl aglke kor yegl digwa, No bret 5-pela ya buglo bagle suo keme yomne digwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Loaves and fish" file="HK00155b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="14.17" /> <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye di te, bret 5-pela ya buglo bagle suo i, yu nario dugo, yu teigwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ye bret ya buglo bagle yuigo, Jisas yoba mere meglkwa i di te, Ene kugl mina ame dio dugo, ye ame digwa. Ame di meglko, Jisas ye bret 5-pela ya buglo bagle suo ikra idre, kan heven ibo ede, God di wakai yei togwa. Di wakai yei tedre, ake buko didre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yoba i pi tenaiglmedi te pai moglko, ye i pi teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />I pi teigo, yoba mudu neigwa, dano eruko, ye bret ya buglo bagle kawa te yogwa i, gade makai sidre, degigl gagl 12-pela gre kau sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Ana yoba bret ya buglo bagle neigwa i, abu gak kerekrikwa ba yagl keme kerikwa i 5,000 mere yegl meglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas nigl yaudomugl konbauna ede ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mak 6.45-52</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Jon 6.16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl di tedre, Tabre ede bakugl mina pio dugwa. Enene ede okna pi nigl koglo ibo ebi, na yoba mere magigl meglkwa i, di pere pere edinaluwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye ede eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Ana Jisas yoba di pere pere edidre, ye swara ede muglo pi kamage eragledi ede ogwa. Ana Jisas yene muglo ibo moglko, min paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Min paugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ede u eglke pi nigl suna eigo, ir podo u, nigl si pepigl di bakugl guma mina sugo, bakugl enabuka mere manugwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" /><figure style="fig" alt="Peter sinking" file="cn01722B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="14.25" />Igne i kamun tagenabuka magigl eruko, Jisas nigl yaudomugl egre, ede bakugl pamara magigl ogo, <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />ye duglo beglkwa yagl kandre, kudugl podo gogl, grigle di, Yoba goglkwa ta kiamo umiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas oglade yegl di togwa, Ene kiede mogl, kudugl goglkrio! Na wiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Pita ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade ene kaima unga panan, ene din, na nigl yaudomugl ene motnara unagliwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Pita yegl dugo, Jisas, Ede wo! dugo, Pita baglkugl kide kodo, nigl yaudomugl ede Jisas moglmara enagledi ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ye kuno ere egre ogwa ba ye ir podo ugwa pre ye kudugl goglko, nigl i atne, atne edugo, ye kaglkane yei, Yagl Kade, na ere yo! dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Pita ka yegl dugo, Jisas tabre ogo ede, ye akidre, yegl dugwa, Ene na pre mediglnga i, kebra paugwa. Ene siragl eruko, kinan suo yome? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye ede egli bakugl mina ebriko, ir ugwa i, oglade bu yogwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Ir bu yogo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl meglkwa ikra kandre, Jisas kagie kade tedre, Ene ka kaima God Wam motniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede dumo Genesaret pidre, yoba kide sigwa i, mere kide ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mak 6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede nigl koglo ibo dumo Genesaret we dimara i eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Eigo, Genesaret yoba Jisas ikra umedi kandre, ka di wai digo, yoba dumo magigl yeimara i, mudu Jisas umedi prikwa. Prisre, yoba kide sigwa mere kidine auro yu ye moglmara edigwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Edidre, ka gigle di, yegl digwa, Ene kanige etn we, yoba kide sigwa i, ene gaglnen puduo akibi, kideno bu yenabiwe di, yegl di prikwa. Ye yegl di prisre, yoba ira ta Jisas kuguglmo gaglmo akigwa i, ye kideno aragan erukwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Farisi yoba God kamo kide kodo, kowano awano mabunono erikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mak 7.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Ana igne i Farisi yoba tau yeigo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ama tau yeigo, dumo Jerusalem kide kodidre, Jisas moglmara u kira pogl yegl digwa, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />Siragl eruko, ene duglo beglkwa yagl meglkwa i kowano awano mabunono pamere ogono nigl koglkre, kaya mokna ake neime? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene kowano awano mabuno pamere eramnedi God lomo kaima pamara si biglke digwa i, ene siragl pre erime? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />God dugwa i, Ene neno mano kano prisre, pre i mitna edio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.12, Lo 5.16</char></note> dugwa. Didre, ama yoba ta ye nem mo mam ka kide ta di tenan, ene ye si golo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kodigwa 21.17, Tawa Teigwa Yoba 20.9</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />God lomo yegl dugwa ba ene enene mabunono duglo boramnedi yoba ta ye nem mam pre i mitna edidre, taragl tau tenabuka pamara i, i eglke edidre, ye taragl i God tenaluwe dugwa i, ene kuno pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Ye nem mam pre i mitna edidre, ake ple di tenabuka i ta paikrume digwa. Ene yegl dimara i, ene enene mabunono duglo boramnedi God lomo kide kodimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Ene ka didre, mabuno erikwa i, u kuno pikrukwa. Aisaia ye God kamo ta kep ere, ene pre boglkwa i, plau dugwa. Ye ka yegl boglkwa,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />Yoba i ye drano wagle na kagna kade narikwa ba ye deno muduno eglke yomiwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Ye na kagna dagl, ake mina edigwa ba drano mina di yar edimiwa. Di yar edigwa i, i siragl pre ye yoba ka mabuno di tomne digwa i, kaima ta dikrisre, ye yoba lono i keme yoba di teimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 29.13</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 15:9">di, Aisaia yegl boglme dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas siragl taragl yoba si deglbi yenabuka i pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mak 7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Ana Jisas yoba mere magigl wio di, agle dugo, wigo, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na ka ta erme dinaglka i, ene prisre, nomane inaiglme dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Taragl ta meda yogo, ne atne edigwa i, taragl i yoba ta si deglbi yeikrukwa ba taragl ta deno muduno mina yogo, ye drano mina ede meda ugwa i, taragl i kaima yoba si deglbi yomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ana Jisas yegl di kodugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i, ye moglmara udre, yegl digwa, Ene ka dinga i, Farisi yoba kide prikwa i, ene pre kan etno? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13-14" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene Farisi yoba pre pre yubun dekrio. Na Nina heven ibo kaya mokna ere yaglkwa ba taragl tau yene parukwa i, God duglane bogl pru i meda edenabuka. Farisi yoba meglkwa i, ye yoba gumuglno kin yogwa i, konbauna obuno di tomnedi prikwa ba yene ama gumuglno kin yogwa. Kin yogwa pre yoba gumoglno kin yogwa ta ogono akenaiglkwa i, ye akie guglo sinaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Jisas yegl di kodugo, Pita ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene ka ebrie ta dinga i, mabunomo di pogl notn, pramniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yegl dugo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Siragl pre ene aimadi nomane ikrime? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Taragl ta meda yogo, yoba ta ne atne edigwa i, ede deno biglko mina pidre, okuo ede de mur yugu ogwa i, ene prikrikwa paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ba siragl tau yoba deno muduno mina paugo, drano mina di meda edigwa i, taragl i yoba si deglbi yeigwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Yegl pre yoba nomane kide prikwa ya yoba si geglkwa ya kumugl abai mo yagl abu ta bogl kunogl neigwa ya taragl kunogl neigwa ya ka kibi didre, ka kide kane kane digwa mabuno i, ye deno muduno mina padre, ede meda wigwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Mabuno i, ene si deglbi yeigwa mere yegl paugwa ba yoba ta ogo nigl koglkre, kaya mokna ake nogwa i, ye ta si deglbi yeikrumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenan abu ta Jisas pre meduglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mak 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Ana Jisas dumo i kide kodidre, ede pi dumo Tair ya Saidon yebrara magigl ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Ogo, Kenan abu ta dumo igle kipaugwa i, ye moglmara udre, ka podo di, Yagl Kade yo, ene Devit Gawamo motnga i, na mitna goglo dugwa. Murubuglo kide ta na abra moglmara suna moglsre, ye ere kide ere te moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Yegl dugwa ba Jisas ka swara kaima ta di ikne ede tekrukwa. Yegl eruko, Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba ye yegl di teigwa, Abu i, ka nigadi di ugwa pre ene dedin, enabedi prumniwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Nina na dedugwa i, Israel yoba sipsip wau beglkwa mere meglkwa i keme ake ple di tenatnedi na dedumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Jisas yegl dugwa ba abu i u goglko bodugl tedre, kamage yei, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na ake ple di naro! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Dugo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Yoba ta gak kebra kaya mokna nenaiglmere tenaiglkwa i, ake towa si idre, agl ta tebi, wakai ta paikrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Jisas yegl dugo, abu i yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade, ene kuno ere dinga ba agl kiglkwa yoba ta kaya mokna plet mina nebi, kebra yage maginagle sinabuka i, agl i nenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Abu i yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, Abu wakai. Ene na pre mediglnga i, podo paugwa pre ene ta panabedi pitnere plau dinabiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye abuglo ogladi wakai moglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba mere kide, kide sigwa i, ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Ana Jisas dumo i kide kodidre, ede pi nigl nubun Galili moglmara bina pidre, muglo kebra ta pamara pi ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Ame di moglko, yoba mere kide, kide kane kane sigwa auro yu ye moglmara ere wakai ere tenabedi yuigwa. Yoba ogono kaglno mawa sugwa ya kide erukwa i, yudre, yoba gumuglno kin yogwa ya ka dikrikwa i, ama mudu yu Jisas kagle mina edigo, Jisas ye ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Ere wakai ere togo, yoba kinano gi dugwa i, ka priko, yoba ogono kaglno kide erukwa i, u wakai ogo, yoba ye kaglno mawa sugwa i, adigl ede eigo, yoba mere kide wigwa i kandre, nagino keglkwa. Ye nagino koglsre, Israel yoba Godno i, kagie kade teigwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas bret buko didre, yoba 4,000 togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mak 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl agle dugo, wigo, yegl di togwa, Yoba mere kide wigwa i, na mitno goglka. Nono ege suota munara magigl i, ye kaya moknano dudugwa. Aglau eran yoko ede pio dibo, kaima pi konbauna bage gumuglno magran, yage sinaiglkwa mere yegl pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di teigwa, Dumo magigl i, dumo wau yogwa. Nono bret aglo mere i tomin, yoba mere kide i nenaiglme? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Ene bret siramna yeigwa yome? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, Bret 7-pela yogo, buglo bagle kebra suom ta yomga yomiwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Ana Jisas ye yoba i mudu ame dio dugo, ame di meglko, <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />ye bret 7-pela ikra ya buglo bagle tau idre, God di wakai yei tedre, bret ya buglo bagle ake buko di, ye duglo beglkwa yagl togwa. Ye i pi yoba mudu ame di meglkwa i, teigo, <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />ye mudu neigwa, dano erukwa. Dano eruko, tau yoko yogwa i ye i makai sidre, degigl gagl kade 7-pela gre kau sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Te, yoba kaya mokna neimara i, kerikwa yagl 4,000 mere yegl meglkwa ba abu gak ta kerekrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ana Jisas ye yoba mere kide wigwa i, dedugwa, ede eigo, ye baglkugl mina mogl, ede nigl kogl ibo dumo ta Magadan we dimara ogwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Farisi yoba ya Sadyusi yoba ye Jisas di te, Kimagl ta etn, kanamniwe digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mak 8.11-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Ana ege ta Farisi yoba ya Sadyusi yoba tau Jisas moglmara udre, aglau eran kanamnedi yegl digwa, Ene God yobuglomo idre, kimagl ta etn, pre medramniwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yegl digo, Jisas yegl di togwa, Ene poko dugo kamun gogl erukwa kandre, ene tagna wakai erabuka pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Te, tagna mogl, kamun kua gogl erukwa kandre, Erme ir podo unan, kamun sinabiwe digwa. Ene kamun mina taragl yegl plau dugwa kandre, mem i di peglkwa ba ege erme siragl taragl plau dugwa i, kandre, mem i ta di poglkrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Ene yugobuno erme meglkwa i, ene u kide pi kodigwa. Abu ta wie kide kodo yagl ta bogl kunogl nebrere mere yegl ene God kide kodigwa. Na kimagl ya diu ta etn, kanamnedi prikwa ba na ta erekraglka. Na kimagl swara ta eribo, kanaiglkwa i, Jona okna erumere yegl eribo, kanaiglmiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl didre, ye kide kodo, ede ogwa.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Farisi yoba ya Sadyusi yoba yisno pre ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mak 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede nigl koglo ibo eigo, duglo beglkwa yagl kanigwa i, bret ta yukrikwa paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Ana Jisas ye di te, Farisi yoba ya Sadyusi yoba yisno i pre ene kan kun erio! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl wagle prikwa i, No bret ikrumga i pre dumedi drano digwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Ye yegl digo, Jisas pre kan ere, yegl dugwa, Siragl pre ene bret yukrikwa i pre ka drano dime? Ene na pre mediglkwa i, kebra paugwa paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Na bret 5-pela ake buko didre, yagl 5,000 teigo, bret yoko yomara i mina ene degigl gagl siramna mere gre kau sigwa i, ene pre meglmo mo pre moglkrime? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ama yoba 4,000 kuno yegl mere ersre, bret 7-pela mina teigo, kawa togwa degigl gagl kade siramna girikwa ene pre meglmo mo pre moglkrime? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Na bret pre dikrika ba siragl eruko, ene pre pogl sikrime? Na Farisi yoba ya Sadyusi yoba yisno i pre ene kan kun erio diwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yis yoko, yoba bret mina edigwa i pre dikrukwa ba Farisi yoba ya Sadyusi yoba ye ka siragl mere yoba beke teigwa i pre dumedi pre pogl sigwa.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Jisas ira moglkwa i, di poglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mak 8.27-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Ana Jisas ede pi dumo ta taun Sisaria Filipai we dimara magigl yogwa i pidre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl di pre, yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, yoba na ira moglme dime? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ene Jon yoba nigl bugl togwa yagle ikra adigl u kor enga, motniwe digwa. Te, tau digwa i, ene Elaija motniwe digwa. Te, tau digwa i, Jeremaia mo ka kep yoba okna ibo meglkwa i, swarano ta u kor enga, motniwe di, yegl dime digwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yegl di kodigo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Ana ene we? Ene na ira moglme di prime? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Yegl dugo, Saimon Pita di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglsre, God kor aimadi moglkwa i, Wam motniwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Ana Pita ka yegl dugo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Saimon, ene Jona wam motnga i, ene gun yenatnga paugwa. I siragl pre na ira moglka i, yoba ta ene i nogugl ede tekrikwa ba na Nina heven ibo moglkwa i, ene i nogugl ede togwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Te, na ene di teiga, ene kagn Pita paugwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pita kagie mem paugwa i, Kobuglo.</char></note> Te, na yugobuna ede u podo enabedi eraglka i, kobuglo ta magigl yomara i mina yuguna kenaglka mere yegl paugwa. Na yugu i kebo, yagl kide yobama bogl yobuglo ersre, si atne edinamnedi eribi, manabuka. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabara i, na ene ki tebo, ake moratnga. God heven ibo moglsre, ye yobama pre taragl tau mane dinabuka i, ene makandigle mogl, mane dinatnga. Te, ye taragl tau pra we dinabuka i, ene ama pra we dinatniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Jisas ka yegl didre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ka gigledi di tedre, Na God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglka i, yoba ta di tekrio dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye goglsre, adigl u kor enabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-38">Mak 8.31-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Ana ege i mina Jisas mabuno bogl ka di nogugl ede tedre, ede Jerusalem enabuka paugwa. Enan, Juda yoba kade ya tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya te, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ogono mina enan, ye ibun ya giugl tedre, si geglbi, ye ege suota maugl atne pai mogl, adigl u kor enabere i pre ye duglo beglkwa yoba di pogl togwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Di pogl togo, Pita prisre, Jisas auro i bina edidre, ka te yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene yegl ta dikro. Taragl yegl mere ene motnara kaima ta plau dikrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Pita yegl dugo, Jisas kan ake te, Pita yegl di togwa, Satan, na moglmara ede eglke po! dugwa. Na kogon eraglmara i, ene si kegl dinagledi etniwa. Ene ka dinga i, yoba nomano pamere i keme dinga ba God nomanemo pamere i ene ta dikitniwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl mudu yegl di togwa, Yoba ta na duglo boragledi prabuka i, yoba ede prak kake ede eigo, si geglmere mere yegl, ye gorabuka i pre gun yedre, te ye yene nomanemo si goglsre, na duglo borabuka paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />I siragl pre yoba ta na pre gorabuka i pra we dinan, ye kaima kor morabuka. Ba yoba erme keme kor mogl, wakai moragledi pran, ye u kide enabuka.<verse eid="MAT 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Yoba ta makandigle taragl mudu nem yagl morabuka ba ye yene u kide pidre, wau boran, wakai panabo? Mo, yoba kia mina kor morabuka i pre siragl wakai ta tedre, inabo? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Na Yoba Wam moglka i, na Nina abuglagemo mina angelo bogl ede atne unamga. Umun, nana yoba swara swarade mabuno erimere kuno ere te ikne edinaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga. Ene yoba magigl adigl meglkwa i, tau goglkre, yoko meglbi, na Yoba Wam moglka i udre, na yoba Kingno mogl, suglno moglbo, kanaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ogo nagie u pere ta ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mak 9.2-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Transfiguration" file="lb00317b.tif" size="span" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="17.1" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, ege 6-pela de mere ede ogo, ye Pita ya Jems ye agigle Jon bogl auro idre, ede muglo ibo ta ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Muglo ibo ogo, ye ogo nagie u pere ta ogo, guma dra ade abuglage sumere yegl abuglage sugo, kuguglmo gaglmo pe kaima sidre, pogl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Yegl mere eruko, yagl suo ta ye moglmara plau dibriko, Jisas bogl ka di meglkwa. Yagl suo i, Moses ya Elaija miurka. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Ye ka di meglko, Pita ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, no magigl munga i, wakai pamiwa. Ene ta pitn, kuno eran, na yugu teka suota sibo, swara ta ene pre yenan, swara ta Moses pre yenan, swara ta Elaija pre yenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Ana Pita ka yegl di moglko, kamun kua pogl dugwa ta ye meglmara i, winabo di, si bi dugo, kamun kua i mina ka ta ede meda ugwa i, yegl dugwa, Yoba i na Wana moglmiwa. Ye na dena muduna suna moglko, na ye gun podo ye teiga. Ye kamo prio! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl suota i, ka i prisre, kudugl podo gogl, yage kobragai paigwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Pai meglko, Jisas u ye ogo i pi ye akidre, yegl dugwa, Ene kudugl goglkre, adilo dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Jisas yegl dugo, kan mina edigwa i, Jisas yene adigl moglko, kanigwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ana ye Jisas duglo beglkwa yagle bogl muglo ibo kide kodo, ede atne u meglko, Jisas ye ka gigledi di te, Erme taragl ta kanigwa i, yoba swara ta di tekrio. Na Yoba Wam moglka i goglsre, adigl u kor ebo, okuo yoba di tenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i, Jisas di prikwa, God lomo beke teigwa yoba digwa i, Elaija komono kana unan, Yoba Wam okuo unabe digwa i, siragl pre dimedi pitne? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Elaija unabe digwa i, kaima udre, taragl kane kane ake kun erabuka paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Ba na ene di teiga, Elaija kwade u kodugwa ba ye ira moglkwa i, yoba ye moglmedi kan pogl sikre, ye yene primere mabuno kide ere teigwa. Te, na Yoba Wam moglka i, ye kuno yegl mere na ere kide ere naraiglmedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl aglke kor yegl di prikwa i, O, Elaija, Jon yoba nigl bugl togwa yagl ikra pre dumedi prikwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Murubuglo kide yagl gak ta moglmara suna moglko, Jisas di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mak 9.14-29</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:37-42">Luk 9.37-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl suota i bogl ede atne u yoba podo makai si meglmara wigwa. Wigo, yagl swara ta Jisas moglmara udre, goglko bodugl, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na wana mirie goglo. Ye kua sidre, yubun podo i moglmiwa. Ye ege tau mere yage doga mina sidre, yage nigl atne sidre, erukwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Na wana yu ene duglo beglkwa yagl meglmara ediga ba ye ere wakai ere tenamnedi eriko, manumiwe di, yagl i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Ana yagl i yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene yoba yugobuno erme meglkwa i, u kide pidre, na pre mediglkrime dugwa. Nono akie ege olto munga i, na pre medraiglmo mo pre mediglkraiglme? Ene wan pra auro yu magigl ya edo dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Dugo, yuigo, Jisas ye murubuglo kide ta gak i moglmara atne moglkwa i di te, Ede meda wo! dugo, ede meda ugo, gak kidemo i tabre kaima bu yogwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Ana okuo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl keme Jisas moglmara udre, yegl digwa, Siragl pre no murubuglo kide di meda edinamnedi erumga i kuno erekrume? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20-21" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa i, kebra kaima paugwa pre kuno erekrukwa. Na ene kaima di teiga, ene pre mediglkwa i, kebra panan, ene ama taragl podo eraiglkwa paugwa. Ene pre mediglkwa i, mastet mogo ta kebra kaima yomere yegl panabuka ba ene pre medigl moglsre, muglo meglbi ta magigl paugwa i di te, Ene dumo ta panara kide kodo, ede po dibi, kaima ede bage ta enabuka. Te, ene pre medigl meglbi, ene taragl swara ta erekraiglkwa i ta paikrabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas gorabuka pre aglke kor dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mak 9.30-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Ana distrik Galili suna i, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl u Jisas moglmara makai sigo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, yoba ta na i pi yoba pere ogono mina yenabuka paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Ogono mina yenan, yoba i na si geglbi, na ege suota mogl, adigl u kor enaglka pamiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i, deno muduno yubun podo dogwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ye yene pre ya Jisas pre taks togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Okuo Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede dumo Kaperneam eigwa. Eigo, taks igwa yoba Pita moglmara wigwa. Ye tawa teigwa yugu pre taks i meglkwa. Ye ede Pita moglmara udre, kira pogl yegl digwa, Ene tisano God yugumo pre taks tomo mo tekrume? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Yegl digo, Pita di ikne ede, Tenabiwe dugwa. Pita yegl didre, ye aglke kor ede pi Jisas yugugl moglmara ogwa ba ye ka swara ta dikruko, Jisas tabre Pita yegl di togwa, Saimon, ene siragl we di pitne? King makandigle meglkwa i, ye yoba ira taks norio di teime? Yene wanoma taks norio dimo mo yoba meda taks norio dime? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Jisas yegl dugo, Pita di ikne ede, Yoba meda taks norio dime dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Kaima. Wanoma ta tekraiglkwa <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />ba yoba i kide pre dinaiglkwa pre nono taks tenabuglka. Yegl pre ene ede pi nigl nubun huk edin, buglo bagle komono kana ta sinatnga i, dra ake ada bogln, mige mogo ta atne yenan, kanatnga. Mige mogo i, ene i pi na pre ya ene pre akie taks to di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i, ira kra mogl mitna edibedi pre ka drano digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mak 9.33-37</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ana igne i Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba Jisas moglmara udre, kira pogl yegl di prikwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka igne i yoba ira mogl mitna edidre, kagie kade inabe? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yegl digo, Jisas gak kebra ta agle di, u ye meglmara suna adigl moglo, dugo, adigl moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Adigl moglko, Jisas yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga. Ene nomano yake tedre, u gak kebra mere yegl enaiglkwa paugwa. Yegl ta erekribi, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabara suna ta pikraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Te, yoba ta ye yene ake atne edidre, gak kebra magigl moglmere yegl moran, God yoba kingno morabuka ege i, yoba i mogl mitna edenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta na we di prisre, gak kebra yegl mere ta di inan, ye na di yumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba yage si dinamnedi eraiglkwa paugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mak 9.42-48</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta gak kebra mere yegl moglsre, na pre medigl meglkwa i, yoba ta yage sinaiglmedi eribi, yubun podo inaiglkwa. Kobuglo podo yoba nuguno mina kan kogl pia si mudi nigl edenaiglkwa i, yuwaglke panabuka ba God ye ka tage tenabuka i, i tade panabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ana dumo makinagle magigl i, yoba mere kide yage sinaiglmedi erukwa pre dumo i mirie podo erukwa. Taragl tau mina yoba yage sinaiglmedi eran, erabuka ba yoba ta iro yage sinabedi erabuka yobamo i, ye yubun podo inabuka paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Ana ene ogon mo kagln ene yage sinatnedi eran, ene ogon mo kagln koglo i, si biglki dedo. Ogon mo kagln swara panan, ene ede aimadi kamin kor meglmara enatnga i, wakai panabuka. Ta manan, suo akie panan, ede doga kade aimadi domara enatnga i, kide panabuka. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Te, ene gumugln ta ene yage sinatnedi eran, gumugln koglo i, pogl pia sedo. Aglau eran, ene gumugln kogl koglo panan, ede doga kade domara enatnga i, kide panabuka. Ba ene gumugln koglo ekrike keme panan, ene aimadi kamin kor meglmara enatnga i, wakai panabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10-11" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene gak kebra moraiglmara i, swarano ta kan atne edekrio. I siragl pre na ene di teiga, angelo tau ye suglno meglkwa i, ye ege ege Nina heven ibo moglkwa i, moglmara adigl meglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sipsip ta wau boglkwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Lost sheep" file="FM 167 The Lost Sheep_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="18.12" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene siragl we di prime? Yoba ta sipsip 100 kuran, swara ta wau boran, ye sipsip 99-pela muglo meglbi ta meglmara i kanige eran, meglbi, ye ede pi sipsip swara ta wau boglkwa i, dokinabuka. <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Doko kan inan, ye gun podo yenabuka. Na ene kaima di teiga. Ye sipsip 99-pela yoko meglkwa i pre gun kebra yenabuka ba sipsip swara ta wau boglkwa i doko kan yugwa i pre gun podo yenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Kuno yegl mere ene Neno heven ibo moglkwa i, ye gak kebra meglkwa i, swarano ta wau borabedi prikrumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agro ta tadaglme eran, yoba ta pi, ye di tenabuka paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene agitn ta tadaglme eran, ene swara ye moglmara pidre, aglaumo di pogl tenatnga. Di pogl ten, ye nomane inan, pra, ene agitn ere ikne edinga mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ba ene di pogl ten, ye ta prikran, ene yoba swara mo suo akie ye moglmara enaiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre God kamo dugwa i, yoba suo mo suota mogltre, ka ta dibi, gigle dinabuka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 19.15</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Ba ene dibi, prikran, ene yugobuno swara moraiglmara di nogugl edibi, ye kaima nomane ta ikran, ene ye yoba meda mo taks igwa yoba mige tau wau simere mere yegl ta moglmedi kanaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Na ene kaima di teiga, God heven ibo moglsre, ye taragl tau makinagle pre mane dinabuka i, ene makandigle mogl, mane dinaiglkwa. Te, ye taragl tau makinagle pre pra we dinabuka i, ene ama pra we dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Te, na aglke ene yegl di tenaglka, ene yoba suo mo suota na kagna mina taragl swara pre ta di pribr, di prabrere mere na Nina heven ibo moglkwa i, ere tenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Yegl pre yoba suo mo suota na kagna mina makai sinaiglkwa i, na ye meglmara suna mogl teiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nigl kogon yoba suo ikne ikne dina eribrere pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Ana ege i, Pita ede Jisas moglmara udre, yegl di prukwa, Yagl Kade yo, Na agra ta aglau ere naran, na aglaumo i, ege siramna kide kodo tenagle? Na aglaumo i, 7-pela taim mere kide kodo tenaglo? dugo, <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ye aglaumo ege 7-pela taim ta kide kodo tekratnga ba ege 77-pela mere yegl aglaumo kide kodo tenatnga pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Jisas yegl didre, ka ebrie ta yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, yegl mere paugwa, king ta moglkwa ye niglmo kogonmo yoba dina togwa. Ye ege swara ta ikne edenagledi pre ye yu naraiglmedi dugo, <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />ye nigl kogon yagl ta dina podo kide 10 milion kina mere yegl ta dina eruko, auro ede wigwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Auro ede wigo, dinamo te ikne edenabuka i, ta yeikrukwa pre king i ere mogl, nigl kogon yoba di tedre, yagl i bona ganamo ya ebie gagiglma bogl, topo mere yegl bun, yoba ta boino paibi, migena ikne inamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Yegl dugo, niglmo kogonmo yagl i, yage kobragai padre, ye di pre, Ene na mitna goglo. Ene kuri ta kan motn, na dina erika i, mudu te ikne edinaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Yegl dugo, king i ye mirie goglsre, dina erukwa i kide kodo tedre, Yoko ede po dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ana nigl kogon yagl i ede meda udre, ye nigl kogon yagl ta ama tegigl yogwa. Nigl kogon yagl i, ye dina kebra 10 kina ta togwa paugo, ye tegigl yebriko, ye nugo mina akidre, Ene dina etnga i, nare ikne edo! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Yegl dugo, yagl i yage kobragai padre, ye di pre, Ene na mitna goglo. Na kuri ta mogl, migenen mudu te ikne edinaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Yegl dugwa ba mige dina kade erukwa yagl ikra kanige erekre, si kane sugwa. Si kane sidre, ye di te, Ene kane pai moglsre, dinanen mudu nare ikne edin, ede meda unatniwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugo, king niglmo kogonmo yoba tau kandre, kide kaima pre, pi ye bitno yagl i boglo kugl teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Boglo kugl teigo, king i prisre, yagl i agle dugo, ugwa. Ugo, king i ye yegl di togwa, Ene nigl kogon yoba kide motnga. Ene kamage yenga pre ene dina podo etnga i, na kide kodo teiga. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Yegl pre na ene mitn goglmere yegl, ene ama agitn mirie goglsre, dinamo kide kodo tenatnga paugwa ba ene aglau etniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />King ka yegl didre, ye dem kubrumara i, yagl i, yoba ye giugl tenaiglmedi ogono mina yogwa. Yagl i ye giugl podo te pai meglbi, dinamo mudu nare ikne edidre, ede meda enabedi ogono mina yomiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene agitn ta aglau ere tenan, ene deno muduno bogl ye aglaumo kide kodo tekitn, na Nina heven ibo moglkwa i, mabuno kuno yegl mere ene ere tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Yagl abu si biglke digwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mak 10.1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ye distrik Galili kide kodo, ede pi distrik Judia, nigl Jordan koglo ibo kra ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Ye dumo i ogo, yoba tau mere ye mokomugl sika si eigo, Jisas ye kide sigwa i, mudu ere wakai ere togwa.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Ana igne i Farisi yoba tau Jisas moglmara udre, ye ka aglau ere dinabo mo di, kira yegl pogl prikwa, Yagl ta mabuno kane kane mina ebie sedinabuka i, mane ta pamo mo paikrume? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne edidre, Ene God kamo kere kankrimo? Okna ibo God dumo makan beke yedre, ye yagl ya abu beke yogwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 1.27</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Te, mabuno i pre yagl ye nem mam kide kodidre, ye ebie bogl si dakagl morabrika. Miur, ye ogono nagino swara kaima mere yegl paugwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 2.24</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Yegl paugwa pre ye suo moglkre, yoba swara mere yegl miurka. Yegl pre God taragl ta ere i swara edenabuka i, yoba ta ere i pere pere edekraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Farisi yoba di ikne ede yegl digwa, Yegl panan, siragl eruko, Moses ye yagl abu si biglke dinaiglkwa i, pepa mina bogl, si biglke dinaiglkwa kuno erume dume? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, Ene God kamo prakirikwa yoba meglkwa pre Moses ene yagl abu si bugl dinaiglkwa i, pra we dugwa ba okna ibo mabuno yegl ta paikrukwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Na ene di teiga, Yagl ta ebie yagl ta bogl kunogl nekrabrika ba ye ebie yoko sedidre, abu kor ta inan, ye abu kor i bogl kunogl nebrika mere yegl pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl abu bogl igwa mabuno yegl panan, ta bogl ikramniwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yegl digo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Yagl ta abu ikrabuka i, wakai paugwa ba yagl mudu abu ikraiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. God yene abu ikraiglmedi eran, kuno erabuka. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Siragl pre yagl tau mano kiglkwa ege i, nagino kide erukwa pre ye abu ibi, kuno erekrabuka. Te, yagl tau yoba yobaglku nagino ere kide erikwa pre abu ikraiglkwa. Te, yagl tau God yoba kingno morabuka i, ede eglke enabedi prisre, mawagl mogl, abu ikrikwa. Yoba yegl ta erabuka i kuno erabedi pran, ye erabuka keme pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas gak kebra na moglmara unaiglmedi kanige erio dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mak 10.13-16</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Ana igne i, yoba gak kebra Jisas akidre, kamage ere tenabedi auro yuigwa ba Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i kandre, ka teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Mane digwa ba Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Gak kebra na moglmara unaiglkwa i, ene mane dikre, kanige erio. I siragl pre yoba ta gak meglmere yegl ta moraiglkwa i, God ye yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabara yoba i pre yenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Jisas yegl didre, ye ogo i pi gak kebra akidre, dumo i kide kodo, ede bage ta ogwa.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl ta mige moni mere kan nogwa i, Jisas bogl ka dibrika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mak 10.17-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Ana yagl swara ta Jisas moglmara udre, yegl dugwa, Tisa yo, na mabuno wakai siragl mere ersre, aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa ikra kaima inagle? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye yegl di prukwa, Ene siragl pre mabuno wakai pre na di pitne? Yoba swara keme wakai moglkwa. Ba ene aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa i, inagledi pitn, ene God lomo duglo boglo dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Jisas yegl dugo, yagl i aglke kor yegl dugwa, Siragl lo duglo boraglka pre dine? dugwa. Dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, God lomo bage tau yegl dugwa, Ene yoba ta si goglkre, yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekre, taragl ta kunogl nekre, kot mina kibi dikre, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Ene nen man pre i mitna edidre, kano pro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 20.12-16, Lo 5.16-20</char></note> Te, ene enene wakai kanere yegl, yoba ta magigl akie kipanaiglkwa i, ama yegl mere wakai kano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tawa Teigwa Yoba 19.18</char></note> di, yegl dumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, yagl kulu i yegl dugwa, Na God lomo mudu i, duglo boglka ba na taragl ta eraglka pai moran, di naratniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene u wakai kaima enagledi pitn, ene taraglnen mudu i pi topo boglsre, mige i pi goduglme yoba to. Ene yegl etn, ene heven ibo taragl wakai wakai inatnga. Te, ene yegl ersre, u na duglo boglo di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Jisas yegl dugo, yagl kulu i prisre, kide pre, ede ogwa. I siragl pre ye taragl tau mere kan nogwa yagl ta moglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Ana yagl i ede ogo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, Yoba taragl podo ere neigwa i, God yoba kingno morabara ede suna enaiglkwa i, waragne paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Te, na ama ene yegl di tenaglka, Bugla kamel ta kar nil kwie yomara ede suna enabuka i, yuaglke paugwa ba yoba ta taragl podo kan neigwa i, God yoba kingno moglmara ede suna enaiglkwa i, waragne kaima pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl prisre, nagino podo koglsre, yegl digwa, Yegl panan, God yoba ira ere inan, kuno erabe? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye toro kandre, ye yegl di togwa, Yoba ta ye yene ere inaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrabuka ba God taragl mudu erabuka keme paugwa pre ye ere inabuka i, waragne ta paikrumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Pita ye yegl di prukwa, Kano. No taraglno mudu kide kodidre, ene duglo bunga pre no siragl taragl inamne? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, taragl mudu u kor enan, na Yoba Wam moglka i, abuglagena mina moglsre, sia king mina ame di moglbo, ene na duglo beglkwa yoba sia king 12-pela mina ame didre, Israel yoba yugobunono 12-pela i, suglno moraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Te, yoba swara ta na kagna mina ye yugumo toglmo kide kodinabo mo ye agiglema abaugloma mo nem mam mo nagiglema kide kodinabo mo ye makanmo kide kodinabuka i, ye taragl tau kide kodumara i, ye 100 mere i tebe edenabuka. Te, ye aimadi kamin kor morabara i, wakai kaima morabuka. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Ba yoba tau mere erme mogl mitna edigwa i, okuo kagno paikran, atne kaima moraiglkwa. Te, yoba tau erme atne kaima meglkwa i, okuo mogl mitna kaima edenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ye kogon yoba tau ede wain mina kogon ersre, topo igwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Jisas ka ebrie ta ama yegl dugwa, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, siragl mere panabere i na ka ebrie ta dibo, praiglkwa. Yagl ta makanmo podo yogwa. Ye tagna kide mogl adiglsre, Na wain ere yaglmara i, kogona ere naribi, topo tenagledi pre dokugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Dokidre, yoba i bogl ka di kogl, Ene pi kogon eribi, silva swara swarade tenagliwe di, dedugo, ede wain ere yaglmara eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Ede eigo, kuri ta mogl 9 klok mere yegl, aglke kor pi maket kanugwa i, yoba yoko adigl meglko, <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />ama yegl di togwa, Ene ama pidre, kogon eribi, topo inaiglmere mere topo tenagliwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Yegl dugo, ye pi kogon ere meglko, belo ya 3 klok, makan nem ikra, ama kuno yegl ere yoba tau dedugo, wain ere yaglmara eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Ana okuo 5 klok poko dugo, aglke kor pi maket dumo kanugwa i, yoba tau ama yoko meglkwa kandre, ka kira pogl, Ene siragl eruko, ege mudu ta wakan yoko meglme? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Yegl dugo, yagl wagle i di ikne ede, Yoba ta kogon norokrimiwe digwa. Yegl digo, wain nem yagl i di te, yegl dugwa, Ene ama pi kogon ere naraiglma, pio, dugo, ede eigwa.<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Ana min eragledi eruko, ede wain nem yagl i, ye kogonmo sugl moglkwa yagl di tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene pi kogon erikwa yoba agle din, wibi, topono tenatniwa. Topo tenatnga i, yoba okuo kaima wigwa i, ye komono kana tedre, te taganamogl erikwa i, i okuo edo dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Ana yagl i agle dugo, wigo, yoba 5 klok wigwa mere ikra, komono kana silva swara swarade togwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Topo te ede ugo, yoba tagna kide mogl kogon erikwa ikra, u prikwa i, no topono podo ta inamniwe di prikwa ba ye topono i kuno ede, silva swarade togwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Yegl togo, ye kide prisre, nonga si ikne ede tedre, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />yegl digwa, No kogon taganamogl ere ede pi mim paugwa erumga i, kogon mere ersre, ade domga ba yoba aua swara keme kogon erikwa i bogl topono i kuno ede notnga i, kuno ta erekrumiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Yegl digo, gaden nem yagl kogon yoba swara ta yegl di togwa, Agra, na ene aglau ta ere tekrika. Na ene mige silva swara ta tenagle digo, ene pra we dinga pre na kogon i teiga etniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Yegl pre ene topono idre, ede enaiglkwa paugwa. Yoba okuo kogon yuwaglke erikwa i, topo kuno ere tenaglka i, na nana mina pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Na nana migena mina yoba primere tenaglka i, aglau ta pamedi pitno? Na yoba tau ere wakai ere teiga i, siragl eruko, kiam sine? di, wain nem yagl yegl dumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Kuno yegl mere yoba tau erme okuo wigwa i, ede okna enaiglkwa. Te, yoba tau erme ede okna eigwa i, okuo unaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ege suota Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor enabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mak 10.32-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">Luk 18.31-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede ido Jerusalem enamnedi konbauna pi meglko, Jisas yoba tau mogl dinaiglmedi ye duglo beglkwa yagl i, di i bina edidre, yegl di togwa, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />Ene prio. Nono ede ido Jerusalem enauniwa. Omun, yoba ta na Yoba Wam moglka i, i pi tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba i ogono mina yenabuka. Na i pi ye ogono mina yenan, yoba i na kotna prisre, Ene goratniwe dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Didre, na i pi yugobuno pere, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i ogono mina yebi, ye na agai goratnedi ersre, ama duglnai sidre, ede prak mina na si goraiglkwa paugwa. Si geglbi, na ege suota pai mogl, adigl u kor enaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jems ya Jon yoba kade morabugle dibrika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mak 10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ana okuo Sebedi wam suo ye mano bogl ede Jisas moglmara wigo, ye mano ere mogl, Jisas goglko bodugl tedre, yegl dugwa, Na taragl ta dibo, ene pre naratnedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Na siragl ere narabedi pitne? dugwa. Dugo, ye di tedre, Ene erme ka gigledi di padiglsre, adigl moratnga i, ene king mogl, sianen idre, ame dinatnga igne, na wana suo i, ta ogon wo kra edin, ame dinan, ta ogon koda kra edin, ame dinan, yegl erabedi priwe di, abu i yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene na yegl di prikwa i, ene pre pogl sikre, dimiwe dugwa. Didre, yagl suo i yegl di prukwa, Na nigl kide ta kogl nenaglka i, ene kogl nebr, kuno erabo? dugwa. Kuno erabiwe dibrika. <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yegl dibriko, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Kaima, na nigl kide ta kogl nenaglka i, ene ama kogl nenabrika ba yoba ta na ogona wo kra mo ogona koda kra mina ame dinabuka i, i na mina ta paikrukwa. Na Nina ira kra ame dinaiglkwa i, yene kere i pere edugo, i keme ame dinaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 10-pela ye agigle agigle suo ka yegl dibrika i prisre, ye deno kubro teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Yegl erikwa ba Jisas ye agle di, wio dugo, ede magigl wigo, ye yegl di togwa, Yoba Juda yoba moglkre, yugobuno pere meglkwa i, ye yobano kade ebrie mabuno erikwa i, ene pre kan erikwa. Ye yobano kade mogl mitna edidre, yobano kan atne ede teigwa. Te, ye kingno ama ka dimere dimere i, sika sidre, yegl erio digo, erikwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Yegl erikwa ba ene meglmara suna i, mabuno yegl kaima ta paikrabuka. Ene meglmara suna i, ene ta kade moragledi pratnga i, ene mogl atne edidre, yoba ake ple di tenatnga paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Te, yoba ta mogl gumamugl edenagledi pratnga i, ene yoba mudu niglno kogono yoba mere yegl moratnga paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Na Yoba Wam moglka i, ama kuno yegl mere yoba na niglna kogona ere naraiglmedi ukrika ba na yoba niglno kogono ere tenagledi wiga. Nigl kogono ere tedre, ye pre goglsre, topono tebo, yoba kane paimara i, kide kodidre, ede meda unaiglmedi pre wiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl suo gumuglno kin yogwa i, Jisas ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mak 10.46-52</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl dumo Jeriko suna moglsre, okuo ede meda eigwa. Te, ye eimara yoba mere kide ye sika si ede eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ana yagl suo, gumuglno kin yogwa i, konbo bage ame di miurka. Ame di miurko, yoba tau Jisas umiwe digo, yagl suo prisre, ka podo di, yegl dibrika, Yagl Kade yo, Devit Gawamo motnga i, no mitno goglo! dibrika. <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Yegl dibriko, yoba mere Jisas umara wigwa i, Ene ka kodo! Drano kegl di, konande moglsro! di, ka teigwa ba ye kano prikre, ka podo kaima di, Devit Gawamo motnga i, no mitno goglo! di, grigle dibrika. <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yegl dibriko, Jisas u adigl moglsre, ye agle didre, Ene na siragl ere tenabedi pre dibre? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Yegl dugo, Yagl Kade yo, no kanabugledi prubugle dibrika. <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yegl dibriko, Jisas ye mitno goglsre, gumuglno akugo, oglande kandre, Jisas duglo bogl ede ebrika.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Jisas king mere yegl mogl, ede Jerusalem suna ugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mak 11.1-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jon 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus rides into the city" file="FM 179 Jesus Rides into the City_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="21.1" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede Jerusalem magigl udre, taun Betfage muglo Oliv ibo suna yomara ede wigo, Jisas ye duglo biurka yoba suo dedidre, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />ye yegl di togwa, Ene dumo ta yomara iro suna pidre, donki mam nagigle suo kane kogl padiglbi, tabre kanabrika. Ene donki suo i kane poko ede, yunabrika. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Pogl edenabrika igne, yoba ta ene di pribi, Yagl Kade kogonmo ta paugwa pre dugwa ba ye tabre te ikne edenabiwe di, ene yegl diro dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Taragl yegl mere plau dugwa i, ka kep yagl ta okna ibo ka ta boglkwa i, pai inabedi dumara plau dugwa. Ye boglkwa i, yegl boglkwa,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />Yoba ta dumo Saion meglkwa i, ka yegl di teo, Ene kingno moglkwa i, uma, kanio! Ye mogl atne edidre, donki moko bolamugl au sidre, ede umiwa. Te, donki kulu ta moglkwa au sidre, ede umiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sekeraia 9.9</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:5">di, yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ana Jisas ye duglo biurka yagl suo i, Jisas dumere ersre, <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />donki mam nagigle suo yubrika. Yu, Jisas moglmara edidre, ir gaglno gugl, donki nagigle kulu moko bolamugl kiglbriko, Jisas donki au sidre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Te, ye ede omara i, yoba mere kide ere mogl, ye gaglno olto konbauna unabara kugl yeigo, te, tau ede yogagle bru maginagle kugl yeigwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Yeigo, Jisas tebe ede pi moglkwa igne, yoba tau ede okna eigo, tau okuo wigo, Jisas yene suna ogwa. Eimara i, yoba mudu aglage kaglkane ere, yegl digwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Devit Gawamo ugwa i, debie si tomniwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Yagl ta Yagl Kade dedugo, ugwa i, God ye ere wakai ere tenabiwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.25-26</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Nono God heven ibo moglkwa i, debie si tomniwe</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:9">di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ana Jisas ede Jerusalem suna ugo, yoba mudu Jerusalem suna meglkwa i, wai kugl, Yoba i, ira ume? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Yegl digo, yoba podo meglkwa di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl ta ugwa i, ka kep yagl Jisas ikra ugwa. Ye distrik Galili suna dumo Nasaret nem ta umiwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawa teigwa yugu yomara yoba taragl tau topo beglkwa i, Jisas si meda edugwa<figure style="fig" alt="Selling birds" file="CN01786B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="21.11" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mak 11.15-19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jon 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Ana Jisas ede tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pidre, yoba taragl tau i pi topo bogl meglkwa i, si meda edugwa. Ye si meda edidre, mige topo suade erikwa yobamo i, bogl ake yake tedre, kua yumugl mige beglkwa yobamo i, siano ama ake yake tedre, <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />yoba mudu yegl di togwa, God kamo mina bage ta beglkwa i, yegl dugwa, Na yuguna i, yoba kamage eraiglkwa dumo ta yenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 56.7</char></note> dugwa. Ba ene dumo i, ere i kunogl gogl yoba teke paigwa dumo mere yegl edimiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 7.11</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ana Jisas tawa teigwa yugu togl suna yomara moglko, yoba gumuglno kin yogwa ya ogono kaglno kide erukwa i, pi Jisas moglmara eigo, ye ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ana Jisas siragl wakai wakai yegl eruko, gak kebra ama God yugumo togl suna meglkwa i, Jisas kagie kade tedre, Devit Wam debie si tomniwe di teigwa. Di teigo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya te, God lomo beke teigwa yoba i, kandre, kide kaima prikwa. Ye kide kaima prisre, <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Jisas yegl di teigwa, Gak kebra ka yegl digwa i, ene pitno? digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, Owo, na prika. Ene God kamo bage ta dugwa i, ene kerekrikwa pre dimo? Bage i yegl dugwa, Gak kebra ya gak kuglabu meglkwa i, na debine karougl ere naraiglmedi beke teniwe di,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 8.2</char></note> yegl dumiwe Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Jisas yegl didre, ye meglmara kide kodo, ede dumo Jerusalem meda pidre, pi dumo Betani ugl paugwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede fik ta di kide yei togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mak 11.12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Ana tagana kana Jisas adiglsre, dumo Betani kide kodo, ede ikne dumo Jerusalem enagledi ogwa. Ye konbauna pi moglmara kidan podo goglsre, <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />kanugwa i, ede fik ta paugo, ede magigl pi mogo ta kogl pamo mo di, kanugwa i, mogo ta kogl paugo, kankrukwa. Yaudo keme paugo, kandre, ede i di kide yei te, Ene mogo okuo ta koglkratniwe dugo, ede i tabre yaminidre, goglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ede i goglkwa kandre, wai kugl, yegl digwa, Siragl mere ede fik i tabre yamine, goglme? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ka kaima di teiga. Ene pre medigl mogl, kinano suo yekran, na ede fik ere teimere mere yegl eraiglkwa. Ersre, ene taragl podo ama ere, muglo meglbi magigl paugwa i, di tedre, Ene dumo ta panara i kide kodo, ede mudi nigl suna po dibi, ka kaima plau dinabuka. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Te, ene pre medigl moglsre, kamage eribi, siragl ta ene di praiglmere God ene kaima ere tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ira ene kagn kade tomedi yoba kade wagle Jisas kira peglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mak 11.27-33</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Ana Jisas tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna moglsre, yoba ka beke te moglko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya te, Juda yobano kade ye moglmara udre, kira pogl pre, yegl digwa, Ira ene dedugo, taragl yegl etne? Te, ira taragl yegl ero dugwa i, no di noro! <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ama ka kira swara ta poglbo, ene di ikne ede naribi, ira na dedugo, kogon erika i, ene di tenaglka. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Jon yoba nigl bugl togwa i, God dedugo, erumo mo yoba dedigo, erume? Na di nario, dugwa. Jisas yegl dugo, yoba kade wagle yene meglmara di ikne ikne ede, ka di pre, yegl digwa, Nono di ikne, God ye Jon dedume dumun, yagl i ere mogl, Ene siragl eruko, Jon kamo pre mediglkrime? di norabuka. <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Ba nono di ikne ede, Makadigle yoba nomano idre, erume dumun, nono ama yoba kuduglno goramga paugwa. I siragl pre ye mudu prikwa i, yagl Jon i ye God kamo kep yoba kaima ta moglmedi primiwe di, yene ikne ikne yegl digwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Yegl paugwa pre Jisas di ikne ede te, No ta pre kan erekrumniwe digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Yegl eran we, ira na dedugo, kogon yegl erika i, ene ta di tebo, prikraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl ta wam suo miurka pre Jisas ka ebrie dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene siragl we di prime? Yagl ta wam suo miurka. Aglke ta ye wam ta moglmara pidre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Wana yo, ene erme ede pi na ede wain ere yaglmara kogon eratniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Yegl dugo, ye wam di ikne ede, Na ta pikragledi priwe dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba okuo nomane kor idre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Ana yagl i ede pi wam ta moglmara pidre, ye wam ta di tomere kuno yegl di togo, ye di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade yo, na ede enagliwe dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba ye kaima ta pikrukwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ana wam suo miurara i, yoba ira ye nem ye erabedi prumere erume? dugwa. Jisas yegl dugo, yagl kade wagle di ikne ede yegl digwa, Wam ta komono di prukwa ikra, ye nem prumere erumiwe digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede yegl di togwa, Ene kuno digwa. Te, na ene kaima di teiga. Gak ta nomane kor yugwa i, erumere yegl mere, taks igwa yoba ya konbauna abu meglkwa i, ye ede okna u God yoba kingno moglmara ede suna wigwa ba ene meda meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />I siragl pre yagl Jon ikra ene meglmara udre, konbauna du yogwa i, ene obuno di togwa ba ye ka dugwa i, ene pre mediglkrikwa. Ene pre mediglkrikwa ba taks igwa yoba ya konbauna abu meglkwa i, ye Jon ka dugwa i, pre mediglkwa. Ye pre mediglko, ene kanigwa ba ene nomane kor idre, pre mediglkrimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba kide ede wain sugl moglsre, mabuno kide beglkwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mak 12.1-12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Vineyard" file="HK00108B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="21.33" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene ka ebrie swara ta ama prio! dugwa. Yagl makanmo podo yogwa ta ere mogl, ede wain ere yaglmara togl ere winabo didre, suna wom yugu ta kei bodugl sugl kan moraiglmedi kedre, ye wain nuglo duglo inaiglmedi pre maugl ta pere yedre, erukwa. Ersre, ye ede bage ta enagledi yoba ta sugl mogl, mige teke yei naraiglmedi pre yoba ta ogono mina yedre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Ye pi mogl prukwa i, erme wain bogl yenabuka egemo yomedi prisre, ye nigl kogonmo yoba tau dedidre, Ene ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba meglmara ebi, ye mige kia ta tebi, idre, ede ikne unaiglmiwe di, dedugo, ede eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Ba ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba i, nigl kogon yoba si akidre, swara ta ere sidre, swara ta si goglsre, swara ta kobuglo sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Yegl erikwa pre makan nem yagl i ere mogl, nigl kogonmo yoba tau aglke mere dagl dedugo, ede eigwa. Mere ede eigwa ba ede wain sugl meglkwa yoba i, okna erimere kuno yegl mere ere teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Yegl eriko, okuo kaima makan nem yagl i, nomane ta idre, Na pra wana dedibo, enan we, ye kandre, kamo praiglmiwe di prisre, ye wam dedugo, ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Ba wain sugl meglkwa yoba ye kandre, yene di ikne ikne ede pre, yegl digwa, Wain nem yagl ikra wam ugwa pre siragl mudu sugl kan munga i, ye mudu inabuka umiwe digwa. Yegl pre ye si gun we, nono taragl mudu kan munga i, no nono pre yenabiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Yegl didre, wain nem yagle wam ugwa i, si meda edidre, si geglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Ana ede wain nem yagle unabuka igne, ye erimara i siragl ere tenabedi prime? di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Yegl dugo, yoba di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ye yoba kide meglkwa i, ere kide kaima ere tedre, si gogl, ye ede wain ere yaglmara i, yoba pere sugl mogl naraiglmedi tenabuka. Tenabuka yobamo i, ye sugl meglbi, wain bogl yenan, ye ursre, mige kia bogl akie tenaiglmiwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Ana yoba i, yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene kaima digwa ba God kamo bage ta beglkwa i, ene ta kerekrikwa paugwa. Ka i, yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Kobuglo yugu keigwa yoba i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">ye kobuglo gade imara i kobuglo swara ta kide yomedi kandre, kide kodigwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ba God yugu ta kenagledi kobuglo swara ta kide kodigwa i, idre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">Yugu kei ede mitna enabara i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">Mabunomugl mabuno bogl paduglmiwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Yagl Kade yene yegl eruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">No kandre, nagino podo kuniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.22-23</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:42">di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Ene kobuglo swara i kide kodigwa pre na ene di teiga, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, ene suna ta moglkraiglkwa ba yoba yugobuno pere meda ta mogo wakai koraiglkwa i, ye ede suna enaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Te, yoba ta yage kobuglo i mina bolamugl sinan, ye bogl bagla dinabuka. Te, kobuglo i yage si, yoba ta sinan, yoba i si deduwagle ere kodinabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ana Farisi ya tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ye Jisas ka ebrie tau mere dugwa i, no di boglmedi prisre, <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Jisas si kane sinamnedi prikwa ba yoba Jisas ka kep yoba kaima ta moglmedi prikwa pre ye kuduglno goglsre, si kane sikrikwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">King kaya mokna podo ta keigwa ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:16-24">Luk 14.16-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Ana Jisas ye yagl kade wagle ka ebrie swara ta ama di tedre, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, yegl mere pame dugwa. King ta moglsre, ye wam abu bogl ye tenabuka egemo yenan, ye kaya mokna podo gagl, yoba di gaglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Di gaglsre, ye unaiglmedi nigl kogonmo yoba dedugo, di yunamnedi eigwa ba ye mudu kaima ukramnedi konbauna dokigwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Yegl erikwa pre king i aglke kor niglmo kogonmo yoba tau ama dedidre, ye yegl di teo, dugwa. Nono kingno ene yegl di togwa, Kau kumugl ya siragl tau ere kuglka meglkwa i, si keiga de kodugo, kaya mokna podo erika i, u nenaiglmedi kwia ere moglka pre tabre ede wio dume di, ene yegl dio! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Ye dumere pi yegl di teigwa ba ye kano pra kiure, yene kogono mina eigwa. Ta ede pi kaya mokna ere yaglmara enagliwe dugo, ta yene kogonmo sugl moragledi ede ogo, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />te tau ye dedugwa yobamo i, ake gi di mogl, ere kide ere tedre, si geglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Yegl eriko, king i dem podo kubrisre, soldiama dedugo, ye pi, king niglmo kogonmo yoba si geglkwa yobamo ikra, si goglsre, ye yuguno toglno gagl tege erimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Ana king i aglke kor dagl nigl kogonmo yoba agle didre, yegl di togwa, Na wana abu yugwa pre kaya mokna erika i, ere wakai ere kodiga ba di gaglka yobamo i, tau nenaiglkwa mere manugwa <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />pre ene erme we, yoba konbo bage moraiglkwa i, mudu kaima di gagl yuio dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Yegl dugo, ye nigl kogonmo yoba ede pi yoba kide wakai siramna ta konbo bage kanigwa i, mudu di gagl yuigo, king yugumo kau kaima sumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Ana king ede yugugl udre, yoba wigwa i, kogl kare di inagledi ugwa. Udre, kanugwa i, yagl swara ta yagl abu bogl inamnedi eriko, ekin gaiglmere mere yegl ta gaglkre, ugo, kanugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Kandre, yagl i kira pogl, Kabaglena yo, siragl eruko, ene ekin kuno ere gaglkre, une? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i ka di ikne edenabuka mere manugo, <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />king ye niglmo kogonmo yoba di tedre, Ene yagl i ogo kagle kan sidre, pia si meda edibi, ye meda, mim erumara morabuka. Meda i, yoba kai ersre, signo gikr eraiglmiwe di, king i yegl dume di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Kuno yegl mere God yoba mere agle dugwa ba yoba suom keme yugugl moraiglmedi edumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taks tenamno mo tekramnedi yoba Jisas kira peglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mak 12.13-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Roman coins" file="hk00166b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="22.15" />Ana igne i Farisi yoba makai si mogl, Jisas ka ta aglau ere dinan, kot ere tenamnedi konbo dokigwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Yegl di prisre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba ya Herot yobama tau bogl akie enaiglmedi dedigo, ye pi, Jisas yegl di teigwa, Tisa yo, no prumga i, ene ka du keme didre, yoba beke tenga. Ene yoba kade meglkwa mo yoko meglkwa i kerekre, God konbaunamo kuno keme yoba beke tenga. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Yegl pre ene siragl we di pitne? Nono mige taks Rom king tenamga kuno erumo mo tekramne? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas ye nomane kide idre, digwa i, pre kan ersre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene mabuno kibi erikwa yoba meglkwa. Ene siragl pre na aglau ere dinan, pramnedi na kira pogl prime? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Ene mige silva ta naribi, kanaluwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye mige silva ta yu teigo, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Jisas mige i kandre, yegl dugwa, Ira kwiamo ya kagie mige i mina pame? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Dugo, ye di ikne ede, Rom king kwiamo ya kagie pamiwe digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Yegl eran we, taragl ta Rom king pre yenabuka i, Rom king teo. Te, taragl ta God pre yenabuka i, God teo! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Yegl dugo, ye prisre, wai kiglkwa. Wai kuglsre, Jisas kide kodo, ede eigwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadyusi yoba Jisas di pre, yoba geglkwa adigl u kor enaiglmo mo ta pikraiglme digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mak 12.18-27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Ana ade swara i, Sadyusi yoba tau Jisas moglmara wigwa. Sadyusi yoba digwa i, yoba ta goglsre, adigl u kor ta pikraiglmiwe digwa. Ana ye tau Jisas moglmara udre, yegl digwa, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Tisa yo, Moses ka bogl norumara i, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta abu inabuka ba gak kuglkre, goran, ye agigle ta morabuka i, abu werai i inan, gak kurabrika i, nem goglkwa agaimo idre, makanmo inabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Ana Moses ka bogl norumara i mina ka kira ta poramga. No munara i, agigle agigle 7-pela meglkwa. Ta komono moglkwa i, abu ta yugwa ba ye gak kuglkre, goglko, agigle namba 2 ere mogl, abu werai i, yugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Agigle namba 2 i, abu i yugwa ba ye ama gak ta kuglkre, goglko, agigle namba 3 ede pi namba 7 i, mudu abu werai i idre, gak kuglkre, geglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ana okuo kaima abu i ama goglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Agigle agigle 7-pela i, mudu abu swara i igwa pre yoba adigl u kor enaiglkwa igne, abu i, ira ebie morabuka i di noro! digwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Ana Sadyusi yoba yegl digo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene God kamo pre pogl sikre, God yobuglomo siragl mere paugwa i, ama pre pogl sikrikwa pre ene nomano kugl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Yoba adigl u kor enaiglkwa igne, ye abu idre, ede yagl pidre, erimere yegl ta erekraiglkwa ba angelo heven ibo meglmere yegl moraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ba yoba geglkwa adigl u kor enaiglkwa paugwa i, God kamo ene di nogugl ede te kodugwa ba ene kere kankrikwa paugwa. God kamo yegl dugwa, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />Na yagl Abraham, ya Aisak, ya Jekop Godno mogl pai moluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 3.6</char></note> dugwa. God kamo yegl dugwa i, ye yoba gogl kodigwa i, Godno moglkwa pre dikrukwa ba yoba kor mogl pai meglkwa i, Godno moglkwa pre dumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Ye Sadyusi yoba ka yegl beke togo, yoba mere kide magigl moglsre, prikwa i, nagino keglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lo swara ta podo pai, mudu egre togwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-31">Mak 12.28-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ana Jisas ye Sadyusi yoba drano si kegl dugwa i, Farisi yoba akie mogl, kanigwa. Kandre, u swara pi mogl, ede Jisas moglmara wigwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Wigo, God lomo beke togwa yagl ta adigl mogl, Jisas ka ta aglau ere dinabo mo di pragledi kira pogl, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />Tisa yo, God lomo paimara suna i, siragl lo podo pai, lo tau egre tome? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Lo ta podo pai, lo tau egre atne edugwa i, yegl paugwa, Ene den mudun bogl mudu Yaglnen Kade God tedre, ene nomanen ya ene mudu motnere God to<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 6.5</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Lo i podo pai, lo tau egre togwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Te, lo ta namba 2 paugwa i, yegl dugwa, Ene enene wakai kanere mere yegl, yoba ta magigl akie kipanaiglkwa i, ama yegl mere wakai kano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tawa Teigwa Yoba 19.18</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Lo suo i, God lomo mudu ya God kamo kep yoba beglkwa paugwa i, egre atne edidre, mudu bi dibriwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">God Kere Yugwa Yagl i, ye Devit gawamo keme ta moglkrabuka ba God Wam ama morabuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mak 12.35-37</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Ana Farisi yoba makai si meglko, Jisas kira pogl, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />Ene siragl we di prime? God Kere Yugwa Yagl i, ira gawamo morabe? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, Devit gawamo morabe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yegl digo, Jisas kor dagl yegl dugwa, Devit gawamo ta morabuka panan, Devit God Kere Yugwa Yagl pre dugwa i, siragl pre ye na Yaglna Kade moglme dume? Devit ka yegl dugwa i, God Murubuglomo nomane togo, ye ka yegl dugwa,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />Neno Kade ere mogl, na Yaglna Kade yegl di togwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Ene ogona wo kra ame di moglo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Na ene kudanen ikne yobuglo ere tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">kagln mina atne edinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 110.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 22:44">di, yegl dume dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Devit yene God Kere Yugwa yagl i pre na Yaglna Kade we dugwa ba yoba tau Devit gawamo morabe digwa i we, siragl pre ka yegl dime? Na di nario di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Yegl dugo, yoba swara ta di ikne edenabuka i, kuno ta erekrukwa. Te, yoba okuo kira poraiglkwa i, kudugl geglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">God lomo beke teigwa yoba pre kan kun erio!</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mak 12.38-39</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11.43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:46">11.46</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Ana okuo Jisas ye yoba mere kide magigl meglkwa i ya te, ye duglo beglkwa yoba ka di te, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />yegl dugwa, God lomo beke teigwa yoba i ya te, Farisi yoba meglkwa i, ye Moses agaimo idre, God lomo ene beke teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Yegl pre ye ene ka beke tenaiglkwa i, prisre, duglo boraiglkwa ba mabuno erimere yegl, ene ta erekrio! I siragl pre ye yoba ka beke teimere yegl ta erekrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Te, ye God lomo duglo bolo dimara i mina yoba yubun podo kaima kakenaiglmedi teigwa mere yegl paugwa ba ye kuri kaima ta ikne ake ple di tekrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" /><figure style="fig" alt="Man with phylactery" file="hk00274b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="23.5">Farasi yoba God lomo boglsre, mabro mina padiglkwa</figure>Ye mabuno kane kane ta erikwa i, yoba no kanaiglmedi pre erikwa. Ye God kamo bage tau boglsre, mabro mina padiglkwa i, yoba kanaiglmedi ere i podo edigwa. Te, ye kugugl gagl edimara yoba wakai kanaiglmedi kan tau mere bai akidre, puduo yomara si beglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Te, ka mabuno yugu yugugl eigwa igne mo yoba kaya mokna podo gaiglkwa igne, ye sia wakai, gumamugl iro ame dinamnedi prikwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Te, ye maket wanigwa igne, yoba ye wakai we di tedre, Tisa yo we digwa i, gun podo yeimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Ba ene meglmara suna i, yoba ta ene Tisa yo we dinaiglkwa i, ene mane dio. I siragl pre ene meglmara mudu agigle agigle meglko, yoba swara keme ene tisano moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Te, ene meglmara suna yoba swara ta Neno yo, dikrio. I siragl pre ene Neno swara kaima heven ibo moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Te, yoba ta ene Yaglno Kade yo dibi, ene ama mane dinaiglkwa. I siragl pre na God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglka i, swara ene Yaglno Kade moglka. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Ba ene meglmara suna i, yoba ta kade moragledi pran, ye u ene mudu niglno kogono yoba mere yegl morabuka paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Yoba ta ye mogl mitna edenabuka i, God ye ake atne edenabuka. Te, yoba ta mogl atne edenabuka i, God ye ake mitna edenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba mabunono kide di poglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mak 12.40</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:39-52">Luk 11.39-52</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20.47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13-14" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba meglkwa i, ene ka didre, mabunono erimara u swara pikrukwa yoba meglkwa. God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabara dua yomara i, ene yogugl teigwa. Enene suna pi dinamnedi ersre, te yoba ama pi dinaiglmedi erikwa pre ene yubun podo inaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Ene God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba meglkwa i, ene ka dimara ya mabunono u swara pikrukwa yoba meglkwa pre ene yubun podo inaiglkwa. I siragl pre ene mudi nigl ya dumo makan bage bage wandre, yoba swara ta u Juda panabedi dokigwa. Dokigo, ye u Juda yoba ogwa igne, ene ye ere i doga denabuka yoba mere yegl edigwa. Ene yoba kide meglkwa ba ene yoba i, ere i yoba kide kaima moraiglmedi edimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Ene meglkwa i, yubun podo inaiglkwa. Ene yoba gumuglno kin yogwa i, konbauna obuno di tomne digwa ba ene gumuglno ama kin yogwa paugwa. Ene yoba ka beke tedre, yegl digwa, Ene kano gigledi panabedi God yugumo kagie daglsre, kaima diwe didre, dinere eratno mo erekratnga i, aglau ta paikrume digwa ba siragl ta gol mina bekigwa God yugumo yugugl yogwa i, kagno mina kano gigledi panabedi kaima diwe dinatnga i, kano gigle dugo, kaima eratnga pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Ene ka yegl beke teimara i, gumuglno kin yogo, du ere digwa paugwa. Gol God yugumo yugugl yogwa i, taragl podo yomo mo yugumo taragl podo yome? God yugumo i ta yeikran, gol yugugl yogwa i, kogonmo wakai ta paikrabuka.<verse eid="MAT 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Te, ene ama yoba ka beke teimara i, Ene kano gigledi panabedi tawa bogl kagie daglsre, kaima diwe dinatnga i, eratno mo erekratnga i, aglau ta paikrukwa ba taragl tawa bogl mina yogwa i, kagie mina kaima diwe dinatnga i, kaima eratnga pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Ene gumuglno kin yogwa paugwa. Yoba tawa ta yuigwa i, taragl podo yomo mo tawa bogl i, taragl podo yome? Tawa bogl i ta yeikran, tawa yuigwa i, God pre ta yeikrabuka. <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Yegl pre yoba ta ka gigledi panabedi tawa bogl kagie darabuka i, taragl kane kane tawa bogl mina yenabuka i akie pre dinabuka. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Te, yoba ta ka gigledi panabedi God yugumo kagie darabuka i, God yugugl moglkwa i akie pre dinabuka. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Te, yoba ta ka gigledi panabedi heven ibo kagie darabuka i, ye God ya God king siamo akie pre dinabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Ene God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba meglkwa i, ene ka didre, mabuno erimara u swara pikrukwa yoba meglkwa pre yubun podo inaiglkwa. I siragl pre ene siragl kebra kide kaima ede yaudo demene erukwa gaden mina paugwa i, br boglsre, swara ta i pi God teigwa wakai ersre, lo duglo bunedi prikwa ba ene yoba mabuno du ere tenaiglkwa ya God wakai kanaiglkwa i, i taragl podo paugwa ba erekrikwa. Ene taragl podo eraiglkwa paugwa i ersre, taragl kebra eraiglkwa ama eribi, i wakai panabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Ene yoba gumuglno kin yogwa i, konbauna obuno di tomne digwa ba ene gumuglno ama kin yogwa paugwa. Ene diun yage sup mina atne sugwa i, ene wakai ere kandre, akie ne dinamnedi si ple di edigwa ba bugla kamel pemgo edigwa i, ta kirikwa pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Ene God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba meglkwa i, ene ka dimara ya mabunono u swara pikrukwa yoba meglkwa pre yubun podo inaiglkwa. Ene kap ya dis meda nigl keglkwa ba deglbi suna yogwa i, nigl kogl koko edekrikwa. Na diga i, ene ogono nagino meda yogwa i, yoba wakai yomedi kanigwa ba ene deno muduno atne i, mabuno kide kau sugo, ene taragl kane kane bubuno goglsre, yoko mogl, ame wakai keme dinamnedi prikwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Ene Farisi yoba gumuglno kin yogwa paugwa. Kap atne yogwa i, ene komono kana nigl edibi, kap meda yogwa i, ama deglbi yekrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Ene God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba meglkwa i, ene ka dimara ya mabunono u swara pikrukwa yoba meglkwa pre yubun podo inaiglkwa. I siragl pre ene meglkwa i, ene gigl pene tebe ekin teigwa mere yegl meglkwa. Gigl pene tebe ekin teigwa ba atne kra ime yoba yobro ya targl deglbi kau sugwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Kuno yegl mere, yoba ene meda kanigwa i, yoba du meglmedi kanigwa ba ene deno muduno suna ime mabuno kibi ya God lomo si biglke digwa mabuno i, kau sumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Ene God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba meglkwa i, ene ka dimara ya mabunono u swara pikrukwa yoba meglkwa pre yubun podo inaiglkwa. I siragl pre ka kep yoba ya yoba du okna meglkwa i, ene ye giglno pene yomara i, yugu kedre, ekin tedre, ersre, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />yegl digwa, No okna nenoma meglkwa igne akie muna, no ye bogl akie ka kep yoba i ta si goglkrumgo we digwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ba yoba ka kep yoba okna ibo si geglkwa i, ene no nenoma meglme dimara i mina enene si geglkwa yoba gawanoma muniwe didre, ama yegl mere si geglkwa yoba mune digwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Te, ene kawanoma mabuno kide erimere mere yegl, ene ere ede okna enaiglkwa pai moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Ene toki kide meglkwa. God ka tage noro, doga mina ede dinabedi, teke ebi, kuno erabo? Kuno ta erekrabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Ene mabunono kide i, ere kodianiglkwa pre ene meglmara yoba tau dedenaglka. Dedenaglka i, ka kep yoba ya, yoba nomane podo paugwa ya, ka mabuno beke tenaiglkwa yoba akie dedenaglka. Dedibo, ene ere mogl, ere kide ere tenaiglkwa. Tau ede prak mina si goglsre, tau ka mabuno yuguno yugugl dunai sidre, tau ye dumo ta moraiglmara i, ene sika si, sinamnedi eribi, ye dumo i kide kodo, ede dumo ta pidre, ta pidre, eraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ene yegl eraiglmara i mina God yobama si gogl ede wimara i, ene mabuno mere mogl, yubun podo inaiglkwa. God kamo kep yoba ta komono kana si geglkwa i, Abel si geglkwa. Yoba Abel si goglsre, God kamo kep yoba tau mere si gogl wimara i, okuo kaima yagl Sekaraia, ye tawa bogl yomara ya God yugumo yomara suna i moglko, yoba ye si geglkwa ba ene kaima mabuno kama si moraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga, yugobuno erme meglkwa i, God topo kide mudu i, ene tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Jerusalem yoba mitno goglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13.34-35</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:41-44">19.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Jisas yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Aiya, ene Jerusalem yoba meglkwa i prio, God kamo kep yoba God ene meglmara dedugwa i, ene si goglsre, tau kobuglo mina si geglmiwa. Te, na ege mere ene suglno moragledi prisre, koduagle mam ye nagiglema kugl bogl tedre, suglno wakai moglmere mere eragledi erika ba ene mane di narikwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Prio, ene erme dumono wau yenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Na ene di teiga, na ta kankre, ebi, ene God di tedre, Yoba ta Yagl Kade kagie mina ugwa i, ere wakai ere to!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.26</char></note> dinaiglkwa ege i mina aglke kor dagl na kanaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yoba tawa teigwa yugu ere kide eraiglkwa i pre Jisas dugwa<figure style="fig" alt="Temple" file="lb00250b.tif" size="span" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="24.0" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mak 13.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Ana Jisas ye tawa teigwa yugu yomara kide kodo, ede meda ogo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl tawa teigwa yugu yomara yugu wakai wakai keigwa i, Jisas kanabedi obuno di teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Obuno di teigo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene yugu magigl kan digwa i, okuo yoba udre, yugu i si gurdi atne edibi, kobuglo swara ta kobuglo ta yenabara tebe ta yeikrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yubun podo podo okuo plau dinaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mak 13.3-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Ana Jisas ede muglo meglbi Muglo Oliv we dimara pi ame di moglko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yoba ta pre dinaiglmedi ugl mage ere pi kira pogl, yegl di prikwa, Tisa yo, taragl yegl mere plau dinabe dinga i, aunake plau dinabe? Te, no siragl taragl kandre, ene unatnga igne i umedi prisre, ege erme munga i, dudunabuka magigl erumedi pramne? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yegl digo, Jisas yegl dugwa, Yoba ta ene bakagl te dinaiglmedi kan kun erio. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />I siragl pre yoba tau mere na kagna mina udre, Na Krais moliwe didre, yoba mere bakagl tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Te, yoba tau kuda beglme dibi, prisre, kuda yegl yegl plau dinarume dibi, ene ama praiglkwa ba ene kudugl goglkrio. I siragl pre taragl yegl mudu plau dinaiglkwa paugwa ba taragl pra pra dudunabuka ege i, okuo kaima unabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Kantri ikne ikne kuda beglbi, te, king ikne ikne ama kuda boraiglkwa. Imem podo podo unan, bage tau kidan podo kaima panaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Taragl yegl mere mudu plau dinaiglkwa i, abu ta gak kuragledi mabuno bogl gagie giugl prumere mere yegl mere panabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Igne i, yoba ene gudu i pi yoba pere ogono mina yedre, ene ama si goraiglkwa. Te, ene na kagna mina kogon eraiglmara i pre yugobuno mudu meglkwa i, ene kide kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Yegl panan, yoba mere na pre mediglkwa i, yage sidre, agroma abaroma tau i pi kuda ikne ogono mina yedre, ikne ikne kide kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Te, ka kep yoba kibi tau mere ede nogugl udre, yoba mere bakagl tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Te, igne i yoba God lomo kide kodinaiglkwa mabuno i, u podo enan, yoba mere God deno muduno teigwa i, dudunabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Ba yoba ta adigl gigledi mogl enan, ege kide i dudinan, God ye ere inabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Te, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka ka wakai i, ede yoba yugobuno pere pere u koglo koglo meglmara enan, mudu praiglkwa paugwa. Ye pre kodibi, taragl mudu dudunabuka ege i, okuo ime unabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba dumo Jerusalem ere kide ere tenaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mak 13.14-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ka kep yagl Daniel okna ka boglkwa i, taragl ta God gumuglo mina kide kaima yogo, taragl mudu ere kide erabuka God yugumo mina bodugl padiglbi, ene kanaiglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daniel 9.27, 11.31, 12.11</char></note> (Prio. Yoba ta ka magigl paugwa kerenatnga i, pre pogl suo!) <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Ana ege i, yoba ta distrik Judia suna moraiglkwa i, ye teke ede muglo paimara ebi, <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />yoba yugu idaule moraiglkwa i, ye taragl ta yugugl yenabuka ikre, tabre teke ede ebi, <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Te, yoba kaya mokna ere yaiglmara kogon ere meglkwa i, ede ikne u kugugl gaglno wakai inamnedi erekre, mudu teke edenaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Igne i, abu ta dano panabuka mo gak kebra am te moraiglkwa i, mitno erabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ene teke ede enaiglkwa ege i, ir erabuka ege yei dinabedi kamage ersre, wakan kade ege ama yei dinabedi kamage erio dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Igne i, yubun podo kide kaima plau dinabuka. God dumo makan ere yogwa igne, ede u erme pra, yubun yegl mere ta plau dikrukwa. Te, okuo ama yegl ta plau dikrabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ege kide plau dinabuka i, God tabre ta ere i sugunagle edekran, yoba mudu goraiglkwa mere yegl panabuka pre ye ere i sugunagle edenabuka. Ba ye yoba tau kere igrawa we di prisre, ege i, ere i sugunagle edenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Ege i, yoba tau ene yegl di tenaiglkwa, Ene kanio! Krais magigl i moglmiwe didre, Ye bage ta iro moglmiwe dinaiglkwa. Ba ye yegl dibi, ene ye pre mediglkrio. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />I siragl pre yoba ka kibi didre, Krais muniwe dinaiglkwa i, mere unaiglkwa. Te, ka kep yoba kibi meglkwa i, mere udre, kimagl ya diu podo ere, yoba bakagl tenaiglkwa. Te, ta kuno eran, God yoba ta kere i pere edugwa meglkwa i, ama bakagl tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Ene prio. Na erme eglke pai moglko, siragl taragl okuo plau dinabuka i, ene di te kodiga. <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Yegl pre yoba ta ere mogl, Prio! Krais dumo wau yomara suna moglmiwe dinaiglkwa i, ene pi kankrio. Mo, ye ere mogl, Ye yugugl teke moglme ta dibi, ene ye pre mediglkrio. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />I siragl pre na ede ikne unaglka igne, na nogugl wibo, yoba kanaiglkwa. Kamun tai dumo swara keme sidre, pogl dugo, kamun kua mudu abuglage sumere mere yegl na unaglka. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Nogugl kanimere mere yegl yoba ta goran, ye ogo nagie aglo mere ta yenabara i, kua kigla u dumo i makai sidre, i nogugl edenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba Wam ede ikne unabuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mak 13.24-27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">Yubun podo kide yegl unan, mokomugl i taragl tau tabre plau dinabuka. Ade ake mim eran, ba ama abuglage sikrabuka. Kugl kuri paigwa i, yage makandigle sibi, taragl tau heven ibo gigledi paigwa i, ama piga kar dinaiglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 13.10, 34.4</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Igne i, na Yoba Wam moglka i, kamun mitna ibo plau didre, na yobuglna ya abuglagena podo paugwa i nogugl edibo, kanaiglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daniel 7.13-14</char></note> Yoba yugobuno mudu meglkwa i, na kandre, kai eraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Eribi, biugel podo ta boran, na angelona dedibo, ye ede uglo koglo koglo pidre, na yoba ta kere i pere edigo, meglkwa i, yu makai sinaiglkwa. Ye ade umara ya ade beimara pidre, te nigl bre ya nigl beye pidre, na yobanama yu makai sinaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ede fik kandre, nomane inaiglkwa ka padum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mak 13.28-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ye ka ebrie swara ta yegl di togwa, Ede fik paugwa i, poglo di prisre, nomane io. Ede fik yogagle ake wida dugo, yaudo sugwa igne, ene kandre, niga dinabuka ege i yenabiwe di primere <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />na taragl tau plau dinaiglme diga i plau dibi, ene kandre, na ede ikne unaglka igne i ede magigl u kodumedi praiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Yoba erme meglkwa i goglkre, yoko meglbi, taragl yegl mere mudu plau di kodinan, okuo goraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Kamun mitna ibo ya dumo makan dudunabuka ba na kana ta dudukre, aimadi kamun pai morabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas aunake ede ikne unabuka i, yoba ta pre kan erekrikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mak 13.32-37</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17.26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">17.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na aunake ikne unaglka i, ade kwia mo ege i yoba ta pre kan erekrikwa. Yoba ta pre kan erekriko, angelo heven ibo meglkwa i pre kan erekriko, te na God Wam moglka i ama pre kan erekrika. Na Nina ege swara i pre kan erukwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Kuno yegl mere Na Yoba Wam unaglka i, Noa egemo yomere mere yegl yenan, yoba pre kan erekraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Noa egemo yoba gun yei, kaya mokna podo nedre, abu idre, abroma yagl tedre, ere meglkwa. Ye pra munedi ere meglko, Noa ede sip yugugl ogo, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />yoba meda meglkwa i, pre kan erekre, meglko, nigl kamun podo sugwa igne, ye pre kan erikwa. Na Yoba Wam moglka i, unaglka igne, kuno yegl mere panabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ege i, yoba suo kaya mokna ere yaraiglmara kogon eribr, God swara ta auro i ede enan, ta yoko morabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Te, abu suo wit mogo akie si deduagle ere miur, God swara ta auro i ede enan, ta yoko morabuka.<figure style="fig" alt="2 Women working" file="LB00133b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="24.41" /> <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Ene Yaglno Kade aunake unabuka i, ene pre kan erekrikwa pre kwi ere molo. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Prio. Kunogl gogl yoba eduer suna unabuka i, yugu nem yagl aunake unabuka i, pre kan eruma, ye kwi ere moglsre, kunogl gogl yoba ede yugugl u dinabedi si kegl dugo. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Yegl paugwa pre ene aimadi kwi ere molo. I siragl pre na Yoba Wam moglka i, ege ta prikraiglkwa ege ikne unagliwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas nigl kogon yoba wakai ya kide pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:42-46">Luk 12.42-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Ana Jisas ka yegl didre, ka ebrie ta dugwa, Yagl kade ta ere mogl, ye niglmo kogonmo yoba meglmara suna i ta kaya mokna sugl morabedi pran, ye yoba ta kamo duglo boglsre, nomanemo wakai panabuka i kere inabuka. Kere inan, yobamo i, kaya mokna sugl mogl, pamere yubu si tedre, erabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ana nigl kogon yagl i, ye yaglmo kade kogon dedumere ere moran, ye wakai erumedi kandre, gun podo yenabedi ere wakai ere tenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Te, ye ka kaima taraglmo mudu sugl morabedi edenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Ba nigl kogon yoba i nomane kide idre, na yaglna kade tabre ukrukwa pre na gua gua eragledi pran, kide panabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />Ye yoba tau suglno moglkwa i ere sidre, spak erikwa yoba bogl kaya mokna podo akie nedre, spak eran, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />ye yaglmo kade ye ta ukrabedi prabuka igne unabuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Udre, ye duglnai ere sidre, nagie si baka dinabuka. Didre, Ene ede pi yoba ka didre, mabunono erikwa u swara pikrikwa meglmara i po! dinabuka. Dumo i, yoba kai ersre, signo gikr eraiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Abai 10-pela kan lam ere gaiglkwa ka ebrie<figure style="fig" alt="10 virgins" file="lb00318b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="25.0" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ege i, God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, yegl mere panabuka, Yagl kade ta abu inagledi bage ta pidre, eduer ede ikne unabuka mere yegl paugo, abai 10-pela ye unan, tegigl yenamnedi ken lamno idre, konbo bage sugl meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Abai 10-pela eimara i, 5-pela nomano wakai paugo, 5-pela nomano wakai paikrukwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Ana abai 5-pela ye nomano wakai paikrukwa i, ye ken lamno idre, eigwa ba ye oliv nuglo tau suru i pikrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Yegl erikwa ba abai 5-pela ye nomano wakai paugwa i, ye ken lamno gagl idre, oliv nuglo tau suru idre, ede eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Ana abai 10-pela i, pi yagl abu yugwa ikra unan, tegigl yenamnedi sugl meglko, ye tabre ukrukwa pre ye ugl guko sidre, ugl paimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Ana abai 10-pela i, ugl paigo, eduer suna yoba ta agle didre, yegl dugwa, Ene adilo! Yagl ta abu yugwa ikra umiwa! Adigl tabre pi tegigl yeo! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Yegl dugo, abai 10-pela mudu i, adiglsre, ye lamno ere wakai eriko, <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />abai 5-pela ye nomano wakai paikrukwa i, ye abai nomano wakai paugwa i, yegl di teigwa, No lamno goginamnedi erikwa pre ene oliv nuglo yuigwa i, tau suru norio digwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Yegl digwa ba abai nomano wakai paugwa i, ere mogl, yegl digwa, No oliv nuglo yumga i, ene pre ya no nono pre akie ta yukrumniwa. Ene ede pi yoba oliv nuglo topo beglmara pidre, topo sio digwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Yegl digo, ye oliv nuglo doko ede eigo, yagl ta abu yugwa ikra ugo, abai 5-pela ake kun ere meglkwa i, ye bogl akie kaya mokna podo keimara ede yugugl eigwa. Ede yugugl eigo, yagl i yugu dua yoguglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Dua yoguglko, abai 5-pela oliv nuglo dokidre, ikne u agle didre, yegl digwa, Yagl kade yo, yagl kade yo, no umniwa. Ene dua yauro noro! digwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Yegl digo, yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, na ene kankrika wimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Kuno yegl mere na aunake unaglka i, ene ege ya ade kwia pre kan erekrikwa pre kwi ere molo, di Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kogon yagl 10-pela mige imere ka ebrie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, I siragl pre God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i, ama yegl mere pame dinaglka. Yagl ta ede bage ta enagledi ersre, yene nigl kogonmo yoba agle dugo, wigwa. Wigo, ye yoba i na taraglna sugl mogl naraiglmedi yubu si togwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Ye migemo yubu si togwa i, nigl kogon yagl swara swarade kogon siragl mere eribi, kuno erabuka i pre kodidre, yubu si togwa. Ye nigl kogon yagl swara ta mige 5,000 mere yegl tedre, swara ta 2,000 tedre, swara ta 1,000 tedre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Ede ogo, tabre yagl ta mige 5,000 yugwa i, ere mogl, kwia 5,000 koglo i tebe ede yugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Kuno yegl mere yagl ta mige 2,000 yugwa i, ere mogl, kwia 2,000 koglo i tebe ede yugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ba nigl kogon yagl ta mige 1,000 yugwa i, ye Yaglmo Kade migemo silva i, i pi maugl sumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Ana ye yaglno kade tau kanana wan mogl, aglke ikne udre, ye kogon siragl mere erikwa i, di naraiglmedi agle dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Agle dugo, nigl kogon yagl ta mige 5,000 yugwa i, ye mige 5,000 kia yugwa i yudre, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade yo, kano. Ene mige 5,000 natnga i mina na mige 5,000 aglke kor i tebe ede padigl, i wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Yegl dugo, ye yaglmo kade i, ye yegl di togwa, Wakai etniwa. Ene nigl kogon yoba wakai moglsre, taraglna sugl wakai motnga. Na taragl kebra ta ene teiga i, ene sugl wakai motnga pre na erme taragl podo ene sugl moratnedi tenaglka. Na ene bogl akie gun podo yenabugliwa. Wo, dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Yegl dugo, nigl kogon yagl ta mige 2,000 yugwa i udre, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade yo, kano. Ene mige 2,000 natnga ikra mina na mige 2,000 aglke kor i tebe ede padigl, i wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Yegl dugo, ye yaglmo kade i, ye yegl di togwa, Wakai etniwa. Ene nigl kogon yoba wakai moglsre, taraglna sugl wakai motnga. Na taragl kebra ta ene teiga i, ene sugl wakai motnga pre na erme taragl podo ene sugl moratnedi tenaglka. Na ene bogl akie gun podo yenabugliwa. Wo di, yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Ana okuo nigl kogon yagl ta mige 1,000 yugwa i, udre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene ede enga igne, na prika i, ene yagl gigledi moglsre, yoba taraglno idre, yoba pere toglno mina ene kaya mokna ama singa yoba motnga <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />pre na kudugl gogl, migenen i pi, maugl siga. Kano, ene mige natnere kuno mere te ikne ediwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Nigl kogon yagl i yegl dugo, ye yaglmo kade di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene oglka ersre, nigl kogon yoba wakai ta moglkitniwe dugwa. Ene pitnga i, yoba pere taragl tau yeigwa i, na idre, yoba pere kaya mokna ere yaiglkwa i, na si yumedi pitnga paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Na yegl moglmedi pitna, ene migena i pi beng edingo. Ene yegl etna, na migena kia bogl igo we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Yegl didre, yoba tau magigl adigl meglkwa i yegl di togwa, Ye kide erukwa pre mige 1,000 ake moglkwa i, ene idre, yagl ta 10,000 akumara i tebe ede teo dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />I siragl pre yoba taragl tau mere kan neigwa i, na tau ama i tebe ede tebo, ye taragl mere inaiglkwa. Ba yoba ta taragl tau mere kan nekrikwa i, ye taragl kebra ta ake moraiglkwa i ama i eglke edenaglka. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Te, nigl kogon yagl ta kogon wakai erekrukwa i, ene si meda edibi, ye meda mim erumara morabuka. Meda i, yoba kai ersre, signo gikr eraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye yoba kot ere tedre, i pere pere edenabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />Ana Jisas yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, abuglagena mina plau didre, angelonama bogl mudu akie umun, na abuglagena mina moglsre, sia king mina ame di moraglka. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Ame di moglbo, yoba yugobuno mudu meglkwa i, u na moraglmara makai sinaiglkwa. Makai sibi, sipsip sugl moglkwa yoba ta sipsip i pere edidre, meme i pere edumere yegl na yoba i pere pere edenaglka. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Yoba sipsip mere yegl ta moraiglkwa i, ogona wo kra adigl meglbi, te meme mere yegl ta moraiglkwa i, ogona koda kra adigl moraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Adigl meglbi, na king mogl, yoba na ogona wo kra adigl moraiglkwa i, yegl di tenaglka, Ene meglkwa i, na Nina ede di wakai yei tomiwa. Te, ye ene kingno morabara dumo i, ye dumo makan ere yeikrukwa igne, ene dumo i wakai kaima moraiglmedi padiglsre, ere wakai ere yogwa. Yegl pre ene ede suna u taragl wakai wakai inaiglmiwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />I siragl pre na okna kidan goglko, ene kaya mokna narikwa. Te, na nigl goglko, ene nigl kogl narikwa. Na dumo ta nem moglko, ene na i yugugl edigwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Na kuguglna gaglna yeikruko, ene kugugl gagl narikwa. Kide na sugo, ene u na kanigwa. Te, na kane yugu paigo, ene na moglmara wimiwe di, yegl dinagle dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Ana na yegl dibo, yoba du moraiglkwa i, di ikne ede yegl dinaiglkwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene aunake kidan goglngo, no kandre, ene kaya mokna tomga pre dine? Te, aunake nigl goglngo, no kandre, nigl kogl tomne? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ene aunake dumo ta nem moglsre, ungo, ene i yugugl edumne? Te, aunake ene kugugl gaglnen yeikruko, no kugugl gagl tomne? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Te, aunake kide ene sugwa mo ene kane yugu pai motngo, no u kamne? dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Yegl dibi, na king moraglka i, yegl dinaglka, Na ene kaima di teiga, na agrama meglmara suna i, ene yoba swara ta, yoba kade mo yoba yoko kaima ta moglkwa i pra, ake ple di teigwa igne, ene na ake ple di narimiwe di, yegl dinaglka.<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Te, yoba ta ogona koda kra moraiglkwa i, na yegl di tenaglka, Ene meglkwa i, God ene di kide yei togwa. Yegl pre ene na moglmara kide kodo, doga aimadi domara pio! God ye doga aimadi dogwa ere yogwa i, ye Satan ya murubuglo kide duglo beglkwa i, denaiglmedi ere yogwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />I siragl pre na kidan goglko, ene kaya mokna narekre, te, na nigl goglko, ene nigl kogl narekrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Na dumo ta nem moglsre, wigo, ene na i yugugl edekrikwa. Na kuguglna gaglna yeikruko, ene kugugl gagl narekrikwa. Te, kide na sugwa igne ya kane paiga igne, ene u na ta kankrimiwe dinaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Ana na yegl dibo, yoba i di ikne ede yegl dinaiglkwa, Yagl Kade yo, Ene aunake kidan goglsre, nigl goglsre, etngo, no kandre, ene ake ple di tekrumne? Ene aunake dumo ta nem moglsre, unga mo kuglnen gaglnen yeikrukwa mo kide ene sugwa mo ene kane yugu pango, no kandre, ene ake ple di tekrumne? dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Yegl dibi, na di ikne ede, yegl dinaglka, Na ene kaima di teiga, na yobana swara ta yoba yoko kaima ta morabuka i, ene ake ple di tekrikwa igne, ene na ake ple di narekrimiwe di, yegl dinaglka.<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Yegl dibo, yoba i na moglmara kide kodo, ye yubun aimadi inaiglmara enaiglkwa ba yoba du meglkwa i, ye aimadi kamin kor moraiglmara enaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Yoba kade wagle Jisas si goramnedi konbo dokigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mak 14.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jon 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Ana Jisas ka mudu i di kodidre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />Nono ege suo mun, ege kade ta plau dinabuka i, ene prikwa. God ye okna ibo Israel yoba oglo sugwa ege ikra plau dinan, yoba ta na Yoba Wam moglka i, i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenan, ye na si goraiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Igne i tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya te, Juda yoba yobano kade u tawa teigwa yoba bitno yagl ta moglkwa, kagie Kaiafas we digwa i, kipamara togl suna akie makai sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Ye makai sidre, Jisas siragl mere ugl mage ere, si akidre, si goraiglmere pre ka di keglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ba ye digwa i, ege kade yoba makai sinaiglkwa igne Jisas ta si kane sikramga paugwa. Ta si kane sumun, kowai yoba kide prisre, kuda eramnedi eribi, i kide panabiwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abu ta kugo nuglo ta demene wakai erukwa toide Jisas bre mina edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mak 14.3-9</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Jon 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Ana Jisas dumo Betani moglsre, ede pi yagl ta kagie Saimon we digwa i, kipamara yugugl ogwa. Yagl Saimon i, okna sik leprosi paugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Ana Jisas kaya mokna nenagledi ame di moglko, abu ta nigl migi kobuglo mina bekigwa ta idre, ugwa. Nigl migi atne i, kugo nuglo ta demene wakai erukwa moglkwa. Te, kugo nuglo i, mige podo boglkwa. Ana abu i, ede Jisas moglmara u kugo nuglo toide bre mina edugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Toide bre mina edugo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl kandre, kide pre, yegl digwa, Abu i, kugo nuglo yoko toide yar edugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Ye kugo nuglo i pi mige boglma, mige podo imna, mige i pi goduglme yoba tomgo we digwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i, yegl digwa ba Jisas ye ka siragl mere digwa i, pre kan ersre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene siragl pre abu i yubun teime? Ye mabuno wakai ta ere narukwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Goduglme yoba ene meglmara ege ege moraiglkwa ba na ene bogl aimadi akie moglkramga. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Abu i, kugo nuglo yu toide ogona nagna mina edugwa i, na maugl sinaiglkwa pre erukwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Te, na ene kaima di teiga, yoba ta na kana wakai i pi uglo koglo koglo dinaiglmara i, ye abu i erumere i ama yoba boglo kugl tebi, poglo di praiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas ere mogl, Jisas i pi kuda ikne ogono mina yenagle dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mak 14.10-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Ana igne i Judas Iskariot, ye Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela meglmara i swarano ta moglkwa, ye ede tawa teigwa bitno yoba meglmara pidre, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />yegl dugwa, Na Jisas yu ene ogono mina yebo, ene siragl naraiglme? dugwa. Yegl dugo, mige silva 30-pela teigo, <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Judas ye ege wakai ta yenan, Jisas auro yu kudamo ikne ogono mina yenagledi sugl moglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl kaya mokna neigwa<figure style="fig" alt="Last supper" file="LB00320b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="26.16" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mak 14.12-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22.7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">22.21-23</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jon 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Ana Juda yoba brit yis edekre, gagl neigwa ege i, yogo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ye moglmara udre, yegl digwa, God Israel yoba oglo sumedi pre moramnedi kaya mokna nenamga i, no dumo aglo mere ere wakai ere tenamne? digwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, Ene ede taun suna ebi, yagl swara ta moran, kanaiglmiwe dugwa. Yagl i yegl di tenaiglkwa, No tisano yegl dugwa, na egena ede magigl umiwa. God Israel yoba oglo sumedi pre moramnedi kaya mokna nenamga i, na duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ene kana nenamnedi priwe dume dio dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ye dumere ersre, kaya mokna nenaiglkwa ere wakai erikwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Ana min paugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela bogl kaya mokna nenamnedi ame di meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Ame di mogl, kaya mokna ne meglko, Jisas ye yegl dugwa, Ene kaima di teiga, ene swarano ta na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl deno muduno yubun podo dogo, ye swara swarade Jisas di pre, Yagl Kade, na pre ta din we di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, ye na bogl akie bret idre, sup swara mina si bai, nobuluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Na Yoba Wam moglka i, God kamo dumere yegl na kaima goraglka paugwa ba yagl ta na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, ye yubun podo inabuka. Ye mam ye ta kuglkruma, wakai paugo we dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Jisas yegl dugo, Judas kuda ikne ogono mina yenabuka yagle yegl dugwa, Neno Yagle, na pre ta din we dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, Ene dinga i, kaima diniwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yoba bret ya nigl wain togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mak 14.22-26</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk 22.15-20</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Korin 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl kaya mokna ne meglko, Jisas bret ta idre, God di wakai yei te, bret i ake buko dugwa. Ake buko di, ye swara swarade nenaiglmedi tedre, yegl dugwa, Bret i idre, neo. I na nagna mere yegl yomiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Ana Jisas kap ta wain nuglo atne moglkwa ama idre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba nenaiglmedi tedre, yegl dugwa, Kap swara i mina mudu neo. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />I siragl pre wain nuglo i, na bormaina mere yegl yomiwe dugwa. Na ene yoba mere kumapno tenagledi bormaina suru ede meda edibo, God ka kaima ta okna di te paduglkwa ikra, ka kaima plau dinabuka. Plau dinan, ene tadaglmeno ama gugl ede tenabuka. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Te, na ene di teiga, Na erme nigl wain nekre mogl ebo, na Nina yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka egemo yenan, nono akie suna moramga igne, nono aglke kor akie nenamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl giglage kaima ta didre, yugugl ta meglmara i kide kodo, ede muglo Oliv we dimara eigwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Pita di te, Ene na pre kan erekriwe dinatne dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mak 14.27-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jon 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Ege i Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Erme eduer ene mudu mokono nare, ede pere pere enaiglkwa. Ebi, God kamo okna beglkwa i, kaima plau dinabuka. God kamo bage i yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">Na sipsip sugl moglkwa yagl i sibo, sipsip mudu ede pere pere enaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sekaraia 13.7</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 26:31">dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Yegl dugwa ba na adigl u kor enaglka igne i na ede okna u distrik Galili moglbo, tegigl yenamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Jisas yegl dugo, Pita ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yoba mudu ene mokono tebi, tenaiglkwa ba na kaima ene mokona tekraluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, erme eduer koduagle kumugl wi ta sikran, ege suota na ye ta kankriwe dinatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Dugwa ba Pita kor dagl yegl dugwa, Na ene bogl akie gorabuglka mere panan, gorabuglka ba na kaima ene mokona ta tekraluwe dugwa. Pita dumere yegl Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl mudu ama yegl digwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dumo Getsemani pidre, kamage erukwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mak 14.32-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede pi dumo ta Getsemani we dimara eigwa. Eigo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Ene magigl i, ame di molo. Na ede ido pidre, kamage ere moragle dugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Gethsemane" file="hk00353B.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="26.36">Dumo Getsemani muglo tebe yogo, ede oliv mere paigwa</figure> <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Ye yegl didre, Pita ya Sebedi wam suo keme auro idre, ede ido ogwa. Ede ido pidre, Jisas kide kaima prisre, dem muduo yubun podo kaima dogwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Yegl eruko, ye yagl suota i, yegl di togwa, Na dena muduna yubun podo dogo, na goraglka mere yegl paugwa. Ene magigl i ugl paikre, sugl wakai ere meglbi, moramniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Yegl didre, kuri ta ede iro pi yage mage di, makan mina emine ere, kamage ere, yegl dugwa, Nina yo, na nigl kide ta kogl nedre, ibun inaglka i, konbauna ta yenan, i eglke ede naratnedi prika. Ba na nana primere ta erekraglka. Ene pitnere eraluwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ana Jisas kamage yegl ere kodidre, ede u ye duglo beglkwa yagl suota meglmara udre, kanugwa i, ye ugl pai meglko, kanugwa. Kandre, Pita yegl di prukwa, Ene aua swara keme kor meglbi moramga i, kuno ta erekrumo? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Yagl kide ene kinano si dinabedi kor mogl, kamage ere, ugl paikrio. Ene nomano mina wakai eramnedi prikwa ba ene ogono nagino mina yobuglno paikrumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Jisas yegl didre, ege namba 2 ede ikne pidre, kamage ere, yegl dugwa, Nina yo, na nigl kide ta kogl nenaglka i, i eglke ede naratnga ta kuno eran, pra. Ba ta manan, ene pitnere panabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Yegl didre, aglke kor u kanugwa i, ugl pai meglko, kanugwa. Ye ugl podo geglkwa pre ugl paigwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Ana Jisas u kandre, aglke ede ikne pi ege namba 3 kamage erukwa. Ye okna kamage erumere ikra aglke kor dagl erukwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ye kamage ere kodidre, ede u ye duglo beglkwa yagl suota meglmara yegl dugwa, Ene ugl kanana siragl eruko paime? Prio. Ege ikra u kodugwa. Yoba ta na Yoba Wam moglka i, i pi tadaglme yoba ogono mina yei kodumiwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Ene adigl ede wio. Yagl ta na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, uma, kanio dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas ye Jisas kudamo ikne auro yugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mak 14.43-50</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Jon 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47-48" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di moglko, yoba mere bainet ya kuba ki akidre, wigwa. Wimara suna i, yagl Judas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela meglmara swarano ta moglsre, Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yenabuka yagl ikra akie wigwa. Te, yoba wigwa i, yagl kade wagle tawa teigwa bitno yoba ya Juda yoba kade dedigo, wigwa. Ana Judas komono kana ye di tedre, Na yoba ta pauna si nenaglka i, yoba i moglmedi kandre, ye si ake gi dinaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:47-48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Ana yagl Judas i yoba tau mere bogl akie wigo, yagl i tabre ede Jisas moglmara pidre, Neno Yagle yo, ene motno? didre, ye pauna si nogwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yegl eruko, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Na kabaglena, ene ta eragledi unga i, ero dugwa. Yegl dugo, yoba wigwa i, tabre Jisas ake gi di mogl, si kane sigwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Si akigo, yagl swara ta Jisas bogl akie meglkwa i, bainetmo i meda edidre, tawa teigwa bitno moglkwa i, niglmo kogonmo yagl ta kina si bugl di edugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yegl eruko, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene bainetnen ikne edo. Yoba ta bainet ake moglsre, kuda eraiglkwa i, ye ama bainet mina goraiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Ene siragl we di pitne? Na Nina agle dibo, ye angelo mere kide 12,000 mere yegl dedenan, u na kudana erekraiglmedi pitno? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ba na yegl ta erekraglka. I siragl pre na taragl yegl eribo, God kamo siragl yegl mere plau dinabe dugwa i, kaima ta paikrabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Jisas yegl didre, ye kan ake te, yoba ye si kane sinamnedi wigwa i, yegl di togwa, Na kunogl gogl yoba ta moglko, ene bainet ya kuba mina na si akenamnedi wimo? Na tawa teigwa yugu yomara ege ege mogl, yoba ka beke te moglka ba ene na si akekrikwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ba siragl erme plau dugwa i, God kamo kep yoba okna beglkwa i, mogo korabedi pre plau dumiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yoba mudu ye kide kodo, teke ede eigwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba kade Jisas kot ere teigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mak 14.53-65</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">22.63-71</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Jon 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Ana Jisas si kane sigwa i, ye ake i pi Kaiafas, ye tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, kipamara eigwa. Kaiafas kipamara i, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Juda yobano kade kwade makai si meglko, Jisas okuo yuigwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Te, Jisas auro i ede eimara i, Pita okuo mokonomugl sika si ede pi tawa teigwa bitno yagl kipamara ede togl suna eimara ede ogwa. Suna pidre, kibr nem ame di meglmara i, ame di mogl, siragl taragl plau dinabuka i, kanagledi sugl moglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ye kaunsil bogl mudu makai sidre, yoba tau kot mina ka kibi didre, Jisas aglau yegl erume dibi, si goramnedi dokigwa <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />ba yoba swara yegl mere ta doko kankrikwa. Yoba tau mere udre, ka kibi digwa ba ye Jisas aglau podo ta eran, ye si goraiglkwa mere yegl ta digo, prikrikwa. Yegl erukwa ba okuo yagl suo udre, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />yegl dibrika, Yagl i, Na God yugumo si gur di atne edidre, ege suota mina kor kenaglka i, kuno erabiwe di, yegl dugo, no prubugle dibrika.<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Ana yagl suo i, yegl dibriko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, adiglsre, Jisas yegl di prukwa, Yoba ene aglau yegl yegl etne digwa i, ene di ikne edekratno? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Dugwa ba Jisas ka swara ta di ikne edekrukwa. Di ikne edekruko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno i, Jisas yegl di togwa, Na God kor aimadi moglkwa i, kagie mina ene ka gigledi di teiga. Ene di noro. Ene God Kere Yugwa yagl moglsre, God Wam motno? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene dinga i, kaima dinga. Ba na ene di teiga, na Yoba Wam moglka i, okuo na God yobuglomo podo paugwa i ogo wo kra ame didre, kamun kua mina wibo, ene kanaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.64 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 110.1, Daniel 7.13</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Jisas yegl dugo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, yene kuguglmo gaglmo ake argla didre, yegl dugwa, Yagl i, ye God kagie ere kide ere togwa. Yoba tau udre, ye aglaumo ta di porabuka i ta paikrukwa. Ye God kagie ere kide ere togwa i, enene prikwa <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />pre ene siragl we di prime? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yoba makai si meglkwa i, di ikne ede yegl digwa, Ye si goramga i, kuno erumiwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Yoba i yegl di kodigo, yoba tau ere mogl, Jisas guma dra mina eur sidre, agl dage sidre, ogono tu mina sidre, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />yegl digwa, Ene God Kere Yugwa yagl motnga i, yoba ira ene sugwa i, ka kep ere, di pogl noro di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Jisas pre kan erekriwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mak 14.66-72</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Jon 18.15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Ana Pita yugu meda kra togl suna ame di moglko, nigl kogon abai ta ye moglmara udre, yegl dugwa, Ene ama Galili nem Jisas bogl akie meglkwa pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Yegl dugo, Pita yoba mudu gumuglnomugl mane di, Ene ka dinga i, na ta pre pogl sikriwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Yegl didre, adigl ede pi togl dra yomara moglko, nigl kogon abai ta ama udre, yoba magigl meglkwa i, yegl di togwa, Yagl i, ye kaima Jisas, dumo Nasaret nem i, bogl akie wan miuriwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Yegl dugo, Pita kor dagl ka gigledi di, yegl dugwa, Ene dinga i, na ta pre kan erekrika pre diniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Pita yegl didre, kuri ta moglko, yoba tau magigl meglkwa i, ede u Pita yegl di teigwa, Ene motnga i, yagl i duglo beglkwa yagl meglmara suna i motnga paugwa. Siragl pre ene Galili yoba ka dimere kuno diniwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Yegl digo, Pita ka gigledi didre, Na yagl i ta pre kan erekriwe dugwa. Na ka kibi ta dibo, God na ere kide ere narabiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, koduagle kumugl ta tabre wi sugwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Wi sugo, Pita ye Jisas ka dugwa ikra, pre moglkwa. Jisas ye okna yegl di togwa, Koduagle kumugl wi sikran, ene ege suota na ta pre kan erekriwe dinatniwe dugwa. Ye ka yegl dugwa i, Pita poglo di prisre, ede meda pi, kai podo erukwa.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Jisas agre i pi, Pailat moglmara eigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mak 15.1</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Jon 18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Ana tagana mogl, tawa teigwa bito yoba meglkwa i yeigo, Juda yoba kade yeigo, ye ka di koglsre, Jisas si goramniwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Yegl didre, ye Jisas kane kogl i pi gavana Pailat moglmara edigwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas ye yene wi si goglkwa<figure style="fig" alt="Judas returning money" file="cn01832b.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="27.2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Ana Judas, ye Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogo mina yogwa yagl ikra, ye Jisas si goramne digwa i prisre, aglau eriwedi pre, mige silva 30-pela yugwa ikra, te ikne ede, tawa teigwa bitno yoba meglkwa ya Juda yoba kade i, togwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Tedre, yegl dugwa, Na tadaglme ere yagl ta aglau erekrukwa i, yu ene ogono mina yeiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, No kogono paikrukwa. Enene mina pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yegl digo, Judas mige silva ikra puk si tawa teigwa yugu togl suna edidre, yene nugu mina kan si, yene wi si goglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ye mige silva ta Judas te ikne edugwa i, i pre yegl digwa, Mige i mina yoba si goramnedi topo erumga pre mige i mina God yugumo yugugl bona sidre, God kogonmo eramnedi eun, kuno erekrabiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Yegl didre, ye ka di kogl, mige i pi dumo makan ta gigl pene yenabedi topo sinamniwe digwa. Dumo makan i, yagl ta makan koglwa sin bekugwa yagl ta makanmo topo sidre, yoba pere Juda yoba moglkraiglkwa i, gigl peneno yenabedi topo sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Yegl pre makan topo erikwa i, yoba ere mogl, bormai dumo we digwa. Te, erme pra, yoba ama yegl di pai meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9-10" />Makan topo simara i mina ka kep yagl Jeremaia okna ka ta boglkwa i, pai yugwa. Ye boglkwa i, yegl boglkwa, Yagl Kade na di narumere yegl, yoba i mige 30-pela i pi yagl ta makan koglwa sin bekugwa yagl makanmo topo sinaiglkwa. Mige silva i, Israel yoba kanigwa, mige i mina yagl swara ta topo sumun, kuno erabedi kanimiwe di, yegl boglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9-10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sekaraia 11.12-13 </char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pailat Jisas kira pogl prukwa<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and Pilate" file="cn01826B.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="27.9-10" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mak 15.2-5</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23.3-5</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Jon 18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Ana Jisas ye gavana gumuglo mina adigl moglko, gavana ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene Juda yoba kingno motno? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene dinga i, kaima diniwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Yegl dugo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya Juda yoba kade ye Jisas aglau kane kane erume digo, Jisas ka swara ta di ikne edekrukwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Di ikne edekruko, Pailat ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Ye ene aglau kane kane etne digwa i, ene pitno mo prikitne? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Gavana yegl dugwa ba Jisas ka swara kaima ta di ikne edekrukwa pre ye kandre, nagie koglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pailat Jisas ede prak mina si golo dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mak 15.6-15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jon 18.39–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Ana bugla yugu swara swarade Juda yoba egeno kade i ugwa igne, Pailat ye Juda yoba taragl ta ere togwa. Ye kane yoba swara ta kagie daiglko, Pailat ye yoba i kane paikrabedi i meda edugwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Ana igne i yagl kide kaima ta kane yugu pai moglkwa, kagie Jisas Barabas we digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ege i plau dugwa pre Juda yoba tau mere u Pailat moglmara makai sinamnedi eriko, Pailat ye di pre yegl dugwa, Na yoba ira ta kane pai dinabedi i meda ede noratnedi prime? Jisas kagie ta Barabas we digwa i, i meda edenaglo mo Jisas ta, yoba ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglme digwa i, i meda edenagle? dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Siragl pre Pailat yegl dugwa i, Juda yoba kade wagle ye Jisas yoko kiam sidre, ye na moglmara edigwa pamedi prukwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Ana Pailat ye jas siamo mina ame di moglko, ye ebie ka ta kep ere dedugo, pi Pailat di teigo, prukwa. Ka yegl dugwa, Yagl du moglkwa i, ene taragl ta ere tekro. Na erme ugl kubu kanimara i, ye kandre, yubun tau mere ugl kubu mina iwe dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya Juda yoba kade meglkwa i, ye yoba mere makai simara mudu kinano sidre, yegl di teigwa, Ene gavana di te, yagl Barabas i meda ede norsre, Jisas si goglo dio! di, yegl digo, yoba i, ye nomane yegl igwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Ana gavana i, aglke kor yegl dugwa, Yagl suo miurara suna i, na yoba ira ta i meda edinatnedi prime? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye Barabas we digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Digo, Pailat ye di pre yegl dugwa, Ana yagl Jisas, ye God Kere Yugwa yagl moglme digwa i, na siragl ere tenagle? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yoba mudu i, Ye ede prak mina si goglo! digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Yoba i yegl digo, Pailat aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ye mabuno kide siragl mere erukwa pre na ye si goragle? dugwa. Dugwa ba yoba ka podo di pai moglsre, Ye ede prak mina si goglo! digwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Ana Pailat kanugwa i, ye ka dumara i, Juda yoba nomane ta ikrikwa ba kuda eramnedi eraiglkwa mere yegl kandre, nigl kogl yoba mudu gumuglno mina ogo nigl koglsre, yegl dugwa, Yagl gorabuka i, na mabuno ta moglkraglka. Enene mina pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Yegl dugo, yoba mere u makai sigwa i, yegl digwa, Yagl gorabuka i, no gagroma bogl mabuno moramga pre ka inamga panan, ka inamniwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Yegl digo, Pailat ye Barabas kane pamara i meda edidre, ye soldiamo Jisas duglnai sinaiglmedi di togo, ye duglnai sigwa. Duglnai sigo, Pailat ye i pi ede prak mina si golo dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Soldia Jisas agai gorabedi ere kide ere teigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mak 15.16-20</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Jon 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ana Pailat soldiamo i, ye Jisas i pi, gavana toglmo suna edidre, agle digo, soldia mudu Jisas moglmara wigwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Wigo, ye Jisas gaglmo gugl edidre, gagl olto ta gogl yogwa i ede teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Ede<figure style="fig" alt="Soldiers mocking Jesus" file="cn01827B.tif" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="27.29" /> tedre, kewan kagigle ake kegmane ere, king bitno gagl erimere yegl ye bre mina padigl tedre, megagle kuba ogo wo mina teigo, akugwa. Yegl ersre, ye goglkono bodugl tedre, ye agai gorabedi yegl digwa, Juda yoba kingno, no ene di wakai yei tomniwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Yegl didre, eur si ogo nagie mina ede, megagle kuba ikra idre, ye bre mina ege mere sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ana Jisas agai gorabedi ere kodidre, lap gogl ikra gugl edidre, Jisas yene gaglmo aglke kor ede ikne ede tedre, ye ede prak mina si goramnedi agre i ede meda eigwa<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede prak mina sigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mak 15.21-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jon 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ana soldia ye Jisas agre i ede taun meda eigo, yagl ta dumo Sairini nem moglkwa, kagie Saimon we digwa i, tegigl yeigwa. Ye Saimon bogl tegigl yeigo, Jisas ede prakmo i, Saimon kake tenabedi soldia teigo, kake i ede ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ye ede pi dumo ta Golgota we dimara i, plau digwa. Kagie Golgota i, mem paugwa, Bre Yobuglo dumo. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Ye dumo i udre, nigl wain tau giugl marasin bogl toide i swara edigwa i, Jisas nenabedi teigo, ye ne prisre, mane di, nekrukwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Nekruko, soldia wagle ye Jisas ede prak mina si padiglsre, ye kuguglmo gaglmo swara swarade inamnedi kas mere yegl sigwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ye yegl ersre, dumo i ame di mogl, Jisas sugl kan meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Te, Jisas ede prak mina sigwa igne, yoba aglauno bogl padigl, padigl erimere yegl, Jisas bre tebe yegl bogl padiglkwa, I Jisas, Juda yoba kingno moglmiwe di, yegl bogl padiglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Crucifixion" file="CN01841B.TIF" size="span" copy="David C. Cook" ref="27.38" />Ana ye Jisas ede prak mina simara i, kunogl gogl yoba suo ta ogo wo kra sidre, ta kodo kra akie si padiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Jisas ede prak mina pai moglko, yoba konbauna iro ya erikwa i, ye kagie ere kide ersre, bitno pia si, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />yegl digwa, Ene God yugumo si gur di atne edidre, ege suota mina kor kenagle dinga. Ene God Wam kaima motn, ene enene ere idre, ede prak kide kodo, ede atne wo! digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Kuno yegl tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i yeigo, God lomo beke teigwa yoba yeigo, te, Juda yoba kade bogl Jisas kenaglmo sidre, yegl digwa, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />Yagl i, ye yoba pere ere yugwa ba ye yene ere inabuka i, kuno ta erekrukwa paugwa. Ye Israel kingno kaima moran, erme ede prak kide kodo, ede atne wo do! Ede atne unan, no kandre, ye pre medramga. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Te, ye God pre mediglsre, Na God Wam moluwe dugwa pre God ye wakai kanan, ye ere yo do! digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Te, kunogl gogl yoba akie ede prak mina sigwa i, dimere kuno yegl Jisas kenaglmo si miurka.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas goglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mak 15.33-41</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jon 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Ana ermine, belo mere yegl, dumo magigl i mim mudu ake wai di pai mogl ogo, ade kwia 3 klok yogwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ade kwia 3 klok yogo, Jisas ka podo di, yegl dugwa, Eli, Eli, lama sabaktani dugwa. Ye ka dugwa i mabuno yegl paugwa, Na Godna, na Godna, ene siragl pre na mokon natne?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 22.1</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, yoba tau magigl adigl meglkwa i prisre, Ye ka kep yagl Elaija agle dumiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Yegl digo, ye meglmara suna i, yagl swara ta muku di ede pi giagin ta idre, wain nuglo ku erukwa tau giagin mina si bai, buko mina padiglsre, i pi Jisas moglmara bi di nenabedi togo, nogwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Nogwa ba yoba tau magigl meglkwa i, yegl digwa, Ye kanige ero! Elaija u ye ere inabo mo, nono kanamniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Ana Jisas yegl pai moglsre, aglke kor ka podo ta didre, goglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ana Jisas goglko, lap podo ta tawa teigwa yugu yugugl kra keglkwa i, mitna ibo yei, suna wom si argla di, ede ime u, i koglo koglo edugwa. Yegl eruko, imem udre, kobuglo kade kade si buko dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Yegl eruko, te yoba geglkwa kobuglo mur yeimara i, kobuglo mur tau yauruko, God yobama tau mere okna geglkwa i, ogono nagino mina adiglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Ye adiglsre, kobuglo mur kide kodo wan meglko, Jisas adigl u kor ogwa igne, ye mudu ede God taunmo, Jerusalem suna wigo, yoba tau mere ye kanigwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Te, soldia bitno yagl ta soldia tau bogl Jisas sugl kan meglkwa i, ye imem ta ugwa i prisre, taragl kane kane plau dugwa i kandre, kudugl podo gogl, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ye kaima God Wam moglmiwe digwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Ana abu tau Jisas distrik Galili kide kodidre, umara ye sika si, ake ple di teigwa i, abumo wagle i, ye eglke iro mogl, kan meglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Ye meglmara suna i, Maria ta, dumo Makdala mam moglkwa i, moglko, Maria ta, Jems ya Josep mano moglkwa i, moglko, yagl Sebedi wam suo mano moglkwa i, ama moglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ogo nagie i pi kobuglo mur yeigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15.42-47</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:50-55">Luk 23.50-55</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Ana min paugo, yagl ta mige mere kan yogwa dumo Arimatea nem ta moglkwa ugwa. Ye kagie Josep we digo, ye ama Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Yagl Josep i, ye Jisas ogo nagie inagledi pre, Pailat moglmara pi di pruko, Pailat ye soldia tau Jisas ogo nagie Josep tenaiglmedi di togo, teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Teigo, Josep ye Jisas ogo nagie idre, lap kruo pe sugwa ta mina ogo nagie wersre, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />i pi kobuglo mur atne yogwa. Kobuglo mur i, Josep yene kobuglo mina pere yogo, yoba swara ta ogono nagino atne yeikrimara yogwa. Ye Jisas ogo nagie kubuglo mur i mina yedre, kobuglo podo ta memgo yogwa i, ake nu si, kobuglo dra si kegl didre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Te, ye kobuglo mur yomara i, Maria, dumo Makdala mam moglkwa i yogo, Maria ta bogl akie ame di mogl, kanibrika.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Soldia kobuglo mur sugl kan meglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Soldiers guarding tomb" file="cn01848B.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="27.62" />Ana Juda yoba taragl tau ere wakai erikwa ege ikra dudugo, Sabat de yogo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, Farisi yoba bogl akie Pailat moglmara makai sidre, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />yegl digwa, Yagl kade yo, no erme prumga i, yagl ta yoba bakagl togwa ikra kor moglkwa igne, ye na goglsre, ege suota pai mogl, adigl u kor enaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Yegl pre no yegl di prumga, ene soldianen tau dedin, ye kobuglo mur yeimara i, sugl mogl ebi, ege namba 3 i, dudinabedi prumniwa. Ta manan, kowai ye duglo beglkwa yoba ta ugl mage ere, ye ogo nagie kunogl i pidre, yoba di te, Ye adigl u kor omiwe dibi, i kide panabuka. Yegl eribi, yagl i yoba okna bakagl togwa i, kebra dagl panabuka ba ye duglo beglkwa yoba okuo yoba bakagl tenaiglkwa i, podo panabiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Yegl digo, Pailat di ikne ede, Pra. Ene primere yegl soldia tau kobuglo mur sugl moraiglmedi i pi edio! dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Yegl dugo, ye pi kobuglo dra ta si kegl dugwa i, yoba ta ake dinaiglmedi biga kogl padiglsre, soldia tau sugl kan moraiglmedi edigwa meglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Jisas adigl u kor ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mak 16.1-10</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:1-10">Luk 24.1-10</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:1-18">Jon 20.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ana Sabat ege dudugo, Sande kamun tagenagledi eruko, Maria, dumo Makdala mam ikra Maria ta bogl Jisas kobuglo mur yeimara i, kanabugledi ubrika. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Ubriko, imem podo ugo, angelo ta heven ibo kide kodo, ede atne u kobuglo podo ta kobuglo dra si kegl digwa ikra, ake nu si eglke edidre, kobuglo bolamugl ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Angelo i, guma dra pogl dugwa i, kamun tai sugwa igne, pogl dumere yegl pogl dugo, ye kuguglmo gaglmo ama ais kruo yomere yegl, kruo kaima yogwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Ana angelo i ugo, soldia tau kobuglo mur sugl kan meglkwa i, kudugl podo goglsre, nagino nuglo di, yage sidre, yoba geglkwa pai meglmere mere yegl pai meglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Ana abu suo ede magigl ubriko, angelo yegl di togwa, Ene kudugl goglkriro. Ene Jisas ede prak mina si geglkwa i, dokibrika i, prika <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />ba ye magigl i ta moglkrukwa. Ene u ye ogo nagie yeimara i, kaniro! Ye okna dumere yegl ere, adigl u kor omiwe dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Te, ene tabre pi ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di teiro, Jisas goglkwa i, adigl u kor pidre, ede okna pi distrik Galili omiwa. Ene pi distrik Galili ye kanaiglmiwe di, yegl di teiro! Ana ka yegl mere ene di te kodiwe di, angelo i, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ana abu suo i, kudugl geglbrika ba gun podo yei, kobuglo mur yomara tabre kide kodo, muku di pi, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl di tenabugledi ede ebrika. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Ye ede pidre, Jisas tegigl yebriko, ye di te, Abu suo wakai we di togwa. Yegl dugo, abu suo u ye kagle akidre, Jisas kagie kade tebrika. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yegl eribriko, Jisas yegl di togwa, Ene kudugl goglkriro. Ene pi na agrama wagle yegl di teiro, Na ede distik Galili ena eiga. Ene u dumo i na kanaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dumiwe diro dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Soldia kobuglo mur sugl meglkwa i, ka kibi digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Soldiers being bribed" file="cn01858B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="28.11" />Ana abu suo i ede pi miurko, soldia tau ye kobuglo mur sugl kan meglkwa i, ede Jerusalem suna udre, taragl mudu plau dumere yegl tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, di teigwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Di teigo, tawa teigwa bitno yoba meglkwa i, ye Juda yoba kade bogl makai sidre, ka di kogl, mige silva tau mere yu soldia wagle tedre, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />yegl digwa, Ene yoba yegl di teo, No ugl pai mungo, ye duglo beglkwa yagle eduer u ogo nagie kunogl imiwe dio! digwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Te, ene ugl paime dibi, gavana ta pran, no ye dem muduo aragan erabedi eramga pre ene yubun ta ikraiglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Yegl digo, soldia wagle mige silva idre, yoba kade wagle di teimere yegl, yoba di teigwa. Yoba yegl di teigo, ka i wai dugo, Juda yoba mudu prikwa. Te, erme Juda yoba mudu ka i pre meglkwa.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl kogonmo eraiglmedi dedugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16.14-18</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jon 20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 11-pela meglkwa i, ye ede distrik Galili pidre, Jisas ye muglo meglbi ta enaiglmedi dedimara i eigwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ye pi Jisas kandre, ye kagie kade teigwa. Ba tau ye Jisas kaima moglmo mo di, kinano suo yogwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Ana Jisas ede magigl udre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na Nina taragl mudu heven ibo ya dumo makan mina meglkwa ya paigwa i, na bitno moratnedi narukwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Yegl pre ene ede uglo koglo koglo pidre, yugobuno pere pere meglmara i pi ye na kana duglo boraiglmedi beke teo dugwa. Beke tedre, ye na Nina God ya na ye Wam moglka i ya Mudu Murubuglo kagno mina ye nigl bugl teo dugwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Nigl bugl tedre, ka mudu ene duglo boraiglmedi beke teiga i, ye ama duglo boraiglmedi beke teo. Te, ene prio. Na ene bogl aimadi akie moramga. Ege erme munga i dudinan, okuo na ene bogl aimadi mogl pai moramniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>